<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Bijiro by'eNtumwa</book>
  <para style="toc3">Bij</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bijiro</para>
  <para style="toc1">eBijiro by'eNtumwa</para>
  <para style="mt">Bijiro by'eNtumwa</para>
  <para style="imt">NTANGIRIRO</para>
  <para style="ip">Luuka yi wayandikaga echi gitaabu ch'eBijiro by'eNtumwa. Achiyandikaga enyuma w'egitaabu chiyirikwa Mwazi Mwinja gwa Yeesu Kirisitu nk'oku Luuka aguyandikaga. Abeere ali ayandika chino gitaabu, Luuka arhonderera aha gitaabu ch'oMwazi Mwinja chahweraga, aha Yeesu achimolekaga oku bigirizwa baage enyuma z'ogufuuka kwaage.</para>
  <para style="ip">Echi gitaabu gishambeere elugulu w'akaasi ka Muuka-Mutagatiifu oku murhondero gw'echigusho ch'abemeezi. Abo bemeezi bali bantu ba Nnamahanga, kwenge Yeesu Kirisitu abachungwire. Echo chigusho ch'abemeezi Nnamahanga yi wagirhonderesaga n'okugendekera agikuza kugerera ebijiro by'eNtumwa. Entumwa, bali bantu Yeesu arhumaga omu gulu guhamiiriza byooshi elugulu waage.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ababwira oku Muuka-Mutagatiifu arhalegama ku bayandagalira ko. N'enyuma z'okubayandagalira ko, abaha emisi y'okubala byooshi bayinji elugulu wa Yeesu (Ebijiro by'eNtumwa 1.8). Luuka ayerekeene gurhe abigirizwa ba Yeesu bajiraga gukulikirana n'oku Yeesu Kirisitu abarhegekaga. Enyuma z'okuyinja kwa Muuka-Mutagatiifu, abo bigirizwa babala oMwazi Mwinja omu gihugo ch'eYerusaleema (Ebijiro by'eNtumwa 2-7), n'omu gihugo ch'eYudeeya n'ech'eSamariya (Ebijiro by'eNtumwa 8-12), na guhika enyunda zooshi z'egulu (Ebijiro by'eNtumwa 13-28).</para>
  <para style="ip">Oku murhondero gw'akaasi kaabo, baliiri babala oMwazi Mwinja oku Bayaahudi bonyine. Omu chigabi ch'ekumi, Nnamahanga ayeereka Petero oku oMwazi Mwinja guli gw'abantu booshi. Leero gurhengera mw'echo gihe, aBayaahudi n'abarhali Bayaahudi bayemeeraga Nnamahanga, bajirwa kuba haguma n'abemeezi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Haliiri Ntumwa eyirikwa Saawulo. Oyo Saawulo aliiri alwisa akaasi k'eNtumwa, analiiri alibuza abemeezi ba Yeesu Kirisitu. Aliko Nnamahanga amuhindamula n'okumujira Ntumwa ya Yeesu Kirisitu. Nnamahanga amuyirika Paawulo. Oku buzinda amurhuma kubala oMwazi Mwinja oku bantu barhali Bayaahudi. Luuka aliiri muguma omu baliiri guherekeza Paawulo omu kaasi kaage. Hali nkere ziguma ziguma Luuka ashambeere mo omu kuderha ntya: ‹‹Rhwabo››, oko kwanayerekana oku Luuka naye aliiri haguma n'abaliiri bakola akaasi haguma na Paawulo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu alaganya eNtumwa zaage Muuka-Mutagatiifu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Mkuzigirwa Teofiile,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Omu gitaabu girhanzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Echi gitaabu girhanzi chiri gitaabu cha Luuka. Kandi mu chinoola ch'eBijiro by'eNtumwa, Luuka y'eri ayandikira Teofiile. </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Luuka 1.1-4</ref>.</char></note> nayandikaga, naderhere elugulu wa byooshi Yeesu arhonderaga kujira n'okuyigiriza, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />guhika olusiku aheekagwa empingu. Embere aheekwe yo, aheereza <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">eNtumwa</char> zaage abaaga agishogere amarhegeko kugerera Muuka-Mutagatiifu.<verse eid="ACT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Enyuma z'ogufa kwage, ezo ntumwa z'achiyerekanaga ko kugerera ebimenyeeso binene yi zimenya okw'ali mugumaguma. Aliiri ababonekera omu gihe cha siku makumi mane, eyi ali abayigiriza emyaazi eyerekeere obwime bwa Nnamahanga.<verse eid="ACT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Lusiku luguma mw'amo mango, Yeesu abeere ali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">abeere ali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">omu bindi bitaabu baderhere </char><char style="it">abeere ali alya.</char> </note> haguma nabo, abarhegeka ntya: «Murharhengaga eYerusaleema, aliko mulingire yo echilagaane cha Daarha nababwiraga. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yohaana <char style="w" lemma="Bubatiizo:">abatiizaga</char> omu menji, aliko mwabo omu siku zigeeke mwabatiizwa na Muuka-Mutagatiifu.»<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu aheekwa empingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Amango eNtumwa zalichigushire haguma na Yeesu zamubaza ntya: «Nnaweerhu, ka mu chino gihe y'okola kugalulira aBaisraheeli obwami bwabo?» <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Abashubiza ntya: «Birhabalolere okumenya egihe n'ebishanji Daarha afundikire omu burhegesi bwage yenyine. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Aliko, mwayankiirira obuhashe hano Muuka-Mutagatiifu ayinja elugulu wenyu, mwanaba bahamiiriza baani eYerusaleema, <char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya">eYudeeya</char> yooshi n'eSamariya, n'omu gulu lyooshi.»<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Yeesu abeere ayuusa kuderha ebyoola binwa, eyi bachiri bamulola, aheekwa empingu n'egichu chamubisha, barhanachimubonaga ko. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Babeere bachiri baheneera elugulu eyi ali agenda, ho n'aho balume babiri bayambeere emyambalo myeeru bayimanga embere zaabo. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Baabaza eNtumwa ntya: «Mwe bantu b'eGalilaaya, girhumire mwabeera ahoola eyi muli mwalola elugulu? Oyu Yeesu wamakuulwa ahagarhi kenyu guheekwa empingu, nj'agaluka nk'oku mwabwene aja yo.»<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Entumwa zalondoola Matiyaasi gukola ahaali ha Yuuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Matayo 10.2-4</ref>.; <ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Mariko 3.16-19</ref>.; <ref loc="LUK 6:13-16">Luuka 6.13-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Enyuma z'aho, eNtumwa zagaluka eYerusaleema gurhengera oku musozi gw'eMizeyituuni. Ogo musozi guba hoofu n'eYerusaleema, lugenzi luyemereerwe kulambagirwa olusiku lw'eSaabato.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olugenzi lwalikwaneene kulambagirwa olusiku lw'eSaabato lwaliiri lwa chilomeetere chiguma.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Babeere bagaluka omu gishagala, bazamuukira omu gorofa ebusiika. Omoola mu bagendaga babeera. Mwaliiri Petero, Yohaana, Yakobo na Ndereya, Firipo na Tomaasi, Baritolomaayo na Matayo, Yakobo mugala wa Lufaayo, Simooni w'omu chigusho ch'<char style="w" lemma="Bazelooti:">aBazelooti</char> na Yuuda mugala wa Yakobo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Matayo 10.2-4</ref></char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mariko 3.16-19; Luuka 6.13-16.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Abaala booshi bagendaga basaliira n'omurhima muguma, haguma na Mariya nyina wa Yeesu, n'abandi bakazi, na beene baabo Yeesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Lusiku luguma, oluganjo lw'abemeezi balichigushire lwaliiri hoofu egana na makumyaabiri. Petero ayimanga ahagarhi kaabo n'okuderha ntya: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />«Beene beerhu, byaalihemere aMandiko mayeenere, mala Muuka-Mutagatiifu abaaga aderhere kugerera obuunu bwa <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char> elugulu wa <char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya:">Yuuda</char>.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Nanga 41.9</ref></char><char style="ft" closed="false">changwa 41.10 omu Bibuliya z'ezindi ndimi.</char></note> Oyuula Yuuda yi walongoolaga abafarhaga Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Aliiri muguma omu rhwewe, analigwerhe echigabi oku kaasi keerhu.» <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Enyuma z'okugula eshwa n'efuranga z'obuhemusi, arhoga buchuli, enda yaage yabereka n'amala maage masheeshekalira ahashi. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Abantu booshi b'eYerusaleema bamenya ogo mwazi, oku bulyo elyo shwa lyayirikwa omu lulimi lwaabo mpu lyo «Hakeledama»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hakeledama liri shwa liyinjikeene oku ziino ly'eshwa ly'omubumbi. aBadaahwa baligulaga na bila bicheri 30 by'efuranga Yuuda abagaluliraga egihe aguzaga Yeesu. aBadaahwa baaja balihindula shwa ly'oguhamba mw'abafu. Osome Matayo 27.10.</char></note>, kw'okuderha «Eshwa ly'eshagama.» <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />«Kwenge biyandikirwe ntya omu gitaabu ch'eNanga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‹Enju yaage ebe mushaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">na nta muntu oyilamage mo!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 69:26">Nanga 69.26</ref></char><char style="ft" closed="false">changwa Nanga 69.27 omu Bibuliya z'ezindi ndimi.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">N'owundi arhoole akaasi kaage!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 109:8">Nanga 109.8</ref>.</char></note>›»<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22" />«Bihemere leero, rhugishoge owindi muntu muguma w'ogurhoola akaasi kaage. Oyu muntu abe muguma w'omu bala bagendaga barhuherekeza ngasi bishanji byooshi Nnaweerhu Yeesu aliiri abalama haguma neerhu. Aba bantu baliiri haguma neerhu gurhengera amango Yohaana <char style="w" lemma="Bubatiizo:">abatiizaga</char> Nnaweerhu guhika olusiku aheekwaga gurhenga ahagarhi keerhu. Bihemere oyu muntu rhwachishoga abe haguma neerhu omu guhamiiriza obufuuke bwa Nnaweerhu.»<verse eid="ACT 1:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />eNtumwa zaaja zamoleka bantu babiri: Yozefu oyirikwa Barisaba wanashembulwaga Yusto, na Matiyaasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Baaja basaliira ntya: «Nnaweerhu, weyinji emirhima y'abantu booshi, oyeerekane nde ochishogere mw'abaala babiri, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />y'aja ahaali ha <char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya:">Yuuda</char> mw'akaala kaasi k'eNtumwa alekaga omu kuja ahantu hamukwaneene.» <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Bashaarha esimbi, nazo zarhoola Matiyaasi wayongeerwaga mu zila <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">ntumwa</char> ekumi na nguma.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Abigirizwa bayunjuzwa Muuka-Mutagatiifu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Olusiku lw'<char style="w" lemma="Dinye:">ePendekosite</char> lwabeere lwahika, abigirizwa booshi babaaga babuganeene hantu haguma. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ho n'aho bayunva olwamo gurhengera empingu luli nka lw'empuusi ekalihire, enali yahuusahuusa. Olo lwamo lwayunviikana omu nju yooshi baliyikeere mo. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Haabonekana n'ebiri nka birimi by'omuliro, byachigaba; byanaja oku ngasi muguma wabo.<figure style="fig" alt="Les disciples sont remplis du Saint-Esprit" file="DN00498b.tif" size="col" ref="2.3">Abigirizwa bayunjuzwa Muuka-Mutagatiifu</figure> <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Abo bigirizwa booshi bayunjuzwa Muuka-Mutagatiifu, banarhondera kuderha omu zindi ndimi, gukulikirana n'oku Muuka-Mutagatiifu abahaaga obuhashe b'okuderha.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Mw'amo mango, eYerusaleema haliiri <char style="w" lemma="Muyaahudi:">aBayaahudi</char> baguma bakengaga Nnamahanga, bahulukiraga omu bihugo byooshi by'egulu. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Oloola lwamo lwabeere lwayunviikana, abantu banene bachiigusha, basoomerwa bweneene bulaala ngasi muguma aliiri abayunva baaderha omu lulimi lwage lw'akaburhano. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Booshi basoomerwa, banayuumirwa, baalema baabazana ntya: «Abaala bantu bali baderha, ka booshi barhali Bagalilaaya? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Gurhe ngasi muguma weerhu y'abayunva omu lulimi lwage lw'akaburhano? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Omu rhwewe hali abarhengeere omu gihugo ch'aBapariti, ech'aBameedi na ech'aBaelaamu. Hali abalama omu gihugo ch'eMezopotamiya, ech'eYudeeya na ech'eGapadokiya, ech'ePonto na ech'eAziya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />ech'eFurigiya na ech'ePamfiliya, ech'<char style="w" lemma="Miisiri:">eMiisiri</char> n'oluhande lwa ech'eLibiya luli hoofu n'egishagala ch'eKureene. Kandi omu rhwewe hali abahiisi b'ogurhengera <char style="w" lemma="Rooma:">eRooma</char>, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />hali aBayaahudi n'abandi bayemeeraga edini ly'ekiyaahudi, aBakereeti n'aBaharaabu. Aliko rhweshi rhuli rhwabayunva baaderha omu ndimi zeerhu ebijiro by'obuhashe Nnamahanga ajirire!» <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Booshi baali basomeerwe bweneene n'okuyuumirwa, baabazana ntya: «Bichi ebiila biderhere?» <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Aliko baguma omu bo bashekera abigirizwa n'okuderha ntya: «Barhamiriire edivaayi y'omuhyo!»<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Enyigirizo za Petero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Petero aja ayimanga haguma na zila ntumwa ekumi na nguma, aderha ntya n'omulenge munene: «Mwe bantu b'eYudeeya nenyu mweshi mwe mulamire eYerusaleema, munyunvirize, munamenye bwinja ebi binwa nashonda kubabwira! <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Abaala bantu barharhamiriire nk'oku mukengereere, kwenge zichiri saa esharhu z'eseezi. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Aliko ebiila bi Nnamahanga aderhaga kugerera omuleebi Yoweeri mpu:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‹Omu siku zizinda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">nji nayandaaza oMuuka gwani oku bantu booshi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">bagala benyu n'abanyere benyu nji baleeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">emisole yenyu nji yabonekerwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">n'abashaaja benyu nji baloorha.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Neechi, mw'ezo siku, abaja baani, abalume n'abakazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">nji nabayandaaza k'oMuuka gwani, nji banaleeba.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Nji najira ebigiriginjo gurhengera elugulu omu mpingu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">n'ebimenyeeso eshiishi omu gulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">nji haaba eshagama, omuliro n'oluhomo l'omuusi.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Ezuuba nji lyahindulwa mwizimya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">n'omwezi nji gwahindulwa shagama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">embere olusiku lwa Nnaweerhu luyinje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">olo lusiku lunene, kandi l'obukuuze.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Mw'amo mango, ngasi yeeshi nji wahema oburhabaale oku ziino lya Nnaweerhu nj'achungulwa.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.17-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="JOL 3:1-5">Yoweeri 3.1-5</ref></char><char style="ft" closed="false">changwa 2.28-32 omu Bibuliya z'ezindi ndimi.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />«Mwe bantu b'eIsraheeli, muyunve ebi binwa! Nnamahanga abayeerekere bwinjabwinja oku Yeesu w'eNazareeti ali muntu arhumaga embere zenyu kugerera ebijiro by'obuhashe, ebigiriginjo n'ebimenyeeso. Nnamahanga ajiraga ebyo booshi ahagarhi kenyu kugerera Yeesu, nk'oku mubiyinji mwenyine. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Oyu Yeesu ahirwaga omu maboko menyu, nk'oku Nnamahanga ashondaga, na nka okw'amenyaga yenyine gurhengera miira. Nenyu mwamuyirhire omu kumubamba oku musalaaba, kugerera abantu babi. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Aliko, Nnamahanga nj'amufuulire omu kumulikuula omu malumwa m'olufu, bulaala birhakagalikeene ashwekwe na lo. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Kwenge <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char> aderhere ntya elugulu wa Yeesu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‹Naliiri nabona Nnaweerhu embere zaani ngasi mango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">bulaala ali ekulyo kwani yi ntashaganywa.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Cho girhumire omurhima gwani gusiimire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">n'olulimi lwani lushagalukire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">kandi omubiri gwani nago nji gwahuumukira omu bulangaalire,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />kwenge orhakandekeerera kubeera ekuzimu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">orhakanaleka oMutagatiifu waawe abola.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Wanyeerekere enjira z'akalamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">nji wanyunjuza obushagaluke embere zaawe.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.25-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Nanga 16.8-11</ref>.</char></note>»<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Petero ashuba kuderha ntya: «Beene beerhu, bihemere mbabwire bwinjabwinja ebilolere shookuluza weerhu <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char>: afiire, ahambwa n'eshinda yaage echiba eno mwerhu kugera zeene. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />N'obuula aliiri muleebi, aliyinji oku Nnamahanga amulahizizaga endahiro oku nj'ayikaza muguma omu baburhwa baage oku ntebe yaage y'obwami.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 132:11">Nanga 132.11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">2 Samweri 7.12-16</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Daawudi alibwene embere obufuuke bwa <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>, anabuderha ko ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">‹Arhalekeererwaga kubeera ekuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">n'omubiri gwage gurhabolaga.›<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Nnamahanga afuulire oyo Yeesu, rhweshi rhunali bahamiiriza boboola bufuuke. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Abeere azamuulwa ekulyo kwa Nnamahanga, Eshe amuha Muuka-Mutagatiifu walilaganyizwe. Naye arhuyandaazize ye, nk'okuula muli mwabona, munali mwayunva. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Kwenge arhali <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char> wazamuukiraga empingu, aliko yeewe yenyine aderhere ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‹Nnaweerhu Nnamahanga abwirire Nnaweerhu ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“Yikala ekulyo kwani,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />guhika amango nji naajira abanzi baawe ndabarhiro yaawe.”›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.34-35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Nanga 110.1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Leero, bihemere olubaga looshi lw'eIsraheeli lumenye bwinja oku ola Yeesu mwabambaga oku musalaaba, Nnamahanga amujirire kuba Nnaweerhu na <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>!»<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bantu hoofu bihumbi bisharhu bachunguka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Enyuma z'okuyunva ebyoola binwa, abantu baababazwa bweneene omu mirhima yaabo n'okuva baabaza Petero n'ezindi <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">ntumwa</char> ntya: «Beene beerhu, gurhe rhujirage?» <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petero abashubiza ntya: «Muleke ebyaaha byenyu, na ngasi muguma omu mwabo abatiizwe oku ziino lya Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char> yi mubabalirwa ebyaaha byenyu. Na ntyo, mwanayankiirira Muuka-Mutagatiifu nka luhembo. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kwenge echilagaane cha Nnamahanga chiri chenyu, ch'abaana benyu n'abantu booshi balamire hale; k'okuderha oku chiri ch'abantu booshi Nnaweerhu Nnamahanga nj'ahamagala.» <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Petero ashuba kubabwira ebindi binwa binene by'okubayinginga n'okubayunviisa. Alema aderha ntya: «Mugichungule gurhenga mw'echi gisisi ch'ebyaaha!» <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Abayankiiriraga ebinwa byaage babatiizwa. Oloola lusiku, hoofu bantu bihumbi bisharhu bayongeereka omu chigusho ch'abemeezi.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akalamo k'abemeezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Abemeezi bagendekera gukulikira enyigirizo z'<char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">entumwa</char>, kulama echinyabuguma, kugabaana omugati haguma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okugabaana omugati haguma: Hali amango eyi byaliiri biryo by'okuyibuka ogufa n'ogufuuka kwa Yeesu.</char></note> n'ogusaliira. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Ebigiriginjo n'ebimenyeeso binene byaliiri kujirika n'entumwa oku bulyo ngasi muguma alema ayunva obuuba. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Abemeezi booshi baliiri haguma n'ogushangiira byooshi baligwerhe. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Baliiri baguza amashwa maabo n'ebintu byaabo, n'efuranga zarhengaga mo baliiri bazigabana gukulikirana n'obulagiirire bwa ngasi muguma. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Ngasi lusiku, omu bunviikane, baliiri baaja omu <char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">Nju ya Nnamahanga</char>. Baliiri bagabaana omugati n'ogusangira ebiryo byaabo omu nju zaabo n'obushagaluke haguma n'omurhima mwinja. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Baliiri bakuuza Nnamahanga n'abantu booshi bali basiimire bo. Na ngasi lusiku, Nnaweerhu aliiri ayongeera abachungwirwe oku chigusho ch'abemeezi.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Petero na Yohaana baafumya echirema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Lusiku luguma, Petero na Yohaana baliiri bazamuukira omu <char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">Nju ya Nnamahanga</char> aha saa mwenda z'ezuuba, cho chaliiri gihe ch'ogusaliira. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Mw'ebyo bishanji, abantu baliiri baheeka omulume waburhwaga eyi chirema. Abo bantu bagendaga bamuhira ngasi lusiku hoofu n'omulyango gw'eNju ya Nnamahanga guyirikwa «Mulyango Gukwiriire» y'ahemuuze oburhabaale oku baliiri baaja mo. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Abwene Petero na Yohaana bakola baaja omu Nju ya Nnamahanga, arhondera kubahema oburhabaale. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Petero na Yohaana bamuloleereza, naye Petero amubwira ntya: «Orhulole!» <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Naye abalola, kwenge alilangaliire oku hali echi bamuha. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Aliko Petero amubwira ntya: «Ntagwerhe furanga changwa oro, aliko echi ngwerhe, nguheere cho: omu ziino lya Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char> w'eNazareeti, yimanga onalambagire!» <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Amufarhira oku kuboko kw'ekulyo, amuyimanza. Ho n'aho, ebishando byaage n'orhuzirabulongo rhwage byakomera. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Ayuumuka oku liguma, ayimanga n'ogurhondera kulambagira. Aja haguma nabo omu Nju ya Nnamahanga eyi ali alambagira, abalalabalala n'ogukuuza Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Abantu booshi bamubona ali alambagira n'ogukuuza Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Bamurhegeera oku y'olaala wagendaga ayikala halaala «Mulyango Gukwiriire» gw'eNju ya Nnamahanga guhema oburhabaale. Basoomerwa banahwerwa n'ebyamubereere.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Enyigirizo za Petero omu Nju ya Nnamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Oyo muntu abeere arhagirhengere ku Petero na Yohaana, abantu basoomerwa, balibirhira emunda bali, hoofu n'embaraza y'eNju ya Nnamahanga eyirikwa «Mbaraza ya Solomoono.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eyo mbaraza yali gorhere ahantu h'embuga ah'abarhali Bayaahudi bali yemereerwe kuyikala omu Nju ya Nnamahanga y'eYerusaleema. Osome Yohaana 10.23.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Petero abwene ebyoola, abaza olubaga ntya: «Mwe bantu b'eIsraheeli, girhumire mwasoomerera ogufuma kw'oyu muntu? Girhumire mwarhuloleereza nka rhwewe rhwe rhwalambagiriisaga ye oku buhashe bwerhu rhwenyine changwa elugulu w'ogukwanana kwerhu embere za Nnamahanga? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Nnamahanga w'<char style="w" lemma="Abrahaamu:">Abrahaamu</char>, Isaka na Yakobo, Nnamahanga wa bashookuluza beerhu, akuuzize omukozi waage Yeesu. Oyu Yeesu yi mwabo mwahaanaga mwanamulahira embere za Pilaato, n'obo yeewe abaaga amahiga kumulikuula. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Mwewe, mwalahira oMutagatiifu na Okwaneene, mwanahema babalikuulire omwisi w'abantu. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Mwayirha ohaana akalamo, aliko yeewe Nnamahanga amufuulire omu bafu; neerhu rhuli bahamiiriza bw'obo bufuuke. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Oyu muntu muli mwabona munamuyinji, eziino lya Yeesu n'obwemeezi kw'elyo ziino byo byamukomeeze. N'obwemeezi kugerera Yeesu bo bwaheere oyu muntu amagala makwiriire nk'oku mubwene.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />«Na bunoola, beene beerhu, nyinji oku mwabo n'abakulu benyu mwajiriraga Yeesu ebyoola omu buhwinja. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Na Nnamahanga ayeneeze ntya eby'abalaganyaga embere kugerera ebinwa by'abaleebi booshi oku <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char> waage alibuzwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Mujaage mwaleka ebyaaha byenyu, munagalukire Nnamahanga y'ebyaaha byenyu bibabalirwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Na ntyo, Nnaweerhu abahumuusa, n'okubarhumira Kirisitu, ye Yeesu, olaala achishogaga embere elugulu wenyu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Alikwaneene gurhanga kubeera empingu guhika amango ebintu byooshi byayeenera nk'oku Nnamahanga aderhaga miira kulengera abaleebi baage batagatiifu. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" /><char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char> aliderhere ntya: ‹Nnaweerhu, Nnamahanga wenyu, nj'abaha omuleebi warhengera omu beene benyu oli nka nyoono. Nji mwamuyunva omu byooshi nj'ababwira. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Aliko ngasi yeeshi nj'orhayunva oyo muleebi nj'achiibwa looshi omu lubaga n'okuyirhwa.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.22-23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Rhegeko 18.15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:18-19">18.18-19</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />N'abaleebi booshi, gurhengera ku Samweri n'abamukulikiraga, nabo baderhere, banabala elugulu w'emyaazi y'eziila siku rhulamire zeene. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Mwabo, muli bagala b'abaleebi n'<char style="w" lemma="Gihango:">egihango</char> Nnamahanga ajiraga na bashookuluza benyu chiri chenyu. Kwenge Nnamahanga ajiraga cho omu kubwira Abrahaamu ntya: ‹Emilala yooshi y'egulu nji yaagishwa omu gisisi chaawe.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="GEN 22:18">Murhondero 22.18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Amango Nnamahanga ahaanaga omukozi waage, arhanga kumurhuma emwenyu kubagisha, omu gukuula ngasi muguma wenyu omu mabi maage.»<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Petero na Yohaana baheekwa embere z'akabuga k'aBayaahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Petero na Yohaana babeere bachiri bayigiriza olubaga, <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abadaahwa</char>, omukulu w'abalanzi b'<char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">eNju ya Nnamahanga</char>, n'<char style="w" lemma="Basadukaayo:">aBasadukaayo</char> baahulukira. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Abo bakulu bali bakalihire okubona Petero na Yohaana bali bayigiriza olubaga n'okubala oku obufuuke gurhenga omu bafu bubonekana kugerera Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Babashweka n'okubahira omu munyororo kugera olusiku lwakulikiraga kwenge lyaliiri likola golo. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Aliko banene omu bayunvaga ezo nyigirizo bayemeera Yeesu. Oluganjo lw'abemeezi lwahikiira hoofu balume bihumbi birhaano.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Bwacheere eseezi, abakulu n'<char style="w" lemma="Bashamuka:">abashamuka</char> b'aBayaahudi, n'<char style="w" lemma="Bigiriza b'amarhegeko:">abigiriza b'amarhegeko</char> bachigusha eYerusaleema. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Baliiri haguma n'<char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">omudaahwa mukulu</char> Hanaasi, Kayaafa, Yohaana, Alegizandere n'abandi bantu booshi baliiri b'omu mulala gw'omudaahwa mukulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Bamalire kuyimanza Petero na Yohaana ahagarhi kaabo, bababaza ntya: «Oku buhashe buchi changwa oku ziino lya nde mwajiraga ebyoola?»<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Petero eyi ayunjwizwe Muuka-Mutagatiifu, ababwira ntya: «Ego mwe bakulu b'olubaga nenyu mwe <char style="w" lemma="Bashamuka:">bashamuka</char> b'aBayaahudi, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />rhubazizwe zeene elugulu w'amenja rhwajiriire echirema n'oku bulyo chafumyagwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Leero mwabo mweshi, n'olubaga looshi lw'eIsraheeli, mumenye bwinja: oyu muntu ayimangire embere zenyu n'amagala makwiriire oku ziino lya Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char> w'eNazareeti, olaala mwabambaga oku musalaaba, aliko Nnamahanga amufuula omu bafu. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yeewe y'aMandiko Matagatiifu maderhere ko ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">‹Ebaale mwabo mwe muyumbaka mwalahiraga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">lyo lyahindukire ly'engenzi, ly'okuyumbakira ko.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Nanga 118.22</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Obuchunguke burhali omu windi muntu, kwenge nta lindi ziino omu gulu abantu bahaabirwe, lyagarhuchungwire.»<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Abantu b'akabuga k'aBayaahudi babeere baabona Petero na Yohaana baderha n'oobushiru, basoomerwa, kwenge bali bayinji oku baliiri bantu konyine barhasomaga. Baanalimenyere oku boowe bo baliiri haguma na Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Aliko, nk'okuula bali babwene olaala muntu bafumyaga ayimangire eburhambi bwabo, baabula echi bagashuba kuderha. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Baava babarhegeka oku barhange barhenge mw'ako kabuga. Bala bakulu boowe basigala omu mahwe. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Baabazana ntya: «Gurhe rhujirage abaala bantu? Bulaala abantu booshi b'eYerusaleema bayinji bwinja okw'echimenyeeso chabeere kugerera bo. Rhurhakanagala kugihakana. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Aliko y'omwazi gw'echoola chimenyeeso gurhayandaala bweneene omu lubaga, rhubakalihire oku barhachiderhaga n'omuntu n'omuguma elugulu w'eziino lya Yeesu.»<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Baaja bahamagala Petero na Yohaana, banabarhegeka mpu barhachiderhaga changwa okuyigiriza chiro n'eliguma oku ziino lya Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Aliko Petero na Yohaana babashubiza ntya: «Ka bikwaneene embere za Nnamahanga oku rhubakenge ahaali haage? Mugishogage, <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />kwenge rhwabo rhurhakagala kuleka kuderha ebintu rhwabwene ko rhwanayunva.» <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Abantu b'akabuga k'aBayaahudi baashuba kubakalihira, banaja babalikuula. Barhaali babwene enjira y'okubahana, bulaala olubaga looshi lwaliiri lwakuuza Nnamahanga oku byooshi byabaaga. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Oyo muntu bajiriraga echoola kimenyeeso ch'ogufuma, aligwerhe myaaka minene ku makumi mane.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abemeezi bahema Nnamahanga abakomeze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Babeere balikuulwa, Petero na Yohaana baaja kubalira abaabo byooshi <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abakulu b'abadaahwa</char> n'<char style="w" lemma="Bashamuka:">abashamuka</char> b'aBayaahudi bababwirire. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Bamalire kuyunva eyo myaazi, booshi basaliira Nnamahanga n'omurhima muguma. Baaderha ntya: «Nnaweerhu, wooyo we wajiraga echaalege, egulu n'enyanja, na byooshi biba omu byo. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Wooyo we waderhaga ntya kugerera Muuka-Mutagatiifu, omu buunu bwa shookuluza weerhu <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char>, mukozi waawe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‹Charhumire abarhali Bayaahudi baruukura</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">n'embaga zagwarha emihigo erhagwerhe kamaro?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Abaami b'egulu bachikerekere</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">n'abakulu bachigushire haguma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">yi balwisa Nnaweerhu Nnamahanga na Kirisitu waage.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Nanga 2.1-2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Kwenge biri by'okuli oku <char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char> na Ponsiyo Pilaato bayunvikeene muno gishagala haguma n'abarhali Bayaahudi n'olubaga lw'eIsraheeli kulahira Yeesu, omukozi waawe mutagatiifu, olaala wagishogaga. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Bajiraga ntyo, yi bayeeneza byooshi wabaaga warheganyize gurhenga miira oku buhashe bwawe n'emihigo yaawe. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Leero Nnaweerhu, olole bwinja obuhambaazi bwabo, ogaliise abaja baawe okubala eChinwa chaawe buzira buuba. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Ojaage walambuula okuboko kwawe y'abantu bafume, ebimenyeeso n'ebigiriginjo bibe kugerera eziino lya Yeesu, mukozi waawe mutagatiifu.»<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Bamalire gusaliira, ahantu bali bachigushire hadirhimana bweneene, booshi bayunjula Muuka-Mutagatiifu. Barhondera kubala eChinwa cha Nnamahanga buzira buuba.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abemeezi bagabana ebikulo byaabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Abemeezi booshi baligwerhe omurhima muguma n'enkengeero nguma. Ntaaye waderhaga oku ebikulo byaage biri byaage yenyine, aliko bagendaga bashangiira byooshi bali bagwerhe. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" /><char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">Entumwa</char> zaliiri zahamiiriza n'obuhashe bunene obufuuke bwa Nnaweerhu Yeesu, n'omugisho munene gwaliiri oku bo booshi. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Nta muguma omu bo walikeneere echintu, kwenge booshi bali bagwerhe amashwa changwa enju, bagendaga babiguza, banaleerha efuranga babiguzaga. <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />Bagendaga bahira zo embere z'eNtumwa, n'enyuma zanagabirwa ngasi muguma gukulikirana n'obulagiirire bwage.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Haliiri oMulaawi muguma oyirikwa Yozefu, aliiri muburhwa w'oku chizimba ch'eGipuro. Entumwa zamushembula eziino lya Baranaaba, kw'okuderha «Muntu okomeza abandi omurhima.» <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Aguza eshwa aligwerhe, aleerha efuranga anazihira embere z'eNtumwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Hananiya na Safira barhebeka Muuka-Mutagatiifu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Haliiri mulume muguma oyirikwa Hananiya haguma na mukaage Safira. Baguza eshwa lyaabo. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Omu bunviikane, yeewe na mukaage baabisha muhango muguma oku furanga baliguzaga. Ezasigalaga, aziheeka anazihira embere z'<char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">eNtumwa</char>. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Petero amubaza ntya: «Ego Hananiya, charhumire Shetaani aja omu murhima gwawe, guhika okubeehya Muuka-Mutagatiifu omu kubisha furanga ziguma waguzaga eshwa? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Egihe eliila shwa lyalichiri lyaawe, ka lirhaliiri bikulo byaawe? Na chiro egihe lyaguzwaga, k'efuranga orhakazikoleeseze okw'oshondere? Chajaaga charhuma wakengera omu murhima gwawe echijiro chiri ntya? Arhali bantu warhebekere, sy'aliko Nnamahanga!» <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Hananiya abeere ayunva ebyoola binwa, ahena n'okuva afa. Booshi bayunvaga ogo mwazi bagwarhwa n'obuuba bunene. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Emisole yaliiri ahoola yayimanga, yarhuba omubiri gwage, yaguheeka embuga, yanaguhamba.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Hagerere hoofu saa esharhu, mukaage aja mw'eyo nju buzira kumenya ebyabeere. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petero amubaza ntya: «Ombwirage bwinja, ka kw'eyi ngulo ku mwaguzaga eshwa?» Ashubiza ntya: «Neechi, kw'eyoola ngulo.» <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Petero ashuba kumubaza ntya: «Gurhe mwagalaga kuyunviikana yi mugeregeza Muuka-Mutagatiifu wa Nnaweerhu? Ololage! Amagulu m'abahambaga balo mo mano oku mulyango. Naawe baguheeka!» <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Ho n'aho ahena embere z'amagulu ma Petero n'ogufa. Elaala misole yajiire omu nju, y'abugaana afiire. Yaheeka omubiri gwage yanaguhamba eburhambi bw'eba. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Echigusho chooshi ch'abemeezi na booshi bayunvaga ogoola mwazi bagwarhwa n'obuuba bunene.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Entumwa zajira ebigiriginjo binene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Ebimenyeeso n'ebigiriginjo binene byaliiri kujirika omu bantu kulengera <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">eNtumwa</char>. Abemeezi baliiri gushimaanana booshi omu Mbaraza ya Solomoono.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eyo mbaraza yaliiri ahantu h'embuga ah'abarhali Bayaahudi bali yemereerwe kuyikala omu Nju ya Nnamahanga y'eYerusaleema. </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="JHN 10:23">Yohaana 10.23</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Nta muntu n'omuguma orhali mwemeezi wagendaga abayegeera, aliko olubaga lwabakenga bweneene. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Abantu banene, abalume n'abakazi, baliiri bayemeera Nnaweerhu. Bagendekera kuluga bweneene. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Baliiri baleerha abalwala oku njira zigalihire, banabalyaamiza oku bishanja n'oku bipoyi, yi hano Petero agera, chiro egichuuchu chaage chigale gushukulira baguma omu bo. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Abantu banene bagendaga barhenga n'omu bishagala bitureene n'eYerusaleema eyi baheekere abalwala n'abantu bafarhirwe <char style="w" lemma="Muzimu">n'abazimu</char>. Booshi baliiri baafumywa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Entumwa zalibuzwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">Omudaahwa mukulu</char> n'abantu baage booshi, k'okuderha abantu b'echigusho ch'<char style="w" lemma="Basadukaayo:">aBasadukaayo</char>, baaja bayunvira eNtumwa obongwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Bazifarha n'okuzihira omu munyororo gw'abantu booshi. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Aliko obudufu, <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">malahika</char> wa Nnaweerhu achinguula emilyango y'omunyororo. Akuula mo zila ntumwa n'okuzibwira ntya: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />«Mugende, muje omu <char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">Nju ya Nnamahanga</char>, munabalire olubaga byooshi biyerekeere kano kalamo gahyaahya.» <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Ezo ntumwa zabeere zayunva ebyoola binwa, zalamukira eseeziseezi omu Nju ya Nnamahanga, zanarhondera kuyigiriza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">
    <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">Omudaahwa mukulu</char> n'abantu baage baahika. Bahamagaza <char style="w" lemma="Kabuga k'aBayaahudi:">akabuga k'aBayaahudi</char> n'enshimaanano yooshi y'abashamuka b'aBaisraheeli. Banarhuma abalanzi kuja omu munyororo kuleerha eNtumwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Aliko abalanzi bagerere omu munyororo, barhababugaana mo. Baaja bagaluka n'okuja kubwira abakulu ntya: <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />«Rhwabugaanire omunyororo guchingirwe bwinja n'abalanzi bayimangire embere z'emilyango. Aliko rhwabeere rhwachinguula, ntaaye rhwabugaanire mo!» <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Egihe omukulu w'abalanzi b'<char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">eNju ya Nnamahanga</char> n'abakulu b'abadaahwa bayunvaga ebyoola binwa, bayuumirwa, banachiibaza akaba bichi byahikiire eNtumwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Muntu muguma aja ayinja kubabalira ntya: «Tala okw'abantu mwahiraga omu munyororo bayimangire omu Nju ya Nnamahanga, banali bayigiriza olubaga!» <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Omukulu w'abalanzi n'abantu baage baava baaja kubaleerha. Babaleerha buzira kubalibuza, kwenge baliyuubahire olubaga lwakababanda amabaale.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Bayuusize kubaleerha, babaheeka embere w'akabuga k'aBayaahudi. <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">Omudaahwa mukulu</char> ababaza ntya: <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />«Ka rhurhalibabuzize bweneene ogurhachiyigiriza mw'eryoola ziino? Tala oku mwayunjwize eYerusaleema n'enyigirizo zenyu! Munashondere gurhuheesa eshagama y'oyu muntu!»<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Petero n'ezindi <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">ntumwa</char> bashubiza ntya: «Bihemere ogukenga Nnamahanga ahaali h'abantu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Nnamahanga wa bashookuluza beerhu, afuulire Yeesu mwayirhaga omu kumubamba oku musalaaba. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Anamuzamwire ekulyo kwage nka Mukulu na Muchunguzi, y'aha aBaisraheeli obulyo b'okuleka ebyaaha na Nnamahanga ababalire ebyaaha byaabo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Rhuli bahamiiriza b'ebyoola byooshi haguma na Muuka-Mutagatiifu Nnamahanga aheere abamukenga.»<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Abantu b'akabuga k'aBayaahudi baaja bakaliha looshi omu kuyunva ebyoola binwa, banashonda kuyirha eNtumwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Aliko haliiri omu bo <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">oMufarisaayo</char> oyirikwa Gamaliyeeri. Aliiri mwigiriza w'amarhegeko okengerwe n'olubaga looshi. Ayimanga ahagarhi k'akabuga k'aBayaahudi n'ogurhegeka barhange bahuluse eNtumwa hityu. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Enyuma, aderha ntya: «Bantu b'eIsraheeli, muchilange oku bimukola kujirira abaala bantu. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Embere za bino bihe, hahulukiire muntu muguma oyirikwa Teuda. Aliiri achiderha oku ali muntu mukulu, n'abantu hoofu magana mane bamukulikira. Aliko ayirhwa, booshi bamukulikiraga balibirha n'echigusho chaage chaafa. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Enyuma zaage, omu gihe ch'oluganjo lw'abantu, haahulukira Mugalilaaya muguma oyirikwa Yuuda, arhuma abantu bamukulikira. Naye ayirhwa, na booshi bamukulikiraga bashandaazwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Leero bunoola mbabwirire oku murhakulikiraga abaala bantu, munabaleke bagende. Bulaala, akaba ebi bali kujira guli muhigo changwa kaasi k'abantu, byaafa. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Aliko akaba ebyoola birhengeere emwa Nnamahanga, murhakagala kubahanza. Muchilange mwangahengeera eyi muli mwalwisa Nnamahanga!» Abantu b'akabuga k'aBayaahudi bayunva amahano ma Gamaliyeeri. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Bahamagala <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">eNtumwa</char>, bazishurhiisa, banazirhegeka oku zirhachiyigirizaga oku ziino lya Yeesu. Buzinda, bazilikuula.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Entumwa zarhenga omu kabuga k'aBayaahudi eyi zishagalukire okubona zaganjirwe oku zikwaneene gukeneerezwa elugulu w'eziino lya Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Bagendeerera ngasi lusiku kuyigiriza omu <char style="w" lemma="Nju ya Nnamahanga:">Nju ya Nnamahanga</char> n'omu nju z'abantu, n'okubala oMwazi Mwinja gwa Yeesu, ye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Bantu mushanvu bagishogwa gurhabaala eNtumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Mw'ezoola siku, oluganjo lw'<char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abemeezi</char> lwaliiri lwayushuuka. aBayaahudi baliiri kuderha olulimi lw'eKigiriki barhondera kulundumira aBayaahudi baliiri kuderha olulimi lw'eGiheburaniya, bulaala abashumbakazi baabo baali babonereerwe egihe ch'okugaba ebiryo ngasi lusiku. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Zilaala ntumwa ekumi n'ebiri zagusha abemeezi booshi, zanababwira ntya: «Birhakwaneene rhulekeerere kuyigiriza eChinwa cha Nnamahanga mpu rhubeere rhuli rhwagaba ebiryo. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Cho girhumire, beene beerhu, mushonde ahagarhi kenyu bantu mushanvu bahamiriizwe bwinja n'abantu, bayunjwire Muuka-Mutagatiifu n'obwenge bunene. Boowe, barhwaheereza akoola kaasi. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Ntyo neerhu, rhwakomeza gusaliira n'okuyigiriza eChinwa cha Nnamahanga.» <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Abemeezi booshi bali chigushire ahoola basiima eyoola myaazi. Bachishoga Sitefaano, muntu w'obwemeezi bunene onayunjwire Muuka-Mutagatiifu, Firipo, Porokoro, Nikanori, Timooni, Parimena na Nikola w'eAntiyokiya wayemeeraga edini ly'eKiyaahudi. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Bamoleka bo <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">eNtumwa</char>, nazo zabasaliirira eyi zibalambuliire kw'amaboko.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Echinwa cha Nnamahanga chaliiri kuyaalagala omu bantu, oluganjo lw'abemeezi lwaliiri kuyushuuka bweneene eYerusaleema, n'echigusho chinene ch'<char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abadaahwa</char> chayemeera Yeesu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogusidaakwa kwa Sitefaano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Sitefaano aliyunjwire emigisho n'obuhashe bunene. Byaarhuma agenda ajira ebigiriginjo n'ebimenyeeso binene omu lubaga. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Aliko bantu baguma, barhondera obuhaka na Sitefaano. Abo bantu bahulikiraga omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">sinagoogi</char> ederhwa y'«aBantu Barhengaga omu Buja», barhengaga omu gishagala ch'eKureene n'eche Alegizanduriya. Abandi bahulukiraga omu gihugo ch'eKilikiya n'eche Aziya. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Aliko barhagalaga guhima Sitefaano kwenge aligwerhe bwenge bunene, na Muuka-Mutagatiifu aliiri kumuha ebinwa by'okuderha. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Baaja baaha abantu efuranga yi baderha oku: «Rhwamuyunvaga ali aderha ebinwa by'okudukanga <char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char> na Nnamahanga.» <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Bararusa olubaga <char style="w" lemma="Bashamuka:">n'abashamuka</char> b'aBayaahudi haguma n'abigiriza b'amarhegeko. Bayegeera Sitefaano, bamurhoola, banamuheeka omu <char style="w" lemma="Kabuga k'aBayaahudi:">kabuga k'aBayaahudi</char>. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Baleerha abahamiiriza b'obubeeshi baliiri baderha ntya: «Oyu muntu arhali aleka kuderha ebinwa bibi elugulu w'eNju ntagatiifu ya Nnamahanga n'<char style="w" lemma="Rhegeko:">eRhegeko</char> lya Muusa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Kwenge rhwamuyunvaga aderha oku Yeesu w'eNazareeti ashanda eyi Nju ya Nnamahanga, anahindamula n'emicho Muusa arhulekeraga.» <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Abantu booshi baliiri mw'akoola kabuga k'aBayaahudi babeere bali baheneereza Sitefaano, baava baabona amalanga maage makola mashushire nk'ama <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">malahika</char>.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Sitefaano abuurana omu kabuga k'aBayaahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">Omudaahwa mukulu</char> aja abaza Sitefaano ntya: «K'ebi bali bakuderha ko biri by'okuli?»<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Sitefaano ashubiza ntya: «Ba daarha na beene beerhu, munyunvirize! Nnamahanga w'obukuuze abonekeraga <char style="w" lemma="Abrahaamu:">Abrahaamu</char>, shookuluza weerhu, egihe aliiri omu gihugo ch'eMezopotamiya, embere alame omu gishagala ch'eHaraani. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Anamubwira ntya: ‹Rhenga omu gihugo chaawe n'omu mulala gwawe, oje omu gihugo nji nakuyeereka.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="GEN 12:1">Murhondero 12.1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Abrahaamu aja arhenga omu gihugo ch'aBakalidayo aja kulama omu gishagala ch'eHaraani. Enyuma w'olufu lw'eshe, Nnamahanga amubungiisa kandi gurhenga eHaraani, ayinja kulama mu chinoola gihugo mulamire mo bunoola. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Nnamahanga arhamuhaaga agashambala mu chinoola gihugo, arhamuhaaga chiro ahantu agahira okugulu. Aliko amulaganya okumuheereza cho n'ababurhwa baage nachiro nta mwana abaga aza kugwarha. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Nnamahanga amubwira ntya: ‹Ababurhwa baawe nji baalama nka bahiisi omu gihugo chabeene, nji babajira baja, nji banabalibuza myaaka magana mane. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Aliko egihugo nji baaba babeere mo baja, nyoono nye nji nagihana. Buzinda bw'aho nji babunguluka n'okumparamya hanoola.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.6-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="GEN 15:13-14">Murhondero 15.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:12">Lubunguluko 3.12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Ntyo, Nnamahanga aja ajira endaganyo haguma n'Abrahaamu. Echimenyeso chaayo kwali <char style="w" lemma="Nkembuulo:">gukembuulwa</char>. Aja aburha Isaka <char style="w" lemma="Nkembuulo:">anamukembuula</char> olusiku lwa munaane enyuma z'okuburhwa. Isaka naye akembuula omugala Yakobo, na Yakobo akembuula bashookuluza beerhu, bo balaala bagala baage ekumi na babiri.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />«Bashookuluza bagwarha obongwa ku Yozefu, bamuguza y'aheekwa omu gihugo ch' <char style="w" lemma="Miisiri:">eMiisiri </char> nka muja. Aliko Nnamahanga aliiri haguma naye, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />anamukuula omu malibuko maage mooshi. Amuha obwenge bunene n'okuyemeerwa embere za Farao, mwami w'egihugo ch'eMiisiri. Farao naye amujira mwimangizi w'echo gihugo n'enju yaage yooshi. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Enyuma z'aho, enzara nene yaba omu gihugo chooshi ch'eMiisiri n'omu gihugo ch'eKanaana. Amalibuko maliiri manene bweneene. Bashookuluza beerhu barhaalichiri baabona echi baalya. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Yakobo abeere ayunva oku hali engano omu gihugo ch'eMiisiri, arhuma yo bashookuluza beerhu oku burhanzi. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Bajiire y'obwakabiri, Yozefu achimenyeesa oku beene baabo, na Farao aja amenya omulala gwa Yozefu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Enyuma, Yozefu arhuma baje guhamagala eshe Yakobo n'omulala gwage gooshi. Abantu b'omulala gwage baliiri makumi gali mushanvu na barhaano. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Yakobo aja eMiisiri, afiira yo n'abandi bashookuluza beerhu. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Babaheeka eShekemu, banabahamba omu shinda Abrahaamu agulaga emwa beene Hamoori oku gichiiro ch'efuranga.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />«Egihe chabeere chiri hoofu Nnamahanga alikwaneene kuyeeneza mo echilagaane ahaaga Abrahaamu, olubaga lwerhu lwaluga, lwanaba lunene omu gihugo ch'eMiisiri. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Omwami muhyaahya orhaliyinji Yozefu ava ayima oku gihugo ch'eMiisiri. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Oyoola mwami arhebeka olubaga lwerhu, alibuza bashookuluza beerhu, abalekeesa enjolyaana zaabo yi zifa.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />«Mw'amo mango, <char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char> aburhwa. Aliiri mwinja omu meesho ma Nnamahanga. Alilemberwe myeezi esharhu omu nju y'eshe. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Abeere abishwa embuga, mwali wa Farao amubugula, anamulemba nka mugala waage. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Muusa ayigirizwa omu bwenge bunene booshi bw'<char style="w" lemma="Miisiri:">aBanyamiisiri</char>, anaba muntu w'obuhashe omu binwa byaage n'omu bijiro byaage.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />«Egihe ayeenezaga myaaka makumi mane, ahiga kuja kulambagirira beene baabo, b'aBaisraheeli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Ava abona mwene waabo muguma oli alibuzwa n'oMunyamiisiri. Amulwira, anamuhoolera omu kuyirha oyoola Munyamiisiri. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Alikengereere oku beene baabo bakamenyere oku kugerera ye Nnamahanga abakuula omu buja. Aliko barhabimenyaga. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga, Muusa abugaana aBaisraheeli babiri bali baalwa. Omu gushonda abayunvisanye yi bagwarha omurhuula, ababwira ntya: ‹Ego baza wee, oku muli baguma! Chagarhuma mwalibuzanya?› <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Aliko olaala waliiri alibuza owaabo ashunika Muusa n'okubaza ntya: ‹Nde wakujiraga mukulu na muzuuzi weerhu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ka wooyo oshondere kunyirha nk'oku nji wayirhaga olaala Munyamiisiri mulaagolo?›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="EXO 2:13-14">Lubunguluko 2.13-14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" /><char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char> ayunviirhe echoola chinwa, alibirha n'okuva abungira omu gihugo ch'eMidiyaani. Aburhira eyoola munda bagala babiri.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />«Myaaka makumi mane yabeere yayeenera, <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">malahika</char> amubonekera omu mpinga y'omusozi gw'eSinaayi omu birimi by'omuliro byaliiri byagulumira omu gishaka. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" /><char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char> abwene ebyoola, asoomererwa okoola kubonekerwa. Aliko egihe abaaga ali ayegeera y'achirhegeereza, ava ayunva omulenge gwa Nnaweerhu gwaderha ntya: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‹Nyoono nye Nnamahanga wa bashookuluza baawe, Nnamahanga w'Abrahaamu, Isaka na Yakobo!› Muusa ahinda omusisi, arhanagishubiiraga kugendeerera kulola. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Nnaweerhu amubwira ntya: ‹Hogola ebiraato byaawe, kwenge hanoola oyimangire hali hantu hatagatiifu. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Nabwene bwinja amalibuko m'olubaga lwani luli omu gihugo ch'eMiisiri, nayunviirhe amalira maabo. Bo bunoola nayandageere kubalikuuza. Jaaga wayinja, nagurhuma eMiisiri.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.33-34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="EXO 3:5-10">Lubunguluko 3.5-10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />«<char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Oyo Muusa</char> y'aBaisraheeli balahiraga omu kuderha ntya: ‹Nde wakujiraga mukulu na muzuuzi weerhu?›, yeewe ye Nnamahanga arhumire nka mukulu na murhabaazi, kugerera oburhabaale bwa <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">malahika</char> wamubonekeraga omu gishaka. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Yeewe ye wakuulaga aBaisraheeli omu gihugo ch'eMiisiri omu kujira ebigiriginjo n'ebimenyeeso mw'echo gihugo, omu nyanja Ndukula n'omu mpinga mu myaaka makumi mane. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Kandi Muusa ye wabwiraga aBaisraheeli ntya: ‹Nnamahanga nj'abaha omuleebi oli nka nyoono gurhenga omu beene benyu.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Rhegeko 18.15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Egihe olubaga lw'eIsraheeli lwaliiri omu mpinga, oyo Muusa ye waliiri ahagarhi ka bashookuluza beerhu, na malahika waliiri amuganiiza oku musozi gw'eSinaayi. Yeewe ye wayankiiriraga ebinwa by'akalamo y'arhuha byo. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Aliko bashookuluza beerhu barhashondaga kumukenga, si bamulahira. Bachifiija omu mirhima yaabo mpu bagaluke eMiisiri. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Babwira <char style="w" lemma="Haruuni:">Haruuni</char> ntya: ‹Orhujirire emaana z'okulambagira embere zeerhu, kwenge rhurhamenyere ebyabereere oyo Muusa warhukuulaga omu gihugo ch'eMiisiri.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="EXO 32:1">Lubunguluko 32.1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Mw'ezoola siku, bachijirira egishushanyo ch'ekimasha. Barhuulira cho entuulo y'ogusireeza, banajirira edinye echintu enfune zaabo zajiraga. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Nnamahanga aja arhenga ahagarhi kaabo, anabaleka baharamye ezuuba, omwezi n'enyenyeezi nk'oku biyandikirwe ntya omu gitaabu ch'abaleebi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‹Ego bantu b'eIsraheeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">ka nyoono nye mwarhuuliraga ebirhungano n'ezindi ntuulo z'ogusirezwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">omu myaaka makumi mane omu mpinga?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Nangwa, aliko mwaliheekere ehema ly'emaana yenyu eyirikwa Moloki</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">n'enyenyeezi y'emaana yenyu eyirikwa Refaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">ebyoola bishushanyo mwajiraga yi mubiharamya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Elugulu w'ebyoola nabarhuma buja gurhaluka <char style="w" lemma="Babilooni:">eBabilooni</char>.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.42-43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amoosi 5.25-27</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />«Bashookuluza beerhu bali bagwerhe omu mpinga ehema ly'obuhamiiriza. Bakwizaga elyoola hema nk'oku Nnamahanga arhegekaga <char style="w" lemma="Muusa:">Muusa</char> gukulikirana n'eshusho abonaga. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Enyuma z'okuyankiirira elyo hema, bashookuluza beerhu haguma na Yoshuwa baliheeka omu gihugo barhoolaga eyi Nnamahanga amalibisya embaga zaacho embere zaabo. Lyabeera mw'echo gihugo kugera amango ma <char style="w" lemma="Daawudi:">Daawudi</char>. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Daawudi ayemeerwa na Nnamahanga, ava amuhema ntya: ‹Nnamahanga wa Yakobo, onyemeerere nkuyumbakire eNju.› <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Aliko Solomoono ye wamuyumbakiire eNju. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Chiro akaba ntyo, Nnamahanga w'Elugulu Bweneene arhalama omu bintu byajirirwe n'efune z'abantu, nk'oku omuleebi aderhere:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‹Nnaweerhu aderhere ntya: “Empingu yo ntebe yaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">n'egulu yo ndabarhiro yaani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Nju nchi nji mwanyumbakira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">hayi nji haaba hantu haani h'oguhumuukira?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />K'arhali fune yaani yajiraga ebyoola byooshi?”›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.49-50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Isaya 66.1-2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />«Ego mwe bantu bazibu! Emirhima yenyu n'amarhwi menyu biri by'abantu barhayemereere Nnamahanga, muli kuguma na bashookuluza benyu. Ngasi mango munalahira kuyunva omulenge gwa Muuka-Mutagatiifu. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Nde omu baleebi orhalibuzwaga na bashookuluza benyu? Bayirhaga balaala babalaga embere okuyinja kw'Okwaneene. Y'olaala mwabo nji mwalenganyaga, mwanamuyirha. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Mwewe, mwe mwayankiriraga <char style="w" lemma="Rhegeko:">Erhegeko</char> <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">bamalahika</char> babalaga, aliko murhalikulikiraga!»<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogufa kwa Sitefaano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Abantu b'akabuga k'aBayaahudi bayunvire ebyoola binwa byooshi bakaliha bweneene, banarhondera kumugugurhira amenyo. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Aliko Sitefaano alola empingu eyi ayunjwire Muuka-Mutagatiifu, abona obukuuze bwa Nnamahanga na Yeesu eyi ayimangire ekulyo kwa Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Aderha ntya: «Mbwene empingu zichinguukire na <char style="w">Mwene oMuntu</char> ayimangire ekulyo kwa Nnamahanga!» <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Baaja bayaama bweneene eyi bafukire amarhwi maabo. Booshi haguma bamubalalira ko. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Bamukuula omu gishagala, banamubanda amabaale. Abantu bamusidaakaga babikiisa omuzaana wayirikwaga Saawulo emyambalo yaabo.<figure style="fig" alt="Etienne entrain d'être lapidé" file="cn01923B.tif" size="col" ref="7.58">Sitefaano abandwa amabaale</figure> <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Babeere bali bamubanda amabaale, Sitefaano asaliira ntya: «Nnaweerhu Yeesu, yankirira omuuka gwani!» <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Afukama, n'okuva ayaama ntya n'omulenge munene: «Nnaweerhu, orhabahaniraga echiila chaaha!» Ayuusize kuderha ebyoola binwa, afa.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Saawulo aliyemereere olufu lwa Sitefaano.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Saawulo alibuza abemeezi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Oloola lusiku, echigusho ch'abemeezi ch'eYerusaleema charhondera kulibuzwa bweneene. Booshi, kuleka <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">entumwa</char>, bayandaala omu gihugo ch'<char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya">eYudeeya</char> n'omu ch'eSamariya. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Aliko abantu bakengaga Nnamahanga bahamba Sitefaano, banamulakira bweneene. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Saawulo yeewe, aliiri kulibuza echigusho ch'abemeezi. Aliiri kuja omu maju, anakuula mw'abalume n'abakazi, anabaheeka omu munyororo.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Aliko emunda balaala bashandaalaga baliiri balenga, baliiri babala oMwazi Mwinja.<verse eid="ACT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Firipo abala oMwazi Mwinja omu Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Firipo ayandagalira omu gishagala chinene ch'egihugo ch'eSamariya, arhondera kubalira abantu elugulu wa <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Abantu banene baliiri bayunviriza bwinjabwinja haguma enyigirizo za Firipo, n'okubona ebimenyeeso aliiri ajira. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" /><char style="w" lemma="Muzimu">Abazimu</char> baliiri barhenga omu bantu banene eyi bali bayaama bweneene. Bantu banene bahunzize n'ebirema baafuma. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Habonekana obushagaluke bunene mw'echoola gishagala.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omukurungu Simooni ayemeera Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Muntu muguma oyirikwa Simooni abaaga arhuula mw'echoola gishagala. Aliiri ajirira m'obukurungu n'ogusoomeza aBasamariya. Aliiri guchiihala oku ye ntabalalwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Booshi, gurhengera oku mudoorho guhika oku mukulu, baliiri bamuyunviriza n'okuderha ntya: «Oyoola muntu ali buhashe bwa Nnamahanga, bulaala buderhwa ‹Buhashe Bunene.›» <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Baliiri bamuyunviriza, bulaala haliiri hamaagera esiku zinene ey'abasomeeze n'obukurungu bwage. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Babeere bayemeera Firipo waliiri abalira bo oMwazi Mwinja gw'obwime bwa Nnamahanga n'eziino lya Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>, abalume n'abakazi babatiizwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simooni naye yenyine ayemeera Yeesu, anabatiizwa. Arhagirhengaga ku Firipo, anasoomererwa ebimenyeeso n'ebijiro by'obuhashe binene byaliiri byajirika.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">Entumwa</char> zaliiri eYerusaleema zabeere zayunva okw'abantu b'eSamariya bayankiriire eChinwa cha Nnamahanga, zabarhumira Petero na Yohaana. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Bombi babeere baagera eSamariya, basaliirira abemeezi yi bayankirira Muuka-Mutagatiifu, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />kwenge abaga arhaza yandagalira chiro oku muguma wabo. Babaaga babatiizizwe konyine oku ziino lya Nnaweerhu Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Petero na Yohaana baaja babalambuulira kw'amaboko, banayankirira Muuka-Mutagatiifu.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Egihe Simooni abonaga oku bayankiriire Muuka-Mutagatiifu kugerera <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">eNtumwa</char> omu kubalambuulira kw'amaboko, abaheekera efuranga, anababwira ntya: <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />«Mumpaage naani obuula buhashe yi ngasi muntu naani nalambuulira kw'amaboko ayankirire Muuka-Mutagatiifu.» <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Aliko Petero amubwira ntya: «Efuranga zaawe zihere haguma naawe, bulaala waliganiizize kugula empaano ya Nnamahanga kugerera efuranga! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Orhagwerhe chigabi chiro n'egityu mw'aka kaasi, kwenge omurhima gwawe gurhakwaneene embere za Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Jaaga waleka ebyaaha byaawe by'oguchifiija, onasaliire Nnaweerhu yi nkabaga ababalire enganiiza y'omurhima gwawe. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Kwenge mbwene oku oyunjwire obongwa nka kalulwe k'endulwe, onashwekerwe n'ebyaaha.» <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simooni ashubiza ntya: «Mwenyine munsaliirire Nnaweerhu, yi ntaacho chimbeerage omu bi mwaderhere.»<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Petero na Yohaana bamalire guhaana obuhamiriza bwabo n'okuyigiriza eChinwa cha Nnaweerhu, bagaluka eYerusaleema. Bagenda bali baabala oMwazi Mwinja omu bishagala binene by'aBasamariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Firipo abatiiza omukozi mukulu w'eEtiyopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">Malahika</char> wa Nnaweerhu abwira Firipo ntya: «Yimanga, onagende omu njira ejiire egarhongo, elaala erhengeere eYerusaleema guhika eGaza.» Eyoola njira egerere omu mpinga. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Ava ayimanga, agenda. Na mw'eyoola njira, mwaliiri oMunyaetiyopiya muguma w'entazi. Aliiri mukozi mukulu wa Kandake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kandake lirhali ziino ly'omuntu sy'aliko liri ziino ly'obukulu. Bagendaga baliyirika omwamikazi wayimire omu gihugo che Etiyopiya.</char></note> mwamikazi w'Etiyopiya, na murhegesi w'ebikulo byaage byooshi. Alijiire eYerusaleema guharamya Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Abeere ali arhenga yo ey'ayikeere omu mudugaari gwage, eyi anali asoma n'omulenge munene egitaabu ch'omuleebi Isaya. <figure style="fig" alt="Philippe et l'ethioppien" file="CN01932B.TIF" size="col" ref="8.28">Firipo ayegeera omunyaetiyopiya oli omu mudugaari</figure> <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Muuka-Mutagatiifu abwira Firipo ntya: «Gendeerera, oshimaane guliira mudugaari.» <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Firipo alibirhira go, ayunva oMunyaetiyopiya ali asoma egitaabu ch'omuleebi Isaya. Firipo amubaza ntya: «K'oyunviirhe eby'oli wasoma?» <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Ashubiza ntya: «Gurhe nakabiyunva, akonva ntaaye oli ampuguulira?» Ava ayinginga Firipo ashone, ayikale haguma naye omu mudugaari. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />aMandiko Matagatiifu aliiri asoma maderhere ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">«Aliheekerwe nka ntaama baaja kubaaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Nka mwanabuzi osirire embere z'oli wamucha amooya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">arhabumbuulaga obuunu bwage.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Omu guchirhonda kwage, barhamuchiiraga bwinja olushinja lwage.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Nde nji waabala emyaazi y'egisisi chaage?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Kwenge bakuulire akalamo kaage omu gulu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Isaya 53.7-8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Oyoola Munyaetiyopiya abaza Firipo ntya: «Nkuyingingire, ombwire nde y'omuleebi aderhere ko ebyoola? Ali achiiderha oku byo changwa oku windi?» <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Firipo aja arhonderera oku malaala Mandiko Matagatiifu oMunyaetiyopiya aliiri asoma, amubalira oMwazi Mwinja gwa Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Babeere bachiri bagenda, baagera aha amenji mali. Oyoola Munyaetiyopiya abaza ntya: «Tala amenji! Bichi bimbuzize kubatiizwa?» <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />[Firipo amushubiza ntya: «Akonva oyemeerere Yeesu n'omurhima gwawe gooshi, wakabatiizwa.» Naye aderha ntya: «Neechi! Nayemereere oku Yeesu Kirisitu ali Mwene Nnamahanga.»]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olu lukere lurhali omu bitaabu biguma by'eBibuliya bya miira.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Oyoola Munyaetiyopiya ava ayimanza omudugaari. Bombi bayandagalira omu menji, Firipo n'olaala Munyaetiyopiya. Firipo ava amubatiiza. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Babeere barhenga omu menji, oMuuka gwa Nnaweerhu gwaheeka Firipo. Oyoola Munyaetiyopiya arhachimubonaga, aliko agendeerera olugenzi, eyi ashagalukire. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Firipo yeewe, ahengeera akola ali omu gishagala che Azoto. Alema abala yo oMwazi Mwinja omu bishagala byooshi aliiri agera mo, guhika okugera kwage omu gishagala ch'eKayizariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Oguchunguka kwa Saawulo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 22:3-21">Bijiro 22.3-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-20">26.9-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Mw'ezoola siku, Saawulo alichiri aderha okw'ayirha abemeezi ba Nnaweerhu. Aja emw'<char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">omudaahwa mukulu</char>, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />anamuhema amaruba m'okuja omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">masinagoogi</char> m'omu gishagala ch'eDamasiki, y'akabugaana yo abalume changwa abakazi bakulikiire eNjira ya Nnaweerhu, abashweke, anabaleerhe eYerusaleema.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Abeere ali omu njira hoofu ahike eDamasiki, ho n'aho, obumoleke bwarhenga empingu bwamugorha. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Ahenera ahashi, anava ayunva omulenge gwamubaza ntya: «Saawulo, Saawulo, girhumire wandibuza?» <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Ashubiza ntya: «Nnaweerhu, wooyo oli nde?» Omulenge gwashubiza ntya: «Nyoono, ndi Yeesu, oli walibuza. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Aliko oyimange, oje omu gishagala. Omoola, bakubwira ech'okwaneene kujira.» <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Abantu baliiri babalama haguma na Saawulo bayimanga buzira kuderha elugulu w'ogusoomerwa. Baliiri bayunva omulenge, aliko ntaaye baliiri baabona. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Saawulo ayimanga, azibuula ameesho, aliko ntaacho aliiri abona. Baava bamufarhira oku kuboko, bamuheeka eDamasiki. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Ajira siku esharhu buzira kubona, na buzira kulya changwa kunywa.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />eDamasiki yaliiri omwemeezi oyirikwa Hananiya. Nnaweerhu amubonekera, amuhamagala: «Hananiya!» Naye ashubiza ntya: «Nyoono oyu, Nnaweerhu!» <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Nnaweerhu amubwira ntya: «Yimanga, ogende omu njira eyirikwa ‹Elambuukire›, obaze omu nju ya Yuuda omuntu oyirikwa Saawulo w'eTariso. Ali asaliira mu kino gihe. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Omu kubonekerwa, abwene omuntu oyirikwa Hananiya aja omu nju, amanamulambuulira kw'amaboko y'ashube kubona.» <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Hananiya ashubiza ntya: «Nnaweerhu, nayunvire bantu banene baderha obubi booshi oyoola muntu ajiriire abemeezi baawe eYerusaleema. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Chiro na hanoola, abakulu b'abadaahwa bamuheere obuhashe bw'ogushweka abantu booshi basaliira oku ziino lyaawe.» <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Aliko Nnaweerhu abwira Hananiya ntya: «Genda, kwenge oyoola mulume ali gikoleeso nachishogere ch'okubala eziino lyaani embere z'abarhali Bayaahudi n'abaami baabo, n'embere z'aBaisraheeli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Namuyeereka nyoono nyenyine amalibuko mooshi akwaneene kulibuka elugulu waani.» <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Hananiya aja agenda. Abeere agera omu nju, alambuulira Saawulo kw'amaboko, anamubwira ntya: «Saawulo, mwene weerhu, Nnaweerhu Yeesu wakubonekeraga omu njira embere oyinje hano, antumire y'oshube kubona, onayunjule Muuka-Mutagatiifu.» <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ho n'aho, ameesho maage maarhoga kw'ebiri nk'amagamba, anashuba kubona. Ayimanga, anabatiizwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Aja alya ebiryo, anashuba kugwarha emisi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Saawulo abala oMwazi Mwinja eDamasiki</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Saawulo abeera siku zigeeke haguma n'abemeezi baliiri eDamasiki. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Ava arhondera kubala omu <char style="w" lemma="Sinagoogi:">masinagoogi</char> oku Yeesu ali Mwene Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Booshi baliiri bamuyunva, basoomerwa; banalema babazana ntya: «K'arhali oyuula ye waliiri alibuza bweneene abasaliira eYerusaleema oku ziino lya Yeesu? K'arhanayinjaga hanoola kubashweka n'okubaheeka embere z'<char style="w" lemma="Mudaahwa:">abakulu b'abadaahwa</char>?» <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Aliko obuhashe bwa Saawulo bwaliiri bwayuushuka omu gusoomeza <char style="w" lemma="Muyaahudi:">aBayaahudi</char> balilamire eDamasiki, omu kuyeereka bwinjabwinja oku Yeesu ye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Enyuma w'esiku zinene, aBayaahudi bahiga kuyirha Saawulo. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Aliko naye amenya ogo muhigo. Baliiri balanga emilyango y'egishagala ezuuba n'obudufu yi bamuyirhe. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Aliko obudufu, <char style="w" lemma="Mwigirizwa:">abigirizwa</char> ba Saawulo bamurhoola, banamuyandagaza omu garhanda embuga w'olugurhu lw'egishagala.<figure style="fig" alt="Saawulo ayandagazwa oku lugurhu omu garhanda" file="CN01937b.TIF" size="col" ref="9.25">On fait descendre Saul sur un clot dans un panier</figure><verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saawulo agaluka eYerusaleema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Saawulo agenda eYerusaleema. Abeere ahika yo, ashonda gurhe agachigusha haguma n'abemeezi, aliko booshi baliiri bamuyuubahire, kwenge barhaliyemereere oku abeere mwemeezi. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Baranaaba aja amurhoola, amuheekera <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">eNtumwa</char>. Abashambaalira gurhe Saawulo alibwene Nnaweerhu omu njira na gurhe Nnaweerhu ashambaalaga naye. Ashuba kubashambaalira gurhe Saawulo ayigirizaga buzira buuba eDamasiki oku ziino lya Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Gurhengera echoola gihe, Saawulo alema alama haguma n'eNtumwa, alambagira haguma nabo omu Yerusaleema, analiiri ayigiriza buzira buuba oku ziino lya Nnaweerhu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Aliiri ashambaala n'oguhatana n'aBayaahudi b'olulimi lw'eKigiriki. Aliko aboola bantu baliiri bashonda kumuyirha. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Abaabo babeere bamenya ogoola mwazi, baheeka Saawulo omu gishagala ch'eKayizariya, banamurhuma omu gishagala ch'eTariso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Mw'echoola gihe, echigusho ch'abemeezi chaliiri omu murhuula omu Yudeeya yooshi, eGalilaaya n'eSamariya. Chaliiri chagwarha emisi, chalama omu kuyuubaha Nnaweerhu, n'okuyuushuka kugerera oburhabaale bwa Muuka-Mutagatiifu.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogufuma kw'Ayineya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Petero abeere ali agera ngasi hantu, ayandagalira emwa abemeezi baliiri balamire omu gishagala ch'eLuuda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Abugaana y'omuntu oyirikwa Ayineya walihunzize. Alilyaamire oku gishanja gurhenga myaaka munaane. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Petero ava amubwira ntya: «Ayineya, Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char> amagufumya. Yimanga onazinge egishanja chaawe!» Ho n'aho ayimanga. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Abantu booshi b'eLuuda na b'omu bulambo bw'eSaroni babeere baabona Ayineya, bayemeera Nnaweerhu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogufuulwa kwa Dorika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Omu gishagala ch'eYopa mwaliiri omukazi muguma mwemeezi wayirikwaga Tabita. Omu lulimi lw'eKigiriki ye Dorika<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dorika liri ziino ly'eKigiriki liderhere enyama y'elubala eri nka mpene.</char></note>. Agendaga ajira ebijiro binene binja n'ebyo bubabale. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Mw'ezoola siku, alwala, anava afa. Bamuyooza, bamuheeka omu gorofa ebusiika. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Abemeezi babeere bayunva oku Petero ali eLuuda, hoofu n'eYopa, baarhuma balume babiri kumuyinginga ntya: «Rhuguhemere, yinja emwerhu buzira kulegama.» <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Petero ayimanga, anava agenda haguma nabo. Bagerere yo, bamuheeka omu gorofa ebusiika. Abashumbakazi booshi baliiri ahoola bayegeera Petero eyi bali baalira. Baliiri bamuyeereka amalopo n'eyindi myambalo Dorika abahangiraga egihe aliiri mugumaguma. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petero ahulusa abantu booshi, aja afukama, asaliira. Enyuma ahindamukira emunda omubiri gwaliiri, aderha ntya: «Tabita, yimanga!» Tabita aja azibuula ameesho. Abwene Petero, ayikala. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petero amufarhira oku kuboko, amurhabaala kuyimanga. Aja ahamagala abashumbakazi n'abandi bemeezi, anabamoleka ye, eyi ali mugumaguma. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Eyoola myaazi yamenyeekana omu gishagala chooshi ch'eYopa n'abantu banene bayemeera Nnaweerhu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Petero abeera eYopa siku zinene emw'omulume oyirikwa Simooni waliiri muhanga omu gukwiza empu.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Petero ahamagalwa emwa Korineliyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Omu gishagala ch'eKayizariya haliiri muntu muguma wayirikwaga Korineliyo. Aliiri mukulu w'echigusho ch'abasoda chayirikwaga «Chigusho ch'aBaitaliyana.» <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Yeewe n'abantu booshi b'omu mwage, bakengaga Nnamahanga n'okumuyuubaha. Agendaga arhabaala abakene bweneene, anazigaanaga gusaliira Nnamahanga ngasi mango. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Hoofu n'esaa mwenda z'ezuuba, abonekerwa, abona <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">malahika</char> wa Nnamahanga aja omu mwage n'okumuhamagala ntya: «Ego Korineliyo!» <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Abeere amuloleereza, ayuubaha, anamubaza ntya: «Nnaweerhu, bichi byabeere?» Malahika amushubiza ntya: «Nnamahanga ayunviirhe amasaala maawe n'oburhabaale bwawe oku bakene anabuyibukire. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Ojaage warhuma abantu eYopa baleerhe Simooni washembulwaga Petero. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Ahandire emw'owundi Simooni w'omulenga omu gukwiza empu, n'enju yaage eri eburhambi bw'enyanja.» <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Malahika wamuganiizaga abeere agenda, Korineliyo ahamagala abakozi baage babiri b'akaasi k'omu nju, n'omusoda muguma omu balaala balemaga bamulanga, okenga Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Amalire kubalira bo byooshi byabeere, abarhuma eYopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga, aboola bantu basharhu babeere bachiri omu njira banakola bali bayegeera egishagala, Petero azamuukira elugulu oku nju gusaliira ey'emidi eri hoofu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olole egishushanyo ch'enju y'aBayaahudi chiri omu Luuka 5.19.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Ayunva enzara, anagifiija kulya. Babeere bali bamuvuyira ebiryo, abonekerwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Abona empingu echingwirwe n'echintu gishushire n'omwenda munene gifarhiriirwe oku bishimbiri bine chiri charhenga omu chanya n'okuyandagazwa oku daho.<figure style="fig" file="WA03963b.tif" size="col" ref="10.11">Petero abona ngasi buuko bw'enyama n'enyunyi</figure> <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Kw'echoola chintu kwaliiri ngasi buuko bw'enyama z'amagulu mane, enyama zibululuka oku daho, n'enyunyi zibalala omu chaalege. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Omulenge muguma gwava gwamubwira ntya: «Petero, yimanga, baaga onalye.» <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Petero ashubiza ntya: «Nangwa Nnaweerhu! Ntashubiraga kulya echintu girhakwaneene kuliibwa, girhanacheesezwe!» <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Obwakabiri omulenge gwamubwira ntya: «Echi Nnamahanga acheeseze, wooyo orhagirhoolaga oku girhakwaneene kuliibwa!» <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Ebyoola byaaba gasharhu, n'enyuma echoola chintu chaava chazamuulirwa empingu.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Petero abeere achiri achibaza bichi okola kubonekerwa abonaga kuderhere, abantu Korineliyo arhumaga baaja baahika oku mulyango g'okuja omu nju. Babaaga babaziriize embere bamenye enju ya Simooni. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Balegereza, banabaza akonva ahoola ha Simooni washembulwaga Petero ahandire. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Petero abeere ali aganiiza kw'okola kubonekerwa, Muuka-Mutagatiifu amubwira ntya: «Haliira hali balume basharhu bali bagushonda. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Yandagala, onagende haguma nabo buzira kuganganwa, kwenge nyoono nye nabarhumaga.» <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Petero ava ayandagala n'okubwira aboola balume ntya: «Nyoono nye muli mwashonda. Bichi birhumire muli hanoola?» <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Baashubiza ntya: «Omukulu w'abasoda oyirikwa Korineliyo ye rhurhumire. Ali muntu okwaneene, oyuubaha Nnamahanga, n'<char style="w" lemma="Muyaahudi:">aBayaahudi</char> booshi bamuhamiiriza bwinja. Malahika Mutagatiifu amurhegekere oku rhukuleerhe emwage akuyunvirize.» <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Petero aja abayankirira omu nju, anabaha aha balaala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Bwacheere eseezi, Petero azuuka, anagenda haguma nabo. Abemeezi baguma b'eYopa bamuherekeza. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga, baagera eKayizariya. Korineliyo aliiri abalinga eyi analaalikire emwage abantu b'omulala gwage, n'abeera baage b'oku murhima. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Petero abeere ahika emwa Korineliyo, Korineliyo aja kumuyankirira, afukama, anayuunama embere zaage omu kumukuuza. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Aliko Petero amuyimanza, anamubwira ntya: «Yimanga, kwenge naani ndi muntu kuguma naawe.» <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Petero aja omu nju haguma naye eyi bali baganiira, anabugaana mo abantu banene bachigushire. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Ababwira ntya: «Muyinji mwenyine okw'oMuyaahudi alahiizwe kugwarha obwira n'orhali Muyaahudi changwa okuja omu mwage. Aliko Nnamahanga anyerekere oku birhahemere ogurhoola omuntu nk'orhacheere changwa nk'arhakwaneene kuyegeerwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Cho girhumire, egihe mwantumiraga abantu kunshonda, namayinja buzira kuganganwa. Mbahemere muje mwambwira bichi byarhumaga mwampamagala.»<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Korineliyo ashubiza ntya: «Hamaagera bunoola siku esharhu, naliiri nasaliira omu mwani, oku gihe nka kinoola ch'esaa mwenda. Ho n'aho omuntu oyambeere emyambalo eri yabaraganya ayimanga embere zaani. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Aderha ntya: ‹Korineliyo, Nnamahanga ayunviirhe amasaala maawe, anayibukire oburhabaale bwawe oku bakene. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Jaaga warhuma abantu eYopa, baje guhamagala Simooni washembulwaga Petero. Ahandire aha burhambi bw'enyanja, omu nju ya Simooni muhanga w'ogukwiza empu.› <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ho n'aho nava nagurhumira abantu kugushonda, naawe wajirire bwinja okuyinja. Leero rhweshi rhuli hanoola mw'eno saa embere za Nnamahanga yi rhuyunva byooshi Nnaweerhu agurhegekere gurhubwira.»<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Enyigirizo za Petero omu nju ya Korineliyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Petero aj'aderha ntya: «Okuli bunoola namaamenya oku Nnamahanga arhajira kalondoole. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Aliko omu ngasi lubaga, ngasi yeeshi omuyuubaha n'okujira ebikwaneene, Nnamahanga anamuyankirira. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Arhumaga echinwa oku Baisraheeli omu kubabalira oMwazi Mwinja gw'omurhuula kugerera Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>. Yeewe ye Nnaweerhu w'abantu booshi. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Mwewe, muyinji echizinda kuba omu Yudeeya yooshi gurhonderera eGalilaaya, enyuma za Yohaana kubala okw'abantu <char style="w" lemma="Bubatiizo:">babatiizwe</char>. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Muyinji gurhe Nnamahanga agishogaga Yeesu w'eNazareeti gukola akaasi kaage, anamuha Muuka-Mutagatiifu n'obuhashe. Hooshi aliiri agera, aliiri ajira amenja n'ogufumya abantu booshi baliiri omu buja bwa Shetaani. Kwenge Nnamahanga aliiri haguma naye. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Rhuli bahamiiriza ba byooshi ajiraga omu gihugo ch'<char style="w" lemma="Muyaahudi:">aBayaahudi</char> n'eYerusaleema. Olaala bayirhaga omu kumubamba oku musalaaba, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />aliko Nnamahanga amufuulire olusiku lwa gasharhu. Amuyeerekana oku bantu, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />arhali oku lubaga looshi, aliko oku bahamiiriza Nnamahanga abaaga agishogere, oku rhwewe rhwe rhwalyaaga, rhwananywa haguma naye enyuma w'ogufuuka kwage omu bafu. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Arhurhegekere okubalira olubaga n'okuyeerekena oku yeewe ye Nnamahanga ajirire muzuuzi w'abazeene n'abafiire. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Abaleebi booshi bamuha obuula buhamiiriza: ngasi yeeshi omuyemeera, ebyaaha byaage binababalirwa kugerera eziino lyaage.»<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abarhali Bayaahudi bayankirira Muuka-Mutagatiifu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Petero abeere achiri aderha ebyo binwa, Muuka-Mutagatiifu ayandagalira oku booshi baliiri babiyunviriza. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Abemeezi booshi b'aBayaahudi bayinjaga haguma na Petero basoomerwa okubona abarhali Bayaahudi nabo bayandaazwa kw'empaano ya Muuka-Mutagatiifu. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Kwenge baliiri babayunva baderha omu ndimi n'ogukuuza Nnamahanga. Petero aja aderha ntya: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />«Abaala bantu bayankirire Muuka-Mutagatiifu kuguma neerhu. Ka hali omuntu wakabalahirira kubatiizibwa omu menji?» <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Ava arhegeka oku babatiizwe oku ziino lya Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>. Baaja bahema Petero abeere haguma nabo siku zigeeke.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Petero abala ebyajirire emw'abarhali Bayaahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Ntumwa:">Entumwa</char> n'abemeezi baliiri eYudeeya bayunva okw'abarhali Bayaahudi nabo bayankiriire eChinwa cha Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Amango Petero azamuukiraga eYerusaleema, abemeezi b'aBayaahudi bamurhonganya, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />bamubwira ntya: «Ego muza we! Gurhe wajiire omu nju z'abarhali Bayaahudi wamanalya nabo!»<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Petero aja arhondera kubalira bo byooshi gurhe byalibeere. Ababwira ntya mwazi oku gwindi: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />«Nyoono naliiri omu gishagala ch'eYopa. Oku ndi nasaliira, nabonekerwa: chintu chiguma chiri nka mwenda munene gifarhirwe hantu hane, chachima gurhengera omu chaalege, chayandagazwa emunda ndi. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nabeere nasuuzuma cho, nabona chiri mo enyama z'amagulu mane, enyama z'elubala, ezibululuka n'enyunyi zibalala omu chaalege. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Nayunva omulenge gwambwira ntya: ‹Yimanga Petero, baaga, onalye.› <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Aliko nashubiza ntya: ‹Nangwa Nnaweerhu! Echintu girhacheesezwe girhanakwaneene kuliibwa girhashubiraga kuja omu buunu bwani!› <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Oku bwakabiri, omulenge gwashubiza ntya gurhengera empingu: ‹Echi Nnamahanga acheeseze, wooyo orhagirhoolaga oku girhakwaneene kuliibwa!› <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Ebyoola byabeere byamajirika gasharhu, byooshi byaava byazamuulwa omu mpingu. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Ho n'aho, bantu basharhu balintumiirwe gurhengera eKayizariya baahika omu nju rhwaliiri mo. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Muuka-Mutagatiifu ambwira mpu ngende nabo buzira kuganganwa. Aba beerhu ndarhu mubwene, bali mperekeeze, rhwanaja omu nju y'omuntu oyirikwa Korineliyo. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Oyoola Korineliyo arhubalira gurhe alibwene <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">malahika</char> ayimanga omu nju yaage n'okumubwira ntya: ‹Rhuma abantu eYopa baje gushonda Simooni washembulwaga Petero. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Yeewe ye wakubwira ebinwa byakuleerhera obuchunguke, wooyo n'abantu b'omu nju yaawe booshi.› <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Nabeere narhondera kuderha, Muuka-Mutagatiifu ayandagalira oku bo nk'oku arhuyandagaliraga ko neerhu oku murhondero. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Nava nayibuka echiila chinwa Nnaweerhu aderhaga ntya: ‹Yohaana <char style="w" lemma="Bubatiizo:">abatiizaga</char> omu menji, aliko mwabo nji mwabatiizwa na Muuka-Mutagatiifu.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="ACT 1:5">Bijiro 1.5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Akaba leero Nnamahanga abaheere empaano nguma n'elaala arhuhaaga neerhu amango rhwayemeeraga Nnaweerhu Yeesu-<char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiiya:">Kirisitu</char>, naliiri nde, nyoono, mpu ngale kulwisa Nnamahanga?»<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Abemeezi b'aBayaahudi bamalire kuyunva ebyoola, barhuleera, banakuuza Nnamahanga n'oku derha ntya: «Gasi Nnamahanga aheere abarhali Bayaahudi nabo enjira y'okuleka ebyaaha byaabo yi baabona akalamo k'esiku n'amango!»<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Echigusho ch'abemeezi b'eAntiyokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Balaala bemeezi bashandaazwaga elugulu w'okuyirhwa kwa Sitefaano, baguma omu bo bagenda guhika omu gihugo ch'eFoyinikiya. Abandi baaja oku chizimba ch'eGipuro, n'abandi baahika omu gishagala ch'eAntiyokiya. Ntaaye bayigiriize eChinwa cha Nnamahanga arhali aBayaahudi bonyine. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Aliko ahagarhi kaabo haaba bantu baguma b'eGipuro na ab'omu gishagala ch'eKureene bayinjaga eAntiyokiya, nabo baganiira n'abarhali Bayaahudi n'okubalira bo oMwazi Mwinja gwa Nnaweerhu Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Obuhashe bwa Nnaweerhu bwaliiri haguma nabo, n'abantu banene bahindamukira Nnaweerhu, baanaba bemeezi.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Echigusho ch'abemeezi b'eYerusaleema babeere bayunva ogo mwazi, baarhuma Baranaaba agende eAntiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Abeere ahika yo, agishwa na Nnamahanga, asiima, n'okuyinginga abemeezi bagendekere guseera ku Nnaweerhu omu mirhima yaabo yooshi. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Baranaaba aliiri muntu mwinja, oyunjwizwe Muuka-Mutagatiifu n'obwemeezi. Abantu banene bakulikira Nnaweerhu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Buzinda, Baranaaba aja eTariso gushonda Saawulo. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Abeere amubona, amuheeka eAntiyokiya. Baranaaba na Saawulo bamala omwaka gooshi eyi bali bachigusha haguma n'echigusho ch'abemeezi. Banayigiriza abantu banene. Mw'echi gishagala ch'eAntiyokiya mw'abemeezi bahamagalwaga «Bakirisitu» oku burhanzi.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Echijiro ch'oburhabaale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Mwamo mango, baleebi baguma bachima gurhenga eYerusaleema kuja eAntiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Muguma omu bo, oyirikwa Hagabo, ayimanga n'ogurhondera kuleeba n'obuhashe bwa Muuka-Mutagatiifu okw'enzara nene yaaba omu gulu lyooshi. Eyo nzara yava yaaba amango mw'omwami mukulu Kuloode w'eRooma. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Abemeezi b'eAntiyokiya baava bahiga gurhumira abemeezi bali balamire eYudeeya oburhabaale, ngasi muguma gukulikirana na okw'agalire. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Baagusha esholoolo haguma, bayirhumira abashamuka b'echigusho ch'abemeezi b'eYerusaleema kulengera Baranaaba na Saawulo.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Okuyirhwa kwa Yakobo n'ogushwekwa kwa Petero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Mw'amo mango, mwami <char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char> arhondera kulibuza bantu baguma b'echigusho ch'abemeezi. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Anayirha Yakobo mwene waabo Yohaana n'engoorho. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Abeere abona okw'ebyo byasimiisize aBayaahudi, aderha oku bafarhe Petero naye. Ebyoola byajirikaga amango m'edinye y'emigati nzira chachu. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Abeere amafarha Petero n'okumuhira omu munyororo, amuhira omu bulanzi bw'ebigusho bine by'abasoda baneebane eyi bali guhinguulirana. Ajira ntyo ey'ali gukengeera okw'amuburaniisa embere w'olubaga enyuma w'<char style="w" lemma="Paasaka">ePaasaka</char>. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Oku Petero alangirwe omu munyororo, echigusho ch'abemeezi boowe baliiri bakomeza kumusaliirira bweneene emwa Nnamahanga.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malahika wa Nnaweerhu akuula Petero omu munyororo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Obudufu b'olo lusiku <char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char> akaburanyize Petero, Petero alilyaamire ahagarhi k'abasoda babiri ey'anashwekerwe n'amalegule mabiri. N'abalanzi baliiri embere z'omulyango eyi bali balanga omunyororo. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Ho n'aho <char style="w" lemma="Malahika:">malahika</char> wa Nnaweerhu ahulukira n'obumoleke bwayunjula omu busiika b'ogo munyororo. Malahika abanda ku Petero omu mbavu, amuchula n'okumubwira ntya: «Yimanga juba!» Amalegule malishwekere amaboko maage machishwekuula, marhogera ahashi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Malahika ava amubwira ntya: «Yambala omukaba gwawe n'ebiraato byaawe.» Naye ajira ntyo. Kandi, malahika amubwira ntya: «Yambala egorhe lyawe, onankulikire.» <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Petero ahuluka eyi anamukulikiire, aliko arhamenyaga kw'echijiro cha malahika chiri ch'okuli: alikengereere okw'abonekeerwe. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Babeere bamarhaluka echigusho girhanzi ch'abalanzi n'echakabiri, baahika oku mulyango gw'echuuma guyerekeere omu gishagala. Ogo mulyango gwachichinguula gonyine embere zaabo. Nabo bahuluka n'ogukomeza kugenda omu njira. Ho n'aho oyo malahika amuleka. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Petero abeere arhegeera okw'ebyabeere biri by'okuli, ava aderha ntya: «Bunoola namaaja naamenya oku Nnaweerhu arhumaga malahika waage, anankuulire omu maboko ma Heroode n'omu mabi mooshi aBayaahudi balilangaliire okw'ankolera.»<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Petero abeere amenya bwinja ebyabeere, agenda emwa Mariya, nyina wa Yohaana. Oyo Yohaana ye washembulwaga Mariko. Omu mwage mu bantu banene balichigushire n'ogusaliira Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Petero abeere akongoorha oku lunvi lw'embuga, omukozi muguma w'omunyere oyirikwa Rooda ayegeera omulyango kubaza nde oli akongoorha. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Arhegeera omulenge gwa Petero, aliko ahaali h'okumuchinguulira, alibirha n'obushaguluke kuja kubwira abaabo oku Petero ali oku mulyango gw'embuga. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Nabo bamubwira ntya: «Ego munyere! Wasirehere!» Aliko Rooda agendekera kuderha ntya: «Neechi, yeewe maani!» Boowe baliiri bakomeza kuderha ntya: «Oyoola, ali malahika waage.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu nkengeero z'ekiyaahudi, ngasi muntu aligwerhe malahika waage w'okumulanga. Oyoola malahika aliiri ahulukira eyi agwerhe eshusho ly'oyoola muntu.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Aliko Petero agendekera gukongoorha oku lunvi. Baava bachinguula, banasoomerwa bweneene kumubona. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Abasimira n'okuboko mpu basire. Ababalira gurhe Nnaweerhu amukuulire omu munyororo n'okubabwira ntya: «Mubibalire Yakobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oyuula Yakobo aliiri mwene waabo Yeesu. Osome Bagalatiya 1.19.</char></note> na beene beerhu.» Petero ava ahuluka n'okuja ahandi hantu.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Bwacheere eseezi, abasoda bagwarha obuuba bunene n'okubazana ntya: «Bichi byahikiire Petero?» <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Heroode arhuma abantu mpu bamushonde, aliko barhamubonaga. Asambiisa abalanzi, anarhegeka oku bayirhwe. Oku buzinda, Heroode arhenga <char style="w" lemma="Yuuda, Yudeeya">eYudeeya</char> ayandagalira omu gishagala ch'eKayizariya gurhanga kubeera yo.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogufa kwa mwami Heroode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Amo mango, haliiri obushombanyi ahagarhi ka Heroode n'abantu b'egishagala ch'eTiiro n'abe ch'eSidoona. Aliko, abo bantu bachihira haguma, baaja kumulola. Barhanga kuyunviikana na Balasito waliyimangiire enju ya mwami, baaja bahema omurhuula emwa mwami Heroode. Bulaala ebiryo bagendaga balya omu gihugo chaabo, byabaaga birhenga omu gihugo ch'oyo mwami. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Olusiku bayunvikanaga lwabeere lwahika, <char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char> ayambala emyambalo y'echaami, ayikala oku ntebe yaage y'obwami ekarubanda, arhondera kuderha embere z'abantu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />N'abantu nabo baalema baderha ntya n'omulenge munene: «Gurhali mulenge g'omuntu ogu, sy'aliko guli gw'emaana!» <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Ho n'aho, malahika wa Nnaweerhu ahaana Heroode, bulaala arhakuuzaga Nnamahanga, sy'achikuuza yenyine. Enzoka z'omu nda zamuluma bweneene, ava afa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Aliko, eChinwa cha Nnamahanga chagendeerera kuja embere n'okuyandaala ahantu hanene. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Baranaaba na Saawulo babeere bamaamala akaasi kaabo eYerusaleema, bagaluka eAntiyokiya eyi bali haguma na Yohaana washembulwaga Mariko.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Muuka-Mutagatiifu agishoga Baranaaba na Saawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Omu chigusho ch'abemeezi b'eAntiyokiya, mwaliiri abaleebi n'abigiriza: Baranaaba, Simeooni oyirikwa Mwiragula, Lukiyo w'eKureene, Manaheni walembwaga haguma na mwami <char style="w" lemma="Heroode:">Heroode</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oyu ali Heroode Antipaasi. </char><char style="xt">Osome <ref loc="LUK 3:1">Luuka 3.1</ref>.</char> Arhali ola oyandikirwe omu <char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:20-25">Bijiro 12.20-25</ref>. </char></note>, na Saawulo. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Lusiku luguma, oku bali baharamya Nnaweerhu n'oguchiibuza kulya, Muuka-Mutagatiifu aderha ntya: «Mumpirire eburhambi Baranaaba na Saawulo gukulikirana n'akaasi nabahamagaliire.» <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Bayuusize guchiibuza kulya, basaliira, babalambuulira kw'amaboko, banabarhuma bagende gukolera Nnamahanga.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baranaaba na Saawulo baabala oMwazi Mwinja eGipuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Muuka-Mutagatiifu abeere arhuma Baranaaba na Saawulo, bayandagalira omu gishagala ch'eSelukiya. Mw'echo gishagala, barhoola echombo, babalamira oku chizimba ch'eGipuro. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Babeere baahika omu gishagala ch'eSalami, baabala omwazi gwa Nnamahanga omu masinagoogi m'aBayaahudi. Baliiri haguma na Yohaana oyirikwa Mariko nka murhabaazi waabo.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Babeere bamazungula omu chizimba chooshi guhika omu gishagala ch'ePafo, babugaana mo mukurungu muguma w'oMuyaahudi. Oyoola mukurungu aliiri muleebi w'obubeeshi oyirikwa Bara-Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Aliiri murhabaazi wa Serugiyo Paawulo, munyabwenge na murhegesi w'eGipuro. Oyu murhegesi ahamagala Baranaaba na Saawulo baje emwage bulaala alishondere kuyunva eChinwa cha Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Aliko olaala mukurungu Bara-Yeesu, oyirikwa Elima omu Kigiriki, arhonganya Baranaaba na Saawulo, n'ogushonda kubuza oyo murhegesi arhayemeeraga Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Aliko Saawulo, oyirikwa kandi Paawulo, eyi ayunjwizwe Muuka-Mutagatiifu, ava amulola n'ameesho makalihire. <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />Amubwira ntya: «Ego mugala wa Shetaani, mwanzi wa byooshi bikwaneene! Wooyo oyunjwire na ngasi buuko b'obulyaalya n'obubeeshi. K'orhaluha kulema walenganya oMwazi g'okuli gwa Nnaweerhu? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Leero Nnaweerhu akola aguhana. Waaba mpumi, wanamala siku zilebe buzira kulola obumoleke bw'ezuuba.» Ho n'aho oluhomo n'omwizimya byaaja omu meesho maage. Arhondera kumamaarha omu gushonda omuntu w'okumufarha okuboko y'amuyeereka enjira. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Ola murhegesi abeere abona ebyamajirika, asoomererwa enyigirizo za Nnaweerhu, anamuyemeera.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo abala oMwazi Mwinja eAntiyokiya y'ePisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Paawulo n'abaliiri nabo baaja omu chombo, barhenga ePafo, baaja omu gishagala ch'ePeriga omu gihugo ch'ePamfiliya. Babeere baagera yo, Yohaana oyirikwa Mariko abaleka, anagaluka eYerusaleema. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Aliko boowe, Gurhengera ePeriga bakomeza olugenzi lwabo, banahika omu gishagala ch'eAntiyokiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eyila Antiyokiya, erhali ye nguma n'eAntiyokiya y'eSuriya.</char></note> omu gihugo ch'ePisidiya. Olusiku lw'eSaabato baaja omu sinagoogi, banayikala mo. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Enyuma w'ogusomwa kw'ebitaabu by'eRhegeko na eby'abaleebi, abakulu b'esinagoogi babarhumira omuntu ababwire ntya: «Beene beerhu, akonva mugwerhe echinwa ch'ogukomeza abantu omurhima, mujage mwaderha.»<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Paawulo aja ayumanga, abasimira n'okuboko mpu basire, n'okubabwira ntya: «Munyunvirize, bantu b'eIsraheeli nenyu mwe bandi muyuubaha Nnamahanga! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Nnamahanga w'olu lubaga lw'eIsraheeli, agishogere bashookuluza beerhu. Abajira kuba lubaga lunene amango balibungiire omu gihugo ch'<char style="w" lemma="Miisiri:">eMiisiri</char>. Buzinda abakuula yo omu buhashe bwage bunene. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Aliiri kulembera engeso zaabo zibi amango baliiri omu mpinga hoofu myaaka makumi mane. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Abeere amahima embaga mushanvu z'egihugo ch'eKanaana, abaheereza echo gihugo kuba gashambala kaabo. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Ebyoola byooshi byamala hoofu myaaka magana mane na makumi marhaano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">«Buzinda bw'aho, abaha abazuuzi, guhika oku muleebi Samweri. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Oku buzinda bahema omwami. Nnamahanga abaha Saawulo, mugala wa Kiisi, w'omu buuko bwa Benjamina, abarhegeke myaaka makumi mane. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Nnamahanga abeere amakuula Saawulo oku bwami, ayimika Daawudi. Oyu Daawudi ye Nnamahanga ahamiirizaga ko ntya: ‹Nabwene Daawudi, mugala wa Yeese, ali muntu omurhima gwani gusiimire; nj'ajira byooshi nshondere ajire.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="1SA 13:14">1 Samweri 13.14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:21">Nanga 89.21</ref></char><char style="ft" closed="false">changwa 89.20 omu Bibuliya z'ezindi ndimi.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Gurhengera omu mulala gw'oyo Daawudi mu Nnamahanga akuulaga Yeesu kuba Muchunguzi wa Israheeli, gukulikirana n'echilagaane chaage. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Embere z'oguhika kwage, Yohaana abwira abantu b'olubaga looshi lw'eIsraheeli baleke ebyaaha, banabatiizwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Amango Yohaana abeere akola hoofu kuyuusa omulimo gwage, aliiri aderha ntya: ‹Mukengereere oku nyoono ndi nde? Nyoono ntali oyo muli mwalinga! Aliko ayinjire enyuma zaani, eyi nyoono ntakwaneene chiro gushwekuula emigozi y'ebiraato byaage.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yohaana 1.20</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />«Beene beerhu, bantu b'omu mulala gwa <char style="w" lemma="Abrahaamu:">Abrahaamu</char> nenyu mweshi b'ezindi mbaga muyuubaha Nnamahanga, echi Chinwa ch'obuchunguke girhumirwe emwerhu. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Kwenge aBanyayerusaleema n'abarhegesi baabo barharhegeeraga Yeesu ali nde. Barhamenyaga ebinwa by'abaleebi bisomwa ngasi lusiku lw'eSaabato. Aliko omu kumuhana baajira nka kulaala aMandiko mali maderhere. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Buzira kubona echagarhumire ahanirwa ogufa, bahema Pilaato amuyirhe. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Babeere baamala kujira byooshi byaliyandikirwe elugulu waage, bamuyandagaza oku musalaaba, banamuhira omu shinda. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Aliko Nnamahanga amufuulire omu bafu. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Abonekeene siku zinene oku bantu bazamuukaga naye gurhenga eGalilaaya kuja eYerusaleema, na bunoola, bo bali bahamiiriza baage oku lubaga lw'eIsraheeli. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Neerhu, rhubabaliire ogu Mwazi Mwinja, oku echilagaane Nnamahanga ahaaga bashookuluza beerhu, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />arhujiriire cho rhwe baana baabo, omu gufuula Yeesu. Ogu mwazi guyandikirwe ntya omu chigabi cha kabiri ch'eNanga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‹Wooyo oli Mugala waani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">Nyoono nye nkuburhire zeene.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Nanga 2.7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />N'elugulu w'ogufuuka kwa Yeesu, y'arhabola, Nnamahanga aderha ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‹Naguha emigisho ntagatiifu nalaganyaga Daawudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">emigisho y'okuli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isaya 55.3</ref>.</char></note>›<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Cho girhumire aderhere ntya omu chindi chigabi ch'aMandiko Matagatiifu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‹Orhaaleka oMutagatiifu waawe abole.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Nanga 16.10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Daawudi yeewe, abeere amamala gukola gukulikirana n'oku Nnamahanga alirheganyize omu kalamo kaage, afa. Ahambwa aha burhambi bw'eshinda za b'esheekuluza, anabola. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Aliko olaala Nnamahanga afuulaga, yeewe arhabolaga.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38-39" />«Beene beerhu, mukwaneene kumenya oku kugerera yeewe, omwazi g'obubabale bw'ebyaaha gwabalirwe emwenyu. Kugerera oyu Yeesu, ngaasi yeeshi omuyemeerere ababalirwa ebyaaha, aliko murhakababalirwe kugerera amarhegeko ma Muusa. <verse eid="ACT 13:38-39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Boboola muchilange y'ebiyandikirwe ntya omu bitaabu by'abaleebi birhabahikira:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‹Mulole, mwe mugwerhe agakeno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">musoomerwe munahirime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">kwenge nyoono, najira ekijiro omu gihe chenyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">ekijiro murhakayemereere nachiro akaba bakababwirire cho.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="HAB 1:5">Habakuuki 1.5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Paawulo na Baranaaba babeere bahuluka omu sinagoogi, abantu babayinginga bashube kuyinja kubabalira eyo myaazi olusiku lw'eSaabato yakulikira. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Enyuma z'enshimaanano, aBayaahudi banene n'abandi bantu b'ezindi mbaga bayemeeraga edini ly'ekiyaahudi n'ogukuuza Nnamahanga, bakulikira Paawulo na Baranaaba. Abo bombi baganiira haguma n'abo bantu, banagendekera gukomeza bo, yi barhaleka guseera omu lukogo lwa Nnamahanga.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo na Baranaaba bayeerekera emw'abarhali Bayaahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Olusiku lw'eSaabato yakulikiraga, hoofu abantu booshi b'egishagala bachigusha haguma kuyunva eChinwa cha Nnaweerhu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />aBayaahudi babeere baabona echo chigusho ch'abantu, bafarhwa n'obongwa bunene. Balahira ebinwa bya Paawulo, banamuhamiiriza obubeeshi. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Paawulo na Baranaaba baaja bababwira ntya buzira buuba: «Byaliiri bya bulagiirire mwabo mwe murhangage mubalirwe eChinwa cha Nnamahanga. Aliko oboola yi mwalahira cho, munali mwachiganja nka mwabo murhakwaneene akalamo k'esiku n'amango, rhwabo rhwayerekera emwa b'abarhali Bayaahudi. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Kwenge Nnaweerhu arhurhegekere ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‹Nakujirire bumoleke bw'abarhali Bayaahudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">y'oheeka obuchunguke omu gulu lyooshi.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="ISA 49:6">Isaya 49.6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Abarhali Bayaahudi babeere bayunva eyo myaazi, bamoga. Bakuuza eChinwa cha Nnaweerhu. Na booshi balirheganyizwe akalamo k'esiku n'amango bayemeera Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Echinwa cha Nnaweerhu chagenda chayandaala omu gihugo chooshi. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Aliko aBayaahudi bayoohya abakazi bakengerwe, banasiima guharamya Nnamahanga, haguma n'abashamuka b'egishagala. Barhondera kulibuza Paawulo na Baranaaba, banabalibisya omu gihugo chaabo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Paawulo na Baranaaba babakungurhira k'olujuchu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.51 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ogukunguurhira abantu olujuchu l'oku magulu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kwaliiri kuderha k'omuntu warhumirwe arhachigwerhe mwinda oku bantu arhumwaga ko akaba balahiire omwazi abaleerheraga.</char></note> lw'oku magulu maabo, banachijiira omu gishagala ch'eIkoniyo. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Aliko abemeezi boowe baliyunjwire obushagaluke n'oMuuka-Mutagatiifu.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Paawulo na Baranaaba bayigiriza oMwazi Mwinja omu gishagala ch'eIkoniyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Babeere bali eIkoniyo, Paawulo na Baranaaba, baja omu sinagoogi y'aBayaahudi nk'oku bazigaanaga. Bayigiriza, oku bulyo aBayaahudi n'aBagiriki banene bahinduka bemeezi. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Aliko aBayaahudi barhayemeeraga Kirisitu, bayoohya abarhali Bayaahudi mpu bashombe abemeezi. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Aliko, Paawulo na Baranaaba bajira siku zinene eIkoniyo. Baliiri bayigiriza elugulu wa Nnaweerhu buzira buuba. Na Nnaweerhu naye aliiri abagaliisa kujira ebimenyeeso n'ebigiriginjo, omu guhamiiriza okw'omwazi gwage g'olukogo guli g'okuli. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Omu gishagala che Ikoniyo, abantu bachigaba kabiri. Baguma baaja oku lunda lw'aBayaahudi, n'abandi oku lunda lw'eNtumwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Aliko, aBayaahudi n'abarhali Bayaahudi haguma n'abarhegesi baabo, baaja kaligi kw'okulibuza n'okuyirha Paawulo na Baranaaba omu kubabanda amabaale. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Nabo babeere babimenya, balibirhira omu bishagala by'eLisitira n'eDerebe, by'omu gihugo ch'eLikaoniya; n'omu hantu hatureene byo. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Eyoola munda, bagendekera kubala oMwazi Mwinja.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogufuma kw'echirema eLisitira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Omu gishagala ch'eLisitira, haliiri muntu muguma w'echirema. Arhalambagiraga chiro n'olusiku luguma, bulaala aburhwaga eyi ali chirema ch'amagulu. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Lusiku luguma, ey'ayikeere, ayunviriza enyigirizo za Paawulo. Paawulo amulolereza n'okubona okw'agwerhe obwemeezi bwagarhuma afumiiswa. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Ava amubwira ntya n'omulenge munene: «Yuumuka, yimangira oku magulu maawe!» Oyo muntu ayimanga ho n'aho, anarhondera kulambagira.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Abantu banene balichigushire, babeere baabona ebi Paawulo ajirire, baliika omulenge n'okuderha ntya omu lulimi lw'eKilikaoniya: «Emaana zachihindwire nk'abantu, zanayandagaliire eno mwerhu!» <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Baliiri bayirika Baranaaba eziino ly'emaana Zeusi, Paawulo naye bamuyirika eziino ly'emaana Herime, kwenge ye waliiri w'okuderha.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu dini lw'ekigiriki, Zeusi aliiri mukulu w'emaana na Herime aliiri ntumwa yaazo.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Omudaahwa w'omu kajumiro k'emaana Zeusi kaliiri embere z'egishagala, aleerha oku milyango y'egishagala empanzi n'emikalaba elukiirwe k'obwaso. Abileerhaga bulaala yeewe haguma n'echo chigusho ch'abantu balishondere gurhuula entuulo. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Aliko Baranaaba na Paawulo babeere bayunva ogo mwazi, babera emishangi yaabo omu kuyeerekana oku bagayire, n'okuva balibirha omu bantu eyi bali baderha ntya n'omulenge munene: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />«Beera baani, gichi girhumire mwajira ntyo? Neerhu, rhuli bantu kuguma nenyu! Akaba yi rhwababalira oMwazi Mwinja, kuli gushonda muleke ebi bintu bya bushaabusha, munahindamukire Nnamahanga olamire. Yeewe ye walemaga echaalege, egulu n'enyanja, na byooshi biri omu byo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Omu siku zageraga, Nnamahaanga alilekere abarhali Bayaahudi booshi bakulikiire enjira zaabo. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Nachiro ntyo, arhalekaga guchihamiiriza kugerera ebijiro binja. Abaha mwabo gurhengera omu chaalege envula n'ebihe biyeeza, anabayuugusya ebiryo n'okuyunjuza emirhima yenyu n'obushagaluke bunene.» <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Nachiro mpu Paawulo na Baranaaba baliderhere ebiila byooshi, birhali biyoolohere kubuza abantu barharhuuliraga bo entuulo.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Enyuma w'ebyoola, aBayaahudi baguma baahika gurhengera omu gishagala ch'eAntiyokiya n'eche Ikoniyo. Bayoohya abantu, babanda Paawulo amabaale, banamukululira embuga w'egishagala eyi bakengereere okw'afiire. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Aliko abemeezi babeere bamugorha, ayuumuka, agaluka mw'echo gishagala ch'eLisitira. Olusiku lwakulikiraga, aja omu gishagala ch'eDerebe haguma na Baranaaba.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo na Baranaaba bagaluka eAntiyokiya y'eSuriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Oku bali eDerebe, baalema baabala oMwazi Mwinja, abantu banene bayemeera Yeesu. Buzinda, bagaluka, baaja eLisitira, eIkoniyo n'eAntiyokiya y'ePisidiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Eyo munda, baliiri bakomeza abemeezi omurhima n'okubahanuula baseere omu bwemeezi. Baliiri bababwira ntya: «Rhukwaneene kugera omu malibuko manene yi rhuja omu Bwami bwa Nnamahanga.» <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />N'omu ngasi chigusho ch'abemeezi, Paawulo na Baranaaba bachishoga mo abashamuka b'okubiyimangira. Babeere bamasaliira n'oguchiibuza kulya, babahira omu maboko ma Nnaweerhu, ye bali bayemereere.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Enyuma z'aho, bagerera omu gihugo ch'ePisidiya, banahika omu ch'ePamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Bamalire kuyigiriza eChinwa cha Nnamahanga oku bantu b'omu gishagala ch'ePeriga, bachimira omu siiko y'eAtaliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Gurhengera eyoola, basuuka n'echombo kuja eAntiyokiya y'eSuriya. Eyoola yi bahemeraga bo omugisho gwa Nnamahanga kw'aka kaasi bamakola.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="ACT 13:1-3">Bijiro 13.1-3</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Babeere baahika, bagusha echigusho ch'abemeezi, banashambaalira bo byooshi Nnamahanga ali ajirire haguma nabo, na gurhe achinguuliraga abarhali Bayaahudi omulyango g'obwemeezi. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Paawulo na Baranaaba babeera eyoola siku zinene haguma n'abemeezi.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Obuhaka elugulu w'enkembuulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Mw'ezoola siku, bantu baguma bachimira eAntiyokiya gurhengera eYudeeya. Barhondera kuyigiriza abemeezi ntya: «Akaba murhakembwirwe gukulikirana n'emigenzo ya Muusa, murhagachungulwa.» <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Paawulo na Baranaaba babalahirira, banajira obuhaka bunene haguma nabo elugulu w'oguula mwazi. Abemeezi baahiga oku Paawulo na Baranaaba haguma n'abandi baguma omu bo bazamukire eYerusaleema kuganiira kw'echo chibazo embere z'eNtumwa n'abashamuka b'echigusho ch'abemeezi. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Echigusho ch'abemeezi chabaheereza ebintu byooshi by'olugenzi balilagire ko. Baagera omu gihugo ch'eFoyinikiya na ech'eSamariya, baliiri baabala gurhe abarhali Bayaahudi bayemereere kuba bemeezi. Ogu mwazi gwaliiri gwasimiisa bweneene abemeezi booshi. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Bahikire eYerusaleema, bayankirirwa n'eNtumwa, n'echigusho ch'abemeezi haguma n'abashamuka baacho. Babala byooshi Nnamahanga ajirire kugerera bo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Aliko, bantu baguma b'omu chigusho ch'<char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char> bahindukaga bemeezi, bayimanga n'okuderha ntya: «Bihemere <char style="w" lemma="Nkembuulo:">gukembuula</char> abarhali Bayaahudi n'okubarhegeka ogukenga eRhegeko lya Muusa.»<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Enaama y'okumala obuhaka b'ogukembuulwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Entumwa n'abashamuka b'echigusho ch'abemeezi bajira enaama elugulu w'echo chibazo. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Enyuma z'obuhaka bunene, Petero ayimanga n'okubabwira ntya: «Beene beerhu, muyinji bwinja oku gurhengera miira Nnamahanga andondwere ahagarhi kenyu yi kugerera obuunu bwani, abarhali Bayaahudi bayunve oMwazi Mwinja, banayemeere Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Na Nnamahanga oyinji emirhima y'abantu, aliyerekeene oku ayemereere abarhali Bayaahudi nabo omu guha bo Muuka-Mutagatiifu kuguma neerhu. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Nta kalondoole ajirire ahagarhi keerhu nabo, bulaala acheeseze emirhima yaabo kugerera obwemeezi. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Chagarhuma bunoola mwageregeza Nnamahanga omu guheesa abemeezi ogu muzigo, abe bashookuluza beerhu, abe neerhu rhwenyine rhurhagalaga guheeka? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Maani neerhu, rhuyinji oku rhwachungwirwe elugulu w'olukogo lwa Nnaweerhu Yeesu, nk'oku nabo bachungwirwe.»<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Abantu booshi balichigushire baasira. Bayunviriza oku Paawulo na Baranaaba baabala emyaazi elugulu w'ebimenyeeso n'ebigiriginjo byooshi Nnamahanga ajirire kugerera bo ahagarhi k'abarhali Bayaahudi. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Babeere baasira, Yakobo naye aderha ntya: «Beene beerhu, munyunvirize! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simooni Petero arhubaliire gurhe Nnamahanga achiyerekeene oku barhali Bayaahudi oku burhanzi y'achishoga baguma omu bo babe bantu baage. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Eyi myaazi eri kuguma n'ebinwa by'abaleebi nk'okubiyandikirwe ntya:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‹Buzinda bw'aho, nji naagaluka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">n'ogushuba kuyumbaka enju ya Daawudi yashandeere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Nji nashuba kuyumbaka ebiguuka byaayo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">n'okuyiyumanza,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />y'abandi bantu booshi bashonde Nnaweerhu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">neechi, abantu b'embaga zooshi nahamageere babe baani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Ntyo ku Nnaweerhu aderhere, yi wajiraga ebyo bintu<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />biyinjikeene gurhengera miira.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.16-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amoosi 9.11-12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Cho girhumire, nyoono, mbwene oku rhurhalibuzaga abarhali Bayaahudi bali bayemeera Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Aliko, rhubayandikire oku barhalyaaga ebiryo byarhuulirwaga emaana, banachilange n'obuhushi. Barhanalemaga baalya enyama zakanulwaga changwa omulegano. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Bulaala gurhengera miira, eRhegeko lya Muusa linayigirizwa omu ngasi gishagala, linasomwa omu masinagoogi m'aBayaahudi ngasi lusiku lw'eSaabato.»<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amaruba oku bemeezi barhali Bayaahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Enyuma z'aho, eNtumwa, abashamuka n'echigusho chooshi ch'abemeezi ch'eYerusaleema, babona oku bakwaneene bachishoge ahagarhi kaabo bantu baguma, banabarhume eAntiyokiya haguma na Paawulo na Baranaaba. Baava bagishoga Yuuda oyirikwa kandi Barisaba na Siila. Abo bantu oku bali babiri balikengerwe bweneene embere z'abaabo bemeezi. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Babarhuma n'amaruba maliyandikirwe mo ntya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">«Rhwabo, eNtumwa n'abashamuka b'echigusho ch'abemeezi, rhwabo benyu bemeezi, rhwabalamwise mwabo bemeezi murhali Bayaahudi muli omu gishagala ch'eAntiyokiya, n'omu gihugo ch'eSuriya na ech'eKilikiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Rhwayunviirhe oku bantu baguma barhengeraga eno mwerhu, bababwirire emyaazi y'okubalibuza n'okubahahaaza emirhima. Aliko rhurhabarhumaga. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Boboola, oku rhuli rhweshi haguma, rhwayunvikeene gugishoga bantu baguma, rhwamabarhuma emwenyu, bayinje haguma n'abazigirwa beerhu Baranaaba na Paawulo. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Abo bombi, bayemereere guhaana akalamo kaabo omu gukolera Nnaweerhu Yeesu Kirisitu. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Ntyo ku rhwamabarhumira Yuuda na Siila. Nabo, bababwira buunu oku bwindi ebinwa rhubayandikiire. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Kandi, kuli kwinja emwa Muuka-Mutagatiifu n'emwerhu ogurhabahekesa ogwindi muzigo kuleka ebiri by'akamaro: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />murhalyaaga enyama barhuuliraga emaana n'omulegano changwa enyama zakanulwaga, munachilange n'obuhushi. Mugachilanga kw'ebi, mwaba mwajirire bwinja. Buchaage!»<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Bamalire guseezerana, abo barhumagwa bagenda n'okuyandagalira eAntiyokiya. Bagerere eyo, bagusha abemeezi booshi, banabahereza amo maruba. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Nabo, babeere bamamasoma, basiima elugulu w'ebinwa by'okubaseeza omurhima byabaaga biyandikirwe mo. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Gukulikirana n'oku Yuuda na Siila baliiri baleebi, babwira abaabo bemeezi binwa binene by'okubaseeza omurhima n'okubakomeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Babeere bamamala yo siku, abemeezi babaseezera, banababwira bagaluke n'obuholo yi bashigaane ababarhumaga. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />[Aliko Siila yeewe abona bwinja ayoorhe eyo munda.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olu lukere lurhali omu bitaabu biguma bya miira.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Paawulo na Baranaaba nabo bayoorha eyo Antiyokiya. Boowe haguma n'abandi bantu banene, baalema bayigiriza n'okuyamagaza oMwazi Mwinja guyerekeere Nnaweerhu.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo na Baranaaba balekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Enyuma w'esiku zigeeke, Paawulo abwira Baranaaba ntya: «Rhugaluke rhuje kulola beene beerhu bemeezi omu bishagala byooshi rhwayigirizaga m'oMwazi gwa Nnaweerhu, rhumenye gurhe yi baalama.» <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Baranaaba alishondere Yohaana oyirikwa Mariko agende haguma nabo. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Aliko Paawulo abona oku birhakwiriire, kwenge Mariko abaaga abalekere omu gihugo ch'ePamfiliya, analilahiire kugendekeza gukola haguma nabo. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Haja haahulukira obuhaka bunene bwarhuma balekana. Baranaaba agenda aherekezwe na Mariko, baja omu chombo, bayambukira oku chizimba ch'eGipuro. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Paawulo achishoga Siila. Abemeezi bamalire kumuhemera olukogo lwa Nnaweerhu, agenda. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Agerera omu gihugo ch'eSuriya n'eche Kilikiya ey'ali akomeza ebigusho by'abemeezi.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoteyo aherekeza Paawulo na Siila omu kaasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Paawulo ahika omu gishagala ch'eDerebe n'eche Lisitira. Eyo munda yaliiri omwemeezi muguma oyirikwa Timoteyo. Nyina aliiri Muyaahudi-kazi oyemeerere Yeesu, n'eshe aliiri Mugiriki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Abemeezi b'egishala ch'eLisitira n'eche Ikoniyo baliiri bahamiiriza bwinja oyo Timoteyo. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paawulo alishondere Timoteyo amuherekeze. Aliko, aBayaahudi balilamire eyo munda, booshi baliyinji okw'eshe aliiri Mugiriki. Charhuma Paawulo amukembuula yi bamuyemeera. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Omu bishagala baliiri balenga mo, baalema baabalira abemeezi amarhegeko eNtumwa n'abashamuka b'echigusho ch'abemeezi b'eYerusaleema bahaaga bo n'okubahema bamakulikire. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Na ntyo, ebigusho by'abemeezi byakomera omu bwemeezi n'oluganjo lw'abemeezi lwagendekera kuyuushuka ngasi lusiku.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo abonekerwa omu gishagala ch'eTorowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Paawulo n'abalimuherekeeze baagera omu gihugo ch'eFurigiya na ech'eGalatiya bulaala Muuka-Mutagatiifu alibabuzize kubala eChinwa cha Nnamahanga omu gihugo ch'eAziya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Babeere baahika hoofu n'egihugo ch'eMisiya bahiga kuja omu gihugo ch'eBitiniya, aliko Muuka gwa Yeesu arhabayemeereraga. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Baaja baagera eburhambi bw'eMisiya, bayandagalira omu gishagala ch'eTorowa.<verse eid="ACT 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Omu budufu, Paawulo abonekerwa. Abona mulume muguma w'eMakedoniya waliyimangire embere zaage, amuyinginga ntya: «Oyambukire eMakedoniya, oyinje orhurhabaale.» <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Ho n'aho, enyuma z'okoola kubonekerwa, rhwachirheganya kuja eMakedoniya, bulaala rhwalibwene oku Nnamahanga arhuhamageere kubala eyoola munda oMwazi Mwinja.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludiya ayemeera Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Gurhenga eTorowa rhwabalama n'echombo, rhwabera omuhengere kuja eSamotirake. Olusiku lwakulikiraga, rhwahika eNeyapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Rhwarhenga eNeyapoli, rhwahika eFiripi, gishagala gikulu ch'egihugo ch'eMakedoniya. Echo gishagala chaliiri omu buja bw'aBarooma. Rhwabeera mo siku zigeeke.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Olusiku lw'eSaabato, rhwarhenga mw'echo gishagala, rhwaja hoofu n'olwinji, bulaala rhwalikengerere oku ho hantu hajirirwa amasaala. Rhwabere rhwahika, rhwayikala n'ogushambala n'abakazi baliiri bachigushire ho. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Muguma mubo, oyirikwa Ludiya, aliiri murhimbuuzi w'ebiraka bidukula by'agachiiro. Aliiri w'egishagala ch'eTuwatera, analemaga aharamya Nnamahanga. Aliiri ayunviriza, na Nnaweerhu amuheereza omurhima g'ogukulikira oMwazi Mwinja Paawulo aliiri aderha. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Ludiya abeere amabatiizwa haguma n'abantu bw'omu mwage, arhulaalika omu kuderha ntya: «Akaba mubwene oku nyemereere Nnaweerhu, muyinje emwani munahande yo.» Arhuseeza rhuyemeere.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo na Siila bakabulwa omu munyororo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Lusiku luguma, rhwabeere rhulirhwaja ahantu ha masaala, rhwabugaanana n'omukozi w'omunyere. Oyo mukozi aligwerhe omuzimu w'obulaguzi. N'elugulu w'oboola bulaguzi alemaga achiza bannahamwabo. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Arhukulikira, rhwabo na Paawulo. Aliiri ayamuuza ntya: «Aba bantu bali baja ba Nnamahanga w'Elugulu Bweneene. Bali babashambaalira enjira y'obuchunguke.» <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Alema ajira ntyo siku zinene. Paawulo agwarha oburhe elugulu waage, ahindamuka n'okubwira oyo muzimu ntya: «Ngurhegekere oku ziino lya Yeesu Kirisitu, orhenge mw'oyu munyere!» Ho n'aho oyo muzimu amurhenga mo.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Bannahamwabo oyo mukozi w'omunyere babeere baabona okw'obulangaalire b'obuchire bwamahwa oku ye, bafarha Paawulo na Siila, babakululira omu kabuga embere z'abarhegesi b'egishagala. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Babeere bahisa bo embere z'abo barhegesi, baderha ntya: «Aba bantu bali Bayaahudi, yi bararusa abantu omu gishagala cheerhu. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Yi bayigiriza emicho rhwe Barooma rhulahiizwe kuyemeera changwa gukulikira.»<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Echigusho ch'abantu nacho chagwira oku bo. Abazuuzi b'egishagala barhegeka oku babakuule emyambalo n'okubashurha enkoni. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Enyuma z'okubashuurha bweneene, babahira omu munyororo n'ogurhegeka okw'omulanzi abalange bwinja. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Babeere bamamurhegeka ntyo, oyo mulanzi abahira omu busiika b'omunyororo n'ogushwekera amagulu maabo oku bihirho by'emirhi.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul et Silas dans la prison leurs pieds attachés dans des blocs de bois" file="lb00337c.tif" size="col" ref="16.24">Paawulo na Siila omu munyororo bashwekerwe amagulu omu bihirho</figure><verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Ahagarhi kw'obudufu, Paawulo na Siila baliiri basaliira n'okuyimpa enyimpo z'obukuuze emwa Nnamahanga. N'abandi balishwekerwe baliiri babayunva. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Ho n'aho haaba omusisi gunene, gwadirhimanya enkingi z'omunyororo. Emilyango yooshi yava yagichinguula n'amalegule mooshi maliiri mabashwekere magishwekuula. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Omulanzi abeere amazuuka, abona emilyango echingwirwe, ahulusa engoorho yaage omu luhugurhu mpu achiyirhe, bulaala alikengereere oku abaliiri omu munyororo balibirhire. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Aliko Paawulo ayaama bweneene n'okumubwira ntya: «Orhachiyirhaga, bulaala rhweshi rhuli hano!»<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Oyo mulanzi ahema bamulerhere echimole. Ho n'aho achikabula omu munyororo n'okugwa embere za Paawulo na Siila, eyi ali adirhimana. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Buzinda, abaheeka embuga anababaza ntya: «Bannaweerhu, bichi nkwaneene kujira yi nchunguka?» <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Bamushubiza ntya: «Oyemeere Nnaweerhu Yeesu na ntyo wachungulwa, wooyo n'abantu booshi b'omu mwawe.» <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Bamubalira eChinwa cha Nnaweerhu haguma n'abantu b'omu mwage booshi. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Mw'obo budufu, oyo mulanzi arhoola Paawulo na Siila, abashuka ebihulu. Ho n'aho anabatiizwa, yeewe n'abantu baage booshi. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Abeere abaheeka omu mwage, abasheegera. Anasiima bweneene haguma n'abantu bw'omu mwage, kwenge bayemereere Nnamahanga.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Bwabeere bwacha, abazuuzi b'egishagala barhumira oyo mulanzi abasoda baabo mpu: «Alikuule abo bantu.» <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Oyo mulanzi abalira Paawulo eyo myaazi n'okuderha ntya: «Abazuuzi baderhere oku mushwekuulwe, boboola muhuluke, munagende n'omurhuula.» <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Aliko Paawulo abwira abo basooda ntya: «Enyuma z'ogurhushuurhira omu kabuga buzira gurhuchiira olushinja noobo rhuli Barooma, oku buzinda bamarhukabula omu munyororo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paawulo na Siila baliiri Bayaahudi, aliko gukulikirana n'amarhegeko m'ekirooma baligwerhe obukenge bw'aBarooma, banalikwaneene kujirirwa kuguma n'aBarooma. Amarhegeko m'ekirooma mali malahiize ogushuurha oMurooma changwa okumuhira omu munyororo buzira kumubuuranya.</char></note> Leero gurhe bashonda gurhushwekuula omu bwibisho? Birhagalikeene! Bahike bonyine gurhushwekuula!» <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Abo basooda bagaluka n'okubalira abazuuzi b'egishagala ogo mwazi. Babeere bayunva oku Paawulo na Siila baali Barooma, bayuubaha bweneene. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Okoola kwarhuma baaja kubarhebereza, banabaheeka embuga y'omunyororo n'oku bahema barhenge mw'echo gishagala.<verse eid="ACT 16:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Babeere bamarhenga omu munyororo, baaja emwa Ludiya. Enyuma z'okubonana n'abemeezi n'okubakomeza omurhima, bagenda.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Paawulo na Siila omu gishagala ch'eTesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Paawulo na Siila babeere bagendekera n'olugenzi lwabo, balenga omu gishagala ch'eAmfipoli na ech'eApoloniya, banahika omu ch'eTesalonika. Eyoola yaliiri esinagoogi y'aBayaahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Paawulo aja mw'eyo sinagoogi gukulikirana n'oku akoomeraga. Omu Saabato esharhu zikulikireene, ashambaala n'abantu elugulu w'aMandiko Matagatiifu. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Abalira bo anabayereka oku Kirisitu alikwaneene kulibuka n'ogufuuka ahagarhi k'abaafu. Aliiri ababwira ntya: «Oyu Yeesu ndi nabashambaalira ye Kirisitu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Baguma mw'abo Bayaahudi bayemeera, baaja oku lunda lwa Paawulo na Siila. N'aBagiriki banene balemaga baharamya Nnamahanga haguma n'abakazi banene bw'olukengo, nabo bayemeera.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Aliko Bayaahudi baguma bayongwa. Bahamagala bishumuusi biguma byaliiri omu soko, byagusha abantu banene omu gishagala omu gushonda kubararusa. Baja emwa Yasoni gushonda Paawulo na Siila mpu babaheke embere z'abantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Babeere babula bo, bakululira Yasoni n'abemeezi baguma embere za barhegesi b'egishala. Baderha n'omulenge munene ntya: «Abaala, bo baliiri bararusa abantu omu gulu lyooshi, leero bahikire hanoola naho. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Oyu Yasoni abayankirire emwage. Booshi barhali bakulikira amarhegeko m'omwami mukulu Kayizaari, omu kuderha oku hali windi mwami mpu ye Yeesu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Abarhegesi b'egishagala haguma n'olubaga babeere bayunva eyo myaazi, bahahaala. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Babaseeza, Yasoni n'abaabo bahane egikinja ch'efuranga oku barhachirarusa abantu, balikula bo bagenda.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo na Siila omu gishagala ch'eBeroya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Bwabeere bwaba budufu, abemeezi baava babwira Paawulo na Siila bagende omu gishagala ch'eBeroya. Babeere baahika yo, baja omu sinagoogi y'aBayaahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Abantu b'eBeroya baliyemereere kuyunviriza eChinwa cha Nnamahanga kulusha ab'eTesalonika. Baliyankirire cho n'obushiru. Ngasi lusiku balemaga basoma aMandiko Matagatiifu omu kulola akonva ebi Paawulo aliiri aderha byaliiri by'okuli. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />aBayaahudi banene ahagarhi kaabo haguma n'aBagiriki, bayemeera Yeesu. Mw'abo Bagiriki, mwaliiri abakazi bw'olukengo n'abalume banene.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Aliko aBayaahudi b'eTesalonika babeere bayunva oku Paawulo y'abala eChinwa cha Nnamahanga eBeroya nayo, baaja yo gurarusa n'ogukalihya abantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Ho n'aho abemeezi baherekeza Paawulo guhika oku siiko. Aliko Siila na Timoteyo bayoorha eBeroya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Abaherekezaga Paawulo bamugeza omu gishagala ch'eAteene. Babeere bagaluka eBeroya, Paawulo abarhegeka oku babwire Siila na Timoteyo bamubugane juba.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo ayalagaza eChinwa cha Nnamahanga eAteene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paawulo abeere ali alinga Siila na Timoteyo eAteene, omurhima gwamuluma, kubona oku mw'echo gishagala mwaliyunjwire ebishushanyo by'emaana. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Paawulo aliiri ashambaala omu sinagoogi haguma n'aBayaahudi n'abanaharamya Nnamahanga barhali Bayaahudi. Na ngasi lusiku aliiri ashambaala n'abantu alemaga abugaana omu soko. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Kandi, Paawulo alema ashiganana n'abigiriza baguma b'echigusho ch'aBaepikuriyo na ech'aBastoyiko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aBaepikuriyo baliiri bayigiriza oku omuhigo gw'akalamo kuli gushonda obushagaluke n'okuyanga amaganya. Nta dini bakulikiraga. aBastoyiko boowe, baliiri bayigiriza oku abantu bakwaneene kulama buzira bushagaluke changwa amaganya.</char></note>. Aba bigiriza barhondera obuhaka haguma naye. Baguma omu bo babaza ntya: «Oyu shakaderha, bichi ashonda kuderha?» N'abandi baderha ntya: «Bibonekeene oku y'ashambaala elugulu y'emaana z'amandi mahanga.» Baderhaga ntyo, kwenge Paawulo aliiri abala oMwazi Mwinja gwa Yeesu n'obufuuke bw'abafu. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Baava baheka Paawulo omu kabuga kayirikirwe Areyopago<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Areyopago </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eri ziino lyaliiri ly'ehisoozi hy'eAteene. Buzinda bwaho, lyahinduka ziino ly'abashamuka b'egishagala balemaga bachigushaga ahoola.</char></note>. Baamubaza ntya: «Ka wakagala rhumenyesa ezi nyigirizo zihyahya oli wayigiriza? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Bulaala yi warhushambaalira ebintu bihyahya. Boboola rhushondere kumenya bichi biderhere.» <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Byabaaga ntyo kwenge abantu b'eAteene haguma n'abahiisi bali balamire ahagarhi kaabo, balemaga bageza ebishanji byabo byooshi omu kubala n'okuyunviriza ebinwa bihyahyahyahya.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Paawulo aja ayimanga ahagarhi k'eAreyopago n'okuderha ntya: «Bantu b'eAteene, mbwene oku muli bantu basimire bweneene emyaazi y'edini. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Kwenge nabeere ndi nagera omu gishagala chenyu, namabona ebishushanyo by'emaana zenyu munaharamya, namanabona n'entuliro nguma egwerhe emyandiko ederhere ntya: ‹Oku mana erhamenyikene.› Leero, oyu mulimwaharamya buzira kumumenya, yi ndi nabashambaalira.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />«Nnamahanga walemaga egulu n'ebintu byooshi biba mo, yeewe ye Nyina empingu n'egulu. Arhalama omu nju abantu bamuyumbakiraga n'amaboko maabo. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Yeewe arharhabalwa n'abantu nk'olagiriire oku kantu. Yeewe ye heereza booshi omuuka gw'akalamo n'ebintu byooshi bakenere. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Alemaga embaga zooshi gurhengera muntu muguma yi balama omu gulu lyooshi. Abajirira ebihe n'okubachiira embibi z'ebihugo bakwaneene kulama mo. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Nnamahanga alijirire ntyo, kwenge alishondere abantu bamushonde, nkabaga omu kumamarha bagale kumubona. Okuli, arhali hale na ngasi muguma weerhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Kwenge oku buhashe bwage rhulamire, yi rhwalambagira yi rhwanayisa. Ebyoola biri kuguma na kulaala baguma omu bandiisi benyu baderhaga ntya: ‹Neerhu, rhuli bana baage.› <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Bulaala rhuli beene Nnamahanga, birhahemeere rhukengeere oku ali nk'emaana ze oro, z'echuuma chibaragenye changwa amandi mabaale machulwaga oku bulenga n'enkengeero z'abantu.<verse eid="ACT 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />«Nnamahanga arhachiganja ebyo bihe abantu baliiri omu buhwinja. Aliko bunoola arhegekere abantu booshi ba ngasi hantu oku baleke ebyaaha. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Bulaala achishogere olusiku nj'achiira abantu b'egulu lyooshi olushinja omu kuntu gukwaneene kugerera muntu muguma, oy'alondwere kw'ako kaasi. Ayerekeene oku booshi okuli kw'eyi myaazi omu gufuula oyo muntu gurhenga omu bafu.»<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Babeere bayunva Paawulo aderha elugulu w'obufuke bw'abafu, baguma bamushekera aliko abandi baderha ntya: «Nji rhwakuyunviriza kandi olwindi lusiku waderha elugulu w'eyi myaazi.» <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Oku buzinda Paawulo alekana nabo. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Aliko bantu baguma baja okulunda lwage, baaba bemeezi. Ahagarhi kaabo haliiri muntu muguma w'omu kabuga k'eAreyopago oyirikwa Diyonisiyo na mukazi muguma oyirikwa Damari, n'abandi.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Paawulo eKorinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Enyuma w'ebyo, Paawulo arhenga omu gishagala ch'eAteene, aja omu ch'eKorinto. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Ashimaana yo <char style="w" lemma="Muyaahudi:">oMuyaahudi</char> muguma oyirikwa Akila, oburhwa omu gihugo ch'ePonto. Oyo Akila na mukaage Prisila babaaga barhaza kulegama barhengere omu gishagala ch'eRooma omu gihugo ch'eItaliya, bulaala mw'ezo siku mwami mukulu Kayizaari Kuloode alirhegekere oku aBayaahudi booshi barhenge mw'echo gishagala. Paawulo aja kubarhangula, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />abeera nabo, analiiri akola nabo, kwenge baliiri bakola kaasi kaguma naye kw'ogukwiza amahema. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Ngasi lusiku lw'eSaabato, Paawulo alemaga ashambaala n'abantu omu sinagoogi. Aliiri ashonda ayemeeze aBayaahudi n'aBagiriki babe bemeezi.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Aliko Siila na Timoteyo babeere baahika gurhenga eMakedoniya, Paawulo alema ageza ebishanji byaage byooshi omu kuyigiriza eChinwa cha Nnamahanga n'omu kuyeereka aBayaahudi oku Yeesu ye Kirisitu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Babeere balahira Paawulo n'okumudukanga, abakunguurhira emyambalo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">abakunguurhira emyambalo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">:Emwa Bayaahudi, ogukunguurhira emyambalo oku muntu kuli kuderha oku orhachiri haguma n'oyo muntu omu myaazi yaage. </char></note> yaage anababwira ntya: «Eshagama yenyu ebe oku marhwe menyu! Nyoono, nta mwinda gwa muntu ngwerhe. Gurhengera zeene, naaja emw'abarhali Bayaahudi.»<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Paawulo ahuluka mw'eyo sinagoogi, aja omu nju yaliiri aha burhambi. Eyo nju yaliiri y'omuntu oyirikwa Tiito Yusito. Arhaliiri Muyaahudi, aliko alemaga aharamya Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Aliko omukulu w'esinagoogi oyirikwa Krisipo ayemeera Nnaweerhu, yeewe n'abantu booshi b'omu nju yaage. aBakorinto banene baliiri bayunviriza Paawulo nabo bayemeera Yeesu, <char style="w" lemma="Bubatiizo:">babatiizwa</char>.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Lusiku luguma obudufu, Nnaweerhu abonekera Paawulo, anamubwira ntya: «Orhayuubahaga! Gendekera kuderha, orhasiraga, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />kwenge nyoono ndi haguma naawe. Ntaaye waguhira ko okuboko mpu akujire kubi, bulaala mpeerhe olubaga lunene mw'echiila gishagala.»<verse eid="ACT 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Paawulo abeera mwaka muguma na myeezi ndarhu eKorinto eyi ali ayigiriza eChinwa cha Nnamahanga.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo abuurana embere za Galiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Amango Galiyo aliiri murhegesi w'egihugo ch'eAkaya, aBayaahudi bachihira haguma omu kulwisa Paawulo, banamuheeka omu kabuga. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Baderha ntya: «Oyu muntu ali ayemeeza abantu oguharamya Nnamahanga nk'oku eRhegeko lyeerhu lirhahemere.» <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Paawulo abeere ashonda kuderha, Galiyo abashubiza ntya: «Mwabo Bayaahudi, akaba mwagasidaka oyu muntu mpu akolere chibi chirebe changwa mpu ajirire omwazi mubi guzidohere, ahoola nakabayunvire nk'oku bihemere. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Sy'aliko okubona oku obuhaka bwenyu buyerekeere ebinwa, amaziino n'eRhegeko lyenyu, eyo myaazi ebalolere mwenyine. Nyoono ntashonda gucha olushinja luli nk'oluula.» <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ho n'aho, Galiyo abalibisya barhenge mw'ako kabuga. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Booshi baava bafarha omukulu w'esinagoogi oyirikwa Sositeeni, barhondera kumushuurha enkoni embere z'akabuga, aliko Galiyo arhalagaga kw'echo chijiro.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo agaluka eAntiyokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Paawulo ashuba kubeera zindi siku zinene omu gishagala ch'eKorinto. Oku buzinda aseezerana n'abaabo bemeezi n'okuja omu siiko y'eKenkereya. Embere aje omu chombo, arhanga kugembeesa enviiri zaage, kwenge aliiri amalire echilagaane ajiraga emwa Nnamahanga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miira aBayaahudi bagendaga bagembeesa enviiri enyuma y'okumala echilagaane bajiraga emwa Nnamahanga. Barhanachigembeesaga enviiri zaabo guhika echilagaane chiyenere.</char></note> Aja omu chombo yeewe, Prisila na Akila, bagenda omu gihugo ch'eSuriya. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Babeere baahika omu gishagala ch'eEfeeso, Paawulo aleka yo Prisila na Akila. Naye aja omu sinagoogi, ashambaala n'aBayaahudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Abo Bayaahudi bamuhema abeere nabo siku zinene, aliko alahira. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Oku ali abaseezera, ababwira ntya: «Nnamahanga agasiima, nji nashuba kugaluka eno mwenyu.» Oku buzinda aja omu chombo, arhenga eEfeeso. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Abeere ahika omu gishagala ch'eKayizariya, azamuukira eYerusaleema kulamusa echigusho ch'abemeezi. Oku buzinda ayandagalira omu gishagala ch'eAntiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Abeere amamala yo siku zigeeke, agendekera n'olugenzi. Alenga omu gihugo ch'eGalatiya na ech'eFurigiya omu gukomeza abemeezi booshi.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolo aja omu gishagala ch'eEfeeso n'omu gihugo ch'eAkaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Amo mango, Muyaahudi muguma oyirikwa Apolo, muburhwa w'omu gishagala ch'eAlegizanduriya, ahika omu gishagala ch'eEfeeso. Oyo muntu aliiri w'okuderha n'obwenge bunene, analiyinji bweneene aMandiko Matagatiifu. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Aliiri ayigiriizwe eNjira ya Nnaweerhu. Analigwerhe obushiru omu kuderha n'okuyigiriza emyaazi ya Yeesu omu kuli. Aliko aliyinji obubatiizo bwa Yohaana bwonyine. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Aja omu sinagoogi, arhondera kuyigiriza buzira buuba. Prisila na Akila babeere bamuyunviriza y'aderha, bamuheeka emwabo, bamuhuguula bwinjabwinja eNjira ya Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Buzinda bw'aho, Apolo abeere ashonda kuja eAkaya, abemeezi b'eEfeeso bamukomeza omurhima n'okuyandikira abemeezi b'eAkaya amaruba m'okumuyankirira bwinja. Abeere ahika yo, arhabaala bweneene abaliyemereere Yeesu kugerera olukogo lwa Nnamahanga, <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />bulaala omu buhaka n'aBayaahudi, alemaga abahima embere z'abantu, omu kubayeereka kulengera aMandiko Matagatiifu oku Yeesu ye Kirisitu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paawulo ahika eEfeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Amango Apolo abeere ali omu gishagala ch'eKorinto, Paawulo naye aliiri alenga omu gihugo ch'emisozi ch'eAziya, anayandagalira omu gishagala ch'eEfeeso. Ashimaana yo abemeezi baguma, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />ababaza ntya: «Ka mwaliyankiriire Muuka-Mutagatiifu amango mwayemeeraga Yeesu?» Bamushubiza ntya: «Nangwa, chiro rhurhashubiraga kuyunva baderha oku haaba Muuka-Mutagatiifu.» <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Ashuba kubabaza ntya: «Bubatiizo buchi mwayankiriire?» Bamushubiza ntya: «Bubatiizo bwa Yohaana.» <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Paawulo aja ababwira ntya: «Obubatiizo bwa Yohaana bwaliiri bw'okuyeerekana oku abantu balekere ebyaaha byaabo. Anababwira bayemeere olaala wayinja enyuma zaage, n'oyo ye Yeesu.»<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Babeere bayunva eyi myaazi, babatiizwa oku ziino lya Nnaweerhu Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Paawulo aja abalambuulira kw'amaboko, na Muuka-Mutagatiifu abayandagalira ko. Barhondera kuderha omu zindi ndimi n'okuleeba. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Abo bantu, baliiri hoofu balume ekumi na babiri.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Omu myeezi esharhu, Paawulo aliiri aja omu sinagoogi y'aBayaahudi, aliiri ashambaala buzira buuba emyaazi y'obwime bwa Nnamahanga omu gushonda abantu bayemeere. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Aliko baguma omu bo baaba bazibu b'emirhima banalahira kuyemeera. Barhondera kuderha kubi elugulu w'eNjira ya Nnaweerhu embere z'echigusho ch'abantu. Paawulo aja abaleka. Aheeka abemeezi bonyine, na ngasi lusiku, aliiri aganiira nabo omu masomo m'omulume muguma oyirikwa Tiraano. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Agendekera ntyo guhika myaaka ebiri, oku bulyo abantu booshi, aBayaahudi n'aBagiriki balilamire omu gihugo ch'eAziya, bayunva eChinwa cha Nnaweerhu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bagala ba Sikewa balwiswa n'omuzimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Nnamahanga aliiri ajira ebisomereene kugerera Paawulo. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Abantu baliiri barhoola ebitambara changwa emyambalo yabaaga yahumire oku mubiri gwage, baliiri bayihira oku balwala, nabo baalema bafuma amalwala maabo, na abalifarhirwe n'abazimu, baliiri babarhenga mo.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Haliiri Bayaahudi baguma baliiri balenga ngasi hooshi yi balibisye abazimu barhenge omu bantu. Nabo bashonda gukolesa eziino lya Nnaweerhu Yeesu, omu kuderha ntya: «Mbarhegekere oku ziino lya Yeesu, ola Paawulo ali ayigiriza, muhuluke mw'oyu muntu!» <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Omu baliiri bajira ntyo, haliiri bagala mushanvu b'omudaahwa mukulu w'aBayaahudi oyirikwa Sikewa. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Lusiku luguma, omuzimu ababwira ntya: «Nyinji Yeesu, nyinji na Paawulo. Aliko mwabo muli bande?» <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Ho n'aho omuntu walifarhirwe n'omuzimu achikabula kubo, abalwisa anabahima booshi. Bahuluka mw'eyo nju balibirha, bali butambara eyi banayunjwire ebihulu.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Eyo myaazi yamenyikana oku booshi balilamire omu gishagala ch'eEfeeso, aBayaahudi n'aBagiriki. Bagwarha obuuba, bakuza eziino lya Nnaweerhu Yeesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Banene omu bayemeeraga Yeesu, bayinja n'okuyeemera amabi maabo mooshi embere z'abantu. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Baguma omu bo baliiri bajira obukurungu bagusha ebitabu baliiri bakoleesa, babiyosa embere z'abantu booshi. Egichiro ch'ebyo bitabu chaliiri ch'efuranga zinene, bicheri bihumbi makumi marhaano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.19</char><char style="fq" closed="false">bicheri bihumbi makumi marhaano</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Byaligwerhe agachiro k'enka hoofu magana mabiri na makumi marhaano.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Na ntyo, kulengera obuhashe bwa Nnaweerhu, eChinwa chaage chayandaala hooshi n'okuba n'emisi.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olwamo omu gishagala ch'eEfeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Enyuma z'ebyo, Paawulo ahiga okuja eYerusaleema kugerera omu gihugo ch'eMakedoniya n'eche Akaya. Aderha ntya: «Hano ngera eYerusaleema, byampema ngere n'eRooma.» <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Ntyo, arhuma bantu babiri bw'omu barhabazi baage, Timoteyo na Erasito, bamurhange eMakedoniya. Aliko yeewe abeera siku zigeeke mw'echo gihugo ch'eAziya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Mwamo mango, haahulukira entonganyi nene omu gishagala ch'eEfeeso elugulu w'enyigirizo z'eNjira ya Nnaweerhu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Eyo yaliiri omuchuzi oyirikwa Dimetriyo. Aligwerhe akaasi kw'ogukola ebishushanyo bigekegeke by'akajumiro k'emaana y'echikazi eyirikwa Aritemi, kulengera echuuma chibaragenye. Akala kaasi kaliiri kaleerhera abaabo abachuzi enyungu nene. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Lusiku luguma, oyo Dimetriyo agusha baabo bachuzi haguma n'abandi bakozi baliiri bakola akola kaasi. Ababwira ntya: «Beera baani, muyinji oku rhunayunguka furanga zinene kulengera akala kaasi. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Aliko nk'oku mwabwene n'okuyunva, oyu Paawulo ali ayemeeza n'ogurhebeka abantu banene. Arhali hano Efeeso honyine si na ngasi hooshi omu gihugo ch'eAziya. Ali aderha oku emaana zajiragwa n'amaboko m'abantu, zirhali maana z'okuli. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Leero, rhuyubahire eyi myaazi bulaala arhali akaasi keerhu konyine gakenwa, sy'aliko n'akajumiro k'emaana yerhu nkulu Aritemi kaba kabushabusha. N'emaana yeerhu abantu bali baharamya omu gihugo chooshi ch'eAziya n'omu gulu lyooshi, yaheza obukuuze.»<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Abo bachuzi n'abakozi babeere bayunva eyo myaazi, bagwarhwa n'oburhe, barhondera okuyaama omu kuderha ntya: «Aritemi w'aBaefeeso ye mukulu!» <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Egishagala chooshi chayunjula olwamo. Abantu bachikabula oku Gayo na Arisitariko, baburhwa b'eMakedoniya baliiri babalama haguma na Paawulo. Booshi balibirhira jubaajuba ahantu hanene h'enshimaanano eyi bali bababululira ho. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paawulo ashonda oguchimoleka embere z'olola lubaga, aliko abemeezi bamubuza. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Chiro n'abarhegesi baguma b'egihugo ch'eAziya baliiri beera ba Paawulo, nabo bamurhumira entumwa y'okumuyinginga oku arhajaga aho hantu. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Mw'ebyo bishanji, echigusho chooshi chaligwerhe olwamo, baguma baliiri baderha ntya n'abandi ntya. Chiro banene omu bo barhamenyaga echarhumaga bachigusha. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />aBayaahudi bayimanza muntu muguma oyirikwa Alegizandere n'okumushunikira embere z'echigusho. Bantu baguma bamubwira ebinwa aderha. Naye asimira echigusho chooshi n'okuboko oku basire y'abuurane embere zaabo. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Babeere bamenya okw'ali Muyaahudi, booshi bajira olwamo haguma hoofu saa ebiri, eyi bali baderha ntya: «Aritemi w'aBaefeeso ye mukulu!»<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Oku buzinda, karani w'egishagala abasiza n'okuderha ntya: «Mwe bantu b'eEfeeso, abantu booshi b'omugulu bayinji oku egishagala ch'eEfeeso chiri ch'okulanga akajumiro k'emaana nkulu Aritemi n'egishushanyo chaage charhogaga gurhengera empingu. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Nta muntu wakaja buhaka elugulu w'ebyo. Cho girhumire murhuleere, na ntaacho mujirage buzira gukengera. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Aba bantu mwalerhere hano, ntaacho bazimbire ch'omu kajumiro k'emaana yeerhu changwa barhaza kuyidukanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Akaba Dimetriyo n'abaabo bachuzi bagwerhe olushinja n'omuntu, rhugwerhe akabuga n'abazuzi. Eyo munda yi bakwaneene kuja kusidaakira. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />N'akaba mugwerhe obwindi buhaka, bwahwera omu nshimaanano eyemeererwe n'erhegeko. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Bulaala ebi rhuli rhwajira zeene, byagarhuma rhwasidaakwa oku rhwajirire olwamo. Na nka barhubazize elugulu w'eyi nshimaanano, rhurhakabona ech'ogushubiza.» <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Abeere amala kuderha eyi myaazi, abwira olubaga lufuluke.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Paawulo agaluka omu gihugo ch'eMakedoniya na ech'eBugiriki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Entambala yabeere yaahwa eyo eEfeeso, Paawulo agusha abemeezi haguma, anabaseeza omurhima. Abaseezera, ava aja omu gihugo ch'eMakedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Alenga mw'echo gihugo, abwira abemeezi ebinwa binene by'okubakomeza omurhima. Buzinda aja omu gihugo ch'eBugiriki. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Amala yo myeezi esharhu. Abeere akola aja omu chombo ch'okuja omu gihugo ch'eSuriya, ayunva omwazi okw'<char style="w" lemma="Muyaahudi:">aBayaahudi</char> bamujiriire kaligi. Kwarhuma ahiga kugaluka kugerera omu gihugo ch'eMakedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Abaherekezaga Paawulo baliiri Sopateeri mugala wa Piiro, w'eBeroya; Arisitariko na Sekundo b'eTesalonika; Gaayo w'eDerebe; Timoteyo, Tikiko na Torofimo baliiri b'eAziya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Abo bantu barhurhanga embere gurhulingira eTorowa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Rhwabo neerhu, enyuma z'esiku z'edinye y'emigati nzira chachu, rhwaja omu chombo gurhenga eFiripi. Siku erhaano zabeere zahwa, rhwabashimaana eTorowa. Rhwabeera yo siku mushanvu.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo afuula Eutiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Egolo ly'olusiku lw'eSaabato, rhwashigaanana kugabaana omugati,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eChinwa cha Nnamahanga bayandikaga omu chigiriki chiderhere hano: «Guchagulanga omugati.» Kuli gushonda kuderha: «Okulya haguma ebiryo bya Nnaweerhu.»</char></note> na Paawulo ayigiriza abantu. Agendeerera kuganiira n'abantu guhika ahagarhi k'obudufu, kwenge ali kwaneene kugenda olusiku lwakulikiraga. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Rhwalemaga rhwabugaanana omu gorofa ebusiika. Omoola mwaliiri amatara manene. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Muzaana muguma oyirikwa Eutiko, aliiri ayikeere oku dirisha. Paawulo aliiri eyi amaleehya enyigirizo zaage, oyo muzaana arhoolwa n'ero linene. Ero lyarhuma oyo muzaana arhoga gurhengera oku gorofa lya gasharhu. Babeere bashonda kumuyinamula, bashimaana afiire. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Paawulo ava achima, achikabula oku ye n'okumubagalira. Ababwira ntya: «Murhayuubahaga, bulaala azeene!» <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Enyuma w'ebyo, Paawulo ashuba kuzamuukira omu gorofa. Achagulanga omugati anagulya ko, agendeerera kuganiira bweneene, kugera emiseke. Ayuusize, agenda. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Abantu baherekeza oyo muzaana emwabo eyi ali mugumaguma. Baseezwa omurhima bweneene.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo abalamira eMileto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Rhwabo, rhwarhanga kuja omu gishagala ch'eHasoosi n'echombo. Eyo munda, rhwali rhukwaneene gurhoola Paawulo, bulaala alishondere kuja yo n'amagulu. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Abeere arhushigaana eHasoosi, rhwamuhira omu chombo, n'okuja eMitileeni. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga, rhwarhenga yo, rhwagendekera oku nyanja, rhwagera embere z'echizimba ch'eKiyo. Olusiku lwa gasharhu, rhwahika oku chizimba ch'eSamoosi. N'olusiku luzinda, rhwahika eMileto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paawulo arhashondaga kuyimanga eEfeeso omu gihugo ch'eAziya, y'arhaheza ebishanji. Aliiri abangula y'aba eYerusaleema olusiku lw'edinye y'ePendekosite akaba byagalikeene.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo aseezera abashamuka b'echigusho ch'abemeezi b'eEfeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Paawulo abeere ali eMileto, arhuma abantu eEfeeso guhamagala abashamuka b'echigusho ch'abemeezi. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Babeere baahika aha ali, ababwira ntya: «Mwabo muyinji gurhe nalamire haguma nenyu, amango nahikaga muno gihugo ch'eAziya, gurhengera olusiku lurhanzi. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Nakoleere Nnaweerhu omu bwirhonzi booshi, omu miziga, n'ahagarhi k'ebigeregezo byampikiraga elugulu wa kaligi k'<char style="w" lemma="Muyaahudi:">aBayaahudi</char>. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Muyinji oku nta mwazi nababishire. Aliko, nabayamagaziize n'okubayigiriza ngasi chintu chaliiri ch'obulagiirire, omu nshimaanano z'abantu n'omu nju zenyu. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Babe Bayaahudi, babe Bagiriki, naliiri nababwira oku baleke ebyaaha, bahindamukire Nnamahanga, banayemeere Nnaweerhu Yeesu Kirisitu.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Leero nyoono, okubona oku nshwekerwe na Muuka-Mutagatiifu, naaja eYerusaleema, buzira kumenya echampikira yo. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Aliko, nyinji konyine oku, omu ngasi gishagala nagerere mo, Muuka-Mutagatiifu aliiri anyeereka oku eminyororo n'amalibuko bindingire. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Sy'aliko ntaganja akalamo kaani nka chintu ch'akamaro emwani. Echinashonda chonyine, kuli kumala bwinja olugenzi lwani n'akaasi Nnaweerhu Yeesu ampaaga k'oguhamiiriza oMwazi Mwinja g'olukogo lwa Nnamahanga.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />«Naliiri nazungula ahagarhi kenyu mweshi eyi ndi nayaamagaza obwime bwa Nnamahanga. Aliko bunoola, nyoono nyinji oku nta muguma wenyu wachimbona ko. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Cho girhumire nababwira byo zeene oku eshagama yenyu erhachindi ko, <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />kwenge nababaliire byooshi Nnamahanga ashondere, buzira kubabisha echintu. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Mujaage mwachilanga mwenyine haguma n'echigusho chooshi Muuka-Mutagatiifu abaheere mube bimangizi baacho. Ntyo, mulange echo chigusho ch'abemeezi ba Nnamahanga echi achiheere omu gusheesha eshagama y'oMugala. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Nyoono nyinji oku hano mala kugenda, banyambwe bakalihire baja ahagarhi kenyu, barhanafiira echigusho ch'abemeezi obonjo. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Na kandi, ahagarhi kenyu harhengerera abantu baderha ebinwa birhali by'okuli yi baarhuma abemeezi babakulikira. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Boboola, muchilange eyi munali mwayibuka oku namalire myaaka esharhu, obudufu n'ezuuba ntaluhaga guhanuula omu miziga ngasi muguma wenyu.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />«Na bunoola, namabahira omu maboko ma Nnamahanga n'omu bulanzi bw'omwazi g'olukogo lwage, gugwerhe obuhashe b'okubakuza n'okubaha agashambala haguma n'abantu baage booshi agishogere. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Ntagifiijaga efuranga changwa ehooro, abe myambalo y'omuntu. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Muyinji mwenyine oku nakolaga n'amaboko maani nyenyine yi mbona ebi rhwalilagire ko, nyoono n'abalimperekeeze. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Mw'ebyo byooshi najiraga, nalibayeerekere oku bihemere gukola n'obushiru ntya yi rhurhabaale abarhagwerhe misi, omu kuyibuka ebinwa bya Nnaweerhu Yeesu. Aderhaga yenyine ntya: ‹Hali mugisho munene omu guhaana kulusha okuyankirira.›»<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Paawulo abeere amala kuderha ebyoola, afukama haguma nabo booshi, asaliira. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Booshi baaja barhondera kulaka bweneene, bamuhoobera n'okumuseezera. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Balibabeezwe bweneene, bulaala aliderhere oku barhagachimubona ko. Baava bamuherekeza guhika aha echombo chaliiri.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Paawulo aja eYerusaleema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Rhwabeere rhwalekana n'abashamuka b'echigusho ch'abemeezi b'eEfeeso, rhwabalama n'echombo guhika oku chizimba ch'eKoosi. Olusiku lwakulikiraga, rhwagendekera oku chizimba ch'eRodo, na gurhengera eyoola, rhwaja omu gishagala ch'ePaatara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Rhwabona mw'echo gishagala echindi chombo chaliiri chaja eFoyinikiya. Rhwaja mo n'ogusuuka. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Rhwabeere rhukola rhuli rhwalangiira echizimba ch'eGipuro, rhwaleka cho ekulembe, n'okuyerekera eSuriya. Rhwasiika omu gishagala ch'eTiiro emunda echombo chalikwaneene kuleka emizigo. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Rhwabeere rhwabugaanana n'abemeezi b'eyoola, rhwabeera yo siku mushanvu. Abo bemeezi baliiri babwira Paawulo kulengera obuhashe bwa Muuka-Mutagatiifu oku arhazamukiraga eYerusaleema. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Aliko ezoola siku zabeere zahika oku buzinda, rhwagenda. Abemeezi booshi barhuherekeza, abalume na bakaabo haguma n'abaana baabo, barhukuula omu gishagala. Rhwafukama emushengo, rhwanasaliira. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Rhwabeere rhwamala guseezerana, rhwaja omu chombo, nabo bagaluka emwabo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Rhwarhenga eTiiro, rhwagendeerera kubalama guhika omu gishagala ch'eTolemaayi. Eyo munda, rhwalamusa abemeezi, rhwanabeera emwabo lusiku luguma. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga, rhwarhenga ahoola, rhwahika omu gishagala ch'eKayizariya. Eyo munda rhwaja kubeera omu nju ya Firipo. Aliiri mwigiriza w'oMwazi Mwinja, analiiri muguma mu balaala mushanvu balondoolagwa eYerusaleema.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="ACT 6:1-5">Bijiro 6.1-5</ref> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">na 8.5.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Aligwerhe banyere bane barhaliiza kumenya abalume. Baliiri baleebi-kazi. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Rhwabeere rhwamala aha mwage siku zinene, omuleebi muguma oyirikwa Hagabo ahika gurhengera omu gihugo ch'eYudeeya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Ayinja emunda rhwaliiri, arhoola omukaba gwa Paawulo n'oguchishweka nago amagulu n'amaboko. N'okuva aderha ntya: «Muuka-Mutagatiifu aderhere ntya: ‹aBayaahudi b'eYerusaleema nji bashweka ntya nyina ogu mukaba n'okumuhaana omu maboko m'abarhali Bayaahudi.›» <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Enyuma z'okuyunva ebyo binwa, rhwabo haguma n'abemeezi b'eKayizariya, rhwayinginga Paawulo oku arhazamuukiraga eYerusaleema. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Paawulo ava shubiza ntya: «Chagarhuma mwalira n'ogushonda kuncha omurhima? Nyoono, namalire guchirheganya, arhali ogushwekwa konyine, sy'aliko kandi n'ogufiira eYerusaleema elugulu w'eziino lya Nnaweerhu Yeesu.» <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Rhwabwene okw'arhayunviirhe, rhwasira. Oku buzinda, rhwaderha ntya: «Bihemere obulonza bwa Nnaweerhu bujirike.»<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Enyuma w'ezoola siku, rhwachirheganya, rhwazamukira eYerusaleema. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Abemeezi baguma b'eKayizariya barhuherekeza, banarhuhisa emwa mulume muguma oyirikwa Munasoni w'oku chizimba ch'eGipuro. Ahamwage ha rhwalikwaneene guchumbika. Oyu mulume aliiri mwemeezi gurhengera miira.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo alambagirira Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Rhwabeere rhwahika eYerusaleema, abemeezi barhuyankirira n'obushagaluke bunene. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga, rhwagenda haguma na Paawulo emwa Yakobo. Abashamuka b'echigusho ch'abemeezi nabo balichigushire booshi ahoola. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Paawulo abalamusa, anarhondera kubala oku bule ebi Nnamahanga ajirire kulengera akaasi kaage ahagarhi k'abarhali Bayaahudi.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Babeere baamala kumuyunviiriza, bakuuza Nnamahanga. Babwiira Paawulo ntya: «Mwene weerhu, obwene ebihumbi bingana by'aBayaahudi bayemereere Yeesu, na booshi, bagwerhe obushiru oku Rhegeko lya Muusa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Aliko leero, babwirirwe okw'oli wayigiriza aBayaahudi booshi balamire ahagarhi k'abarhali Bayaahudi kuleka eRhegeko lya Muusa. Bayunviirhe okw'oli wababwira mpu barhagikembuulaga abaana baabo, barhanagikulikiraga emicho y'aBayaahudi. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Gurhe rhujaage rhwajira? Kwenge barhabula kumenya oku wahikire. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Ojire oku rhwakubwira. Rhugwerhe balume bane bajirire echilagaane emwa Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Genda n'aba bantu, omu micho y'oguchicheesa, onahaane byooshi bahemwa yi bagembwa enviiri. aBantu booshi baaja bamenya okw'ebinwa bayunvaga bali bakuderha ko biri by'obubeeshi. Banamenya oku wooyo onakenga eRhegeko lya Muusa omu kalamo kaawe. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Abarhali Bayaahudi bahindukire bemeezi, boowe rhwabayandikiire miira ebi rhubarhegekere bachilange ko. Rhwabarhegekere oku barhalyaaga enyama barhuuliraga emaana n'omulegano changwa enyama zakanulwaga, banachilange n'obuhushi.»<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga, Paawulo agenda nabo balume bane, banagicheesa haguma naye. Ava aja omu Nju ya Nnamahanga n'okubala mango machi esiku zaabo z'ogugicheesa zahwa n'entuulo yahanwa oku ngasi muguma waabo.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo afarhwa omu Nju ya Nnamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Siku mushanvu z'okugicheesa zabeere ziri hoofu guhwa, aBayaahudi baguma barhengaga omu gihugo ch'eAziya babona Paawulo omu Nju ya Nnamahanga. Bararusa olubaga looshi, banamufarha. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Baalema babanda akalulu n'okuderha ntya: «Mwe balume b'eIsraheeli, muyinje murhugwase! Y'onoola, ola muntu oyigiriza abantu booshi na ngasi hooshi okuboneerera olubaga lwerhu, eRhegeko lya Muusa n'eyi Nju ya Nnamahanga! N'ahanene, ahirire abarhali Bayaahudi omu Nju ya Nnamahanga, amanazingiisa aha hantu hatagatiifu!» <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Baderhaga ntyo, kwenge babaaga babwene omu gishagala Paawulo haguma na Torofimo muburhwa w'eEfeeso. Bali bakengereere oku Paawulo ali muheekere omu Nju ya Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Akaluulu kayunjula omu gishagala chooshi, n'abantu bayinja balibirha gurhengera ngasi lunda. Baafarha Paawulo, bamukululira embuga w'eNju ya Nnamahanga, n'okuva bachinga emilyango.<verse eid="ACT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Babeere bali bashonda kumuyirha, omukulu w'engabo y'abasoda b'ekirooma ayunva omwazi okw'akalulu kayandeere hooshi omu Yerusaleema. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Ho n'aho arhoola abasoda n'abakulu baabo, n'oguchima alibirhira yo. Babeere bamubona n'abasoda baage, baaleka gushuurha Paawulo. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Oyu mukulu w'engabo y'abasoda ava ashegera hoofu na Paawulo, amufarha, anarhegeka oku bamushweke na malegule mabiri. Enyuma abaza akaba ali nde na gichi ajirire. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Aliko omu chigusho, baguma baliiri bayaama ntya n'abandi ntya. Abeere afundwa kumenya echaleerhere akalulu, arhegeka baheeke Paawulo omu kampi k'abasoda. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Paawulo abeere ali ashonda kuja omu nju y'abasoda, abasoda bamubarhula bulaala olubaga lwaliiri lukalihire bweneene. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Abantu booshi baliiri bamukulikiire eyi bali bayaama ntya: «Ayirhwe!»<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo ahema agirhondoole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Abasoda babeere bashonda guhira Paawulo omu kampi kaabo, abaza omukulu waabo ntya: «K'onyemereere nkubwire echinwa chiguma?» Naye amushubiza ntya: «K'oyinji kuderha eKigiriki? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />K'arhali wooyo w'olaala <char style="w" lemma="Miisiri:">Mumiisiri</char> nji wazindaga gurarusa abantu n'oguheeka omu mpinga echigusho ch'ebishumuusi bihumbi bine bigwerhe emitwaro?» <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paawulo ashubiza ntya: «Nyoono, ndi Muyaahudi, muburhwa w'omu gishagala ch'eTariso omu gihugo ch'eKilikiya. Echo gishagala chiyinjikeene bwinjabwinja. Nguhemere waliha, onyemeerere gushambaala n'olubaga.» <figure style="fig" alt="Paul se tient débout devant la foule des juifs" file="WA03989b.tif" size="col" ref="21.40">Paawulo ayimangire ahalengereere y'aderha n'aBayaahudi</figure> <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Oyo mukulu w'engabo y'abasoda ava amuyemeerera. Paawulo ayimanga ahalengereere, asimira abantu n'okuboko mpu basire. Babeere bamaasira, ababwira omu lulimi lw'eGiheburaniya ntya:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />«Badaarha na beene beerhu, munyuvirize! Bunoola nashonda kuderha elugulu waani nyenyine embere zenyu.»<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Babeere bayunva oku Paawulo ali aderha nabo omu lulimi lw'eGiheburaniya, basira bweneene. Aja ababwira ntya:<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:1-2">Bijiro 9.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26.9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />«Nyoono, ndi Muyaahudi, oburhwa eTariso omu gihugo ch'eKilikiya. Aliko nalemberwaga mu chinoola gishagala ch'eYerusaleema. Naliiri mwigirizwa wa Gamaliyeeri, analinyigirize gurhe nagakulikira bwinjabwinja eRhegeko lya bashookuluza. Nagihaanire looshi gukolera Nnamahanga nk'okumulimwajira mweshi zeene. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Naliiri nalibuza bweneene abantu balikulikiire eNjira ya Nnaweerhu chiro n'okuyirha baguma omu bo. Nagendaga nashweka abalume n'abakazi n'okubahira omu munyororo. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Omudaahwa mukulu n'akabuga k'abashamuka b'aBayaahudi bagahamiiriza oku ebindi naderha biri by'okuli. Nayankiriire emwabo amaruba mayerekeere abeerhu Bayaahudi b'omu gishagala ch'eDamasiki. Naja eyo munda yi nshweka abemeezi baliiri yo n'okubaleerha bahanirwe eYerusaleema.»<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo abala gurhe ahindukaga mwemeezi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:3-19">Bijiro 9.3-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Paawulo ashuba kuderha ntya: «Lusiku luguma, naliiri omu njira, eyi ndi nashonda guhika eDamasiki. Hoofu n'emidi, obumoleke bubaragenye bweneene bwava bwahulukira omu mpingu, bwangorha. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Nagwa ahashi, nayunva omulenge guli gwambwira ntya: ‹Saawulo, Saawulo, girhumire wandibuza?› <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Nashubiza ntya: ‹Nnaweerhu, wooyo oli nde?› Naye anshubiza ntya: ‹Nyoono ndi Yeesu w'eNazareeti, oli walibuza.› <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Abaliiri haguma naani baali babwene bwinja obo bumoleke, aliko barhaliyunvirhe omulenge g'owaliiri anshambaalira. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Naja naaderha ntya: ‹Nnaweerhu, gurhe nkwaneene kujira?› Nnaweerhu anshubiza ntya: ‹Yimanga, oje eDamasiki, n'eyoola munda bakubwira ngasi chooshi Nnamahanga agurhegekere ojire.› <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Abaliiri haguma naani bampeeka eyi banfarhire okuboko, banampisa eDamasiki, bulaala ntaacho nakagalire kubona elugulu w'obumoleke bwalimpumize.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />«Na muntu muguma oyirikwa Hananiya walilamire ahola Damasiki ayinja kuntangula. Aliiri muntu wakengaga Nnamahanga omu gukulikira eRhegeko lya Muusa. Analikengerwe bweneene n'aBayaahudi booshi balilamire eyo munda. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Ayinjire, ayimanga hoofu nani, anambwira ntya: ‹Mwene weerhu Saawulo, shuba obone!› Ho n'aho ameesho maani mahumuulwa, naava namubona. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Ambwira ntya: ‹Nnamahanga wa bashookuluza beerhu akulondwere y'omenya obulonza bwage, onabone Okwaneene. Kandi, akulondwere y'omuyunve aderha n'obunu bwage yenyine. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kwenge waaba muhamiiriza waage embere z'abantu booshi, waderha elugulu w'ebi wabwene n'okuyunva ko. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Na bunoola, bichi ochiri walinga? Yimanga, obatiizwe, onahamagale Nnaweerhu y'ocheeswa gurhenga omu byaaha byaawe.›»<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo abala gurhe Nnaweerhu amurhumaga oku barhali Bayaahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Paawulo ashuba kuderha ntya: «Nabeere nagaluka eYerusaleema, oku ndi nasaliira omu Nju ya Nnamahanga, nava nabonekerwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Mw'oko kubonekerwa, nabona Nnaweerhu, anambwira ntya: ‹Orhenge jubaajuba mu chino gishagala ch'eYerusaleema, bulaala abantu barhayankirira obuhamiriza waderha elugulu waani.› <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Nyoono naderha ntya: ‹Nnaweerhu, bayinji bonyine oku naliiri nagera esinagoogi oku yindi gushweka n'ogushurha abakuyemereere. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />N'amango basheeshaga eshagama y'omuhamiiriza waawe Sitefaano, nyenyine naliiri ho. Naani, naliyemeere okw'ayirhwe, naliiri nalanga n'emyambalo y'abamuyirhaga.› <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Nnaweerhu aja ambwira ntya: ‹Genda, bulaala nyoono nagurhuma hale, emwa abarhali Bayaahudi.›»<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo amenyesa abasoda oku ali Murooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Abantu baliiri bayunviriza Paawulo kubuyabuya. Aliko abeere ahika kw'echiila chinwa chizinda, baliika omulenge munene n'okuderha ntya: «Mumuyirhe! Arhakwaneene kulama oku lino gulu!» <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Babanda akaluulu, bakuula emyambalo yaabo, banakabula olujuchu omu chanya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Banakabula olujuchu omu chanya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kuli kuyeerekana okw'abantu bakalihire bweneene. Kuli kuderha kandi oku Paawulo adukangire Nnamahanga.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Omukulu w'engabo y'abasoda b'ekirooma, arhegeka oku bahire Paawulo omu kampi kaabo, bamushurhe amataraki banamubaziirize yi bamenya egirhumire abantu babanda akaluulu elugulu waage. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Oku bali bamumina n'emigozi yi bamushuurhe, Paawulo abaza omukulu w'abasoda waliiri ahoola ntya: «Ka muyemereerwe gushuurha oMurooma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">oMurooma </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amarhegeko m'ekirooma mali malahiize ogushuurha oMurooma changwa okumuhira omu munyororo buzira kumubuuranya. Paawulo aliiri Muyaahudi aliko gukulikirana n'amarhegeko m'ekirooma, aliiri Murooma, analikwanene kujiriirwa kuguma n'omuroma.</char></note> orhachiriirwe olushinja?» <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Abeere ayunva ntyo, agenda kubwira omukulu w'engabo y'abasoda ntya: «Waliha, gasi oyu muntu ali Murooma! Gurhe waaja wamujira?» <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Oyu mukulu w'engabo abeere ayunva ntyo, aja emunda Paawulo ali anamubaza ntya: «Mbwira bwinja, k'onali Murooma?» Naye ashubiza ntya: «Neechi, ndi Murooma.» <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Oyoola mukulu ashuba kuderha ntya: «Nyoono, nahezaga efuranga zinene yi mba Murooma!» Paawulo naye aderha ntya: «Nyoono ndi Murooma w'akaburhano.» <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Ho n'aho, balaala bashondaga kumubaziiriza bamuleka. oMukulu w'engabo abeere amenya oku Murooma y'ashwekere, afarhwa n'obuuba.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo embere z'akabuga k'aBayaahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga, omukulu w'engabo y'abasoda ashonda kumenya ech'aBayaahudi basidakiire Paawulo. Echoola charhuma amushwekuula, anarhegeka abakulu b'abadaahwa n'akabuga kooshi k'aBayaahudi mpu babugaanane. Aja achimya Paawulo n'okumuyimanza embere zaabo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paawulo aloleereza abo bashamuka b'akabuga k'aBayaahudi, ababwira ntya: «Beene beerhu, guhika zeene, nyoono nta chibi mbwene omu murhima gwani elugulu w'oboorhere bwani embere za Nnamahanga.» <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Omudaahwa mukulu oyirikwa Hananiya arhegeka abantu baliiri hoofu na Paawulo mpu bamushuurhe oku buunu. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Paawulo ava amubwira ntya: «Nnamahanga ye nji wagushuurha wooyo weeri nka chibambaazi gishigirwe ko eshwagara!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chibambaazi gishiigirwe ko eshwagara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebi binwa bishondeere kuderha obulyaalya changwa echibambazi chibonekeene bwinja embuga aliko chiri hoofu kugwa. Osome </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:27">Matayo 23.27</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 13:10-15">Ezekiyeeli 13.10-15</ref>.</char></note> Wooyo oyikeere ahoola y'onchiira olushinja gukulikirana n'eRhegeko. Aliko, nawe wenyine orhalikengere omu gurhegeka mpu banshuurhe!» <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Abantu baliiri ahoola baamubaza ntya: «Gurhe wakadukanga omudaahwa mukulu wa Nnamahanga?» <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Paawulo ashubiza ntya: «Beene beerhu! Ntaliyinji okw'ali mudaahwa mukulu. Kwenge biyandikirwe ntya: ‹Orhaderhaga kubi omukulu w'olubaga lwawe.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.5</char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="EXO 22:27-28">Lubunguluko 22.27-28</ref>.</char></note>»<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Paawulo abaaga ayinji oku abashamuka baguma omu kabuga bali Basadukaayo n'abandi <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">Bafarisaayo</char>. Echo charhuma aderha n'omulenge munene ntya: «Beene beerhu, nyoono ndi Mufarisaayo na mugala w'aBafarisaayo. Mpirirwe zeene embere z'akabuga elugulu y'obulangaalire bwani bw'obufuuke bw'abafu.» <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Paawulo abeere amala kuderha ebyoola, haahulukira obuhaka ahagarhi k'aBafarisaayo n'aBasadukaayo. Abantu balichigushire ahoola, bachigaba mo kabiri. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Byabaaga ntyo bulaala aBasadukaayo banaderha mpu nta bufuuke, nta malahika, na nta muzimu. aBafarisaayo boowe banayemeera ebyo byooshi. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Haaba olwamo lunene, n'abigiriza b'amarhegeko baguma b'echigusho ch'aBafarisaayo bayimanga n'okuderha n'omulenge munene ntya: «Nta chibi n'echiguma rhwabwene k'oyu muntu. Nkabaga omuzimu changwa malahika aderhere naye!» <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Entonganyi yabeere yaluga, omukulu w'engabo y'abasoda ayuubaha oku abo bashamuka b'akabuga bashenyagula Paawulo. Arhegeka abasoda baje kumukuula ahagarhi kaabo n'okumuheeka omu kampi.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Bwabeere budufu, Nnaweerhu ahulukira embere za Paawulo n'okuderha ntya: «Seeza omurhima! Nka kulaala wampamiirizaga eYerusaleema, ntyo k'okwaneene kandi kumpamiiriza eRooma.»<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaligi k'okuyirha Paawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Bwabeere bwacha, aBayaahudi baguma baja kaligi n'okujira endahiro oku barhaalya barhananywa barhanaza kuyirha Paawulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Abamujiraga kaligi baliiri banene oku bantu makumi mane. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Baaja gushonda abakulu b'abadaahwa n'abashamuka b'aBayaahudi, bababwira ntya: «Rhwajirire endahiro oku rhurhaalya, rhurhananywa rhurhanaza kuyirha Paawulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Leero bunoola, mwabo haguma n'akabuga k'aBayaahudi, muheme omukulu w'engabo y'abasoda balerhe Paawulo embere zenyu. Mumubwire oku muli mwashonda kumenya bwinjabwinja emyaazi bamusidakiire. Neerhu, rhwagirheganyize kumuyirhira omu njira arhaza gera hano.»<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Aliko mwihwa wa Paawulo ayunva ako kaligi, anaja omu kampi k'abasoda, abalira Paawulo eyo myaazi. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Paawulo ava ahamagala muguma omu bakulu b'abasoda n'okumubwira ntya: «Heka oyu murhabana emw'omukulu w'engabo y'abasoda, kwenge agwerhe omwazi amubalira.» <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Oyo mukulu agenda haguma naye emwa nnahamwabo, n'okumubwira ntya: «Ola mushwekwa Paawulo alimpamagere n'okumpema mpu nkulerhere ono murhabana, agwerhe omwazi akubwira.» <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Oyo mukulu w'engabo afarha oyo murhabana oku kuboko, amuheka eburhambi, anamubaza ntya: «Mwazi muchi ogwerhe g'okumbalira?» <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Oyo murhabana naye amushubiza ntya: «aBayaahudi bayunvikeene kuguhema olerhe Paawulo omuseezi embere z'akabuga kaabo. Bachijira nk'abashonda kumenya bwinjabwinja emyaazi asidakirwe ko. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Aliko waliha, orhayemeeraga, bulaala balume balenzeze makumi mane omu bo bachibishire banalingire kumuyirha. Banajirire endahiro oku barhaalya n'okunywa barhanaza kumuyirha. Bunoola bamalire guchirheganya. Yi balinga echinwa chaawe chonyine.» <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Oyu mukulu w'engabo agalula oyo murhabana n'okumubwira ntya: «Ntaaye obwirage oku wanshambaliire eyi myaazi.»<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo aheekwa emwa Feliiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Oku buzinda, oyo mukulu w'engabo y'abasoda ahamagala abakulu babiri b'abasoda alirhegekere. Ababwira ntya: «Murhoole basoda magana mabiri balambagira n'amagulu, haguma n'abasoda makumi gali mushanvu balambagira n'endogomi, n'abandi magana mabiri balwisa n'echumu. Booshi bagende omu gishagala ch'eKayizariya aha saa esharhu z'obudufu.<figure style="fig" alt="Cavalier" file="LB00198B.TIF" size="col" ref="23.23">Abasoda balambagira n'endogomi</figure> <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Murheganye endogomi zaheka Paawulo y'ahika bwinja emw'omurhegesi Feliiki.» <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Oyo mukulu w'engabo y'abasoda ayandika maruba maderhere ntya:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />«Nyoono Kuloode Lusiya, nkulamwise waliha Feliiki, murhegesi w'egihugo ch'eYudeeya. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Oyu muntu, aBayaahudi balimufarhire n'ogushonda kumuyirha. Naani nabeere nayunva okw'ali Murooma, nyono haguma n'echigusho chaani ch'abasoda rhwagenda kumurhabaala. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Namuyandagaza embere z'akabuga k'aBayaahudi eyi nshondere kumenya bichi bamusidakiire. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Nava namenya oku alisidaakirwe elugulu w'ebiyerekeere eRhegeko lyaabo. Aliko, omu byooshi alisidaakirwe, ntaacho chagarhumire ahanirwa ogufa changwa kuja omu munyororo. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />N'amango nayunvaga omwazi oku aBayaahudi bamujiriire kaligi k'okumuyirha, ho n'aho namurhuma emwawe. Nabwira abamusidakire oku baheke olushinja embere zaawe.»<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Abo basoda baja barhoola Paawulo gukulikirana n'oku balirhegekerwe. Banamuheeka, na mw'obo budufu bamugeza omu gishagala ch'eAntipatiri. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga, abasoda baliiri balambagira n'amagulu bagaluka omu kampi kaabo. Baaleka abaabo baliiri bagenda oku ndogomi bagendereere n'olugenzi haguma na Paawulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Bagerere omu gishagala ch'eKayizariya, baava baheereza omurhegesi Feliiki mala maruba bahaaga bo n'okumumoleka Paawulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Oyu murhegesi abeere amala gusoma amo maruba, abaza Paawulo ntya: «Oli muntu w'omu gihugo gihe?» Abeere amenya okw'ali w'eKilikiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />amubwira ntya: «Nayinja gukubuuranya hano abagusidakaga bahika.» Anava arhegeka oku bamulange omu nju y'echami yayumbakwaga na Heroode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">aBayaahudi basidaka Paawulo emw'omurhegesi Feliiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Enyuma w'esiku erhaano, omudaahwa mukulu oyirikwa Hananiya aja eKayizariya haguma n'abashamuka baguma b'aBayaahudi n'omuntu w'okubabuuranira oyirikwa Teritulo. Nabo bahika embere z'omurhegesi Feliiki, basidaka Paawulo. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Babeere bahamagala Paawulo, Teritulo arhondera kumusidaka n'okuderha ntya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">«Mukengwa Feliiki, werhumire rhwabwona omurhuula munene n'oburhegesi bwawe bukwiriire bwarhumire ebintu binene byaba binja mw'echi gihugo. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Kooko waliha Feliiki, rhurhakayibirira ebi byooshi ngasi hooshi na ngasi gihe. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Aliko, ogurhaguhezeza ebishanji, nguhemere oyunviirize omu bwinja bwawe ebinwa rhwashonda kuderha oku bugeeke. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Rhwabwene oku oyu muntu ali mudaarhi bweneene. Y'ararusa aBayaahudi booshi omu gulu lyooshi. Kandi, yeewe ye mukulu w'edini ly'obubeeshi ly'aBanazareeti. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Abaaga ashondere guhumaanya eNju ya Nnamahanga, aliko rhwamamufarha. [Rhwashondaga kumuhana gukulikarana n'eRhegeko lyeerhu, <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />aliko Lusiya, mukulu w'engabo y'abasoda, amayinja gurhunyugushula ye. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Anabwira abo basidaakire Paawulo oku bayinje eno mwawe.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebinwa biri ahagarhi ke [ ] birhali omu bitaabu biguma bya miira.</char></note> Wooyo wenyine wakamubuuranya y'omenya bwinjabwinja ebi byooshi rhumusidakiire.»<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />aBayaahudi baliiri aho, bahamiriza okw'eyo myaazi yooshi ya Teritulo eri y'okuli.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo abuurana embere za Feliiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Oku buzinda, omurhegesi Feliiki asimira Paawulo mpu naye aderhe. Paawulo aderha ntya: «Waliha Feliiki, nyinji oku gurhengera myaaka minene oli muzuuzi w'olu lubaga. Boboola, nta buuba ngwerhe b'okubuuranira embere zaawe. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Wenyine wakanabaza, banakubwira oku harhazigera siku ekumi n'ebiri njire eYerusaleema guharamya Nnamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Aba bantu bansidaakire, nta muguma wabo wanshimaanire omu Nju ya Nnamahanga changwa omu masinagoogi maabo, changwa ahandi ahantu omu gishagala ndi najira obuhaka n'omuntu changwa ndi nararusa olubaga. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Kandi, barhakagala gukuyeereka bwinjabwinja elugulu w'ebi bansidaakire ko bunoola. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Aliko nyemereere embere zaawe oku ndi nakolera Nnamahanga wa bashookuluza beerhu omu gukulikira eNjira ya Nnaweerhu. Yi banaderha okw'eri y'obubeeshi. Si nyoono, nyemereere byooshi biyandikirwe omu bitaabu by'eRhegeko n'omu by'abaleebi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Ngwerhe obulangaalire kuguma nabo emwa Nnamahanga oku nj'afuula abantu booshi, abakwaneene n'ababi. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Cho girhumire ndi nagihangaana esiku zooshi kuba n'oboorhere bwinja embere za Nnamahanga n'embere z'abantu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />«Nabeere najira myaaka minene ntali eYerusaleema, nagaluka yo. Naliiri naaja guhekera abakene bali omu lubaga lwani oburhabaale n'ogurhuulira Nnamahanga entuulo. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Egihe naliiri narhula entuulo eyi nagicheeseze, aba bantu banshimaana omu Nju ya Nnamahanga. Nta rarusaga abantu na nta chigusho ch'abantu naliiri nacho. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Aliko, Bayaahudi baguma barhengeraga omu gihugo ch'eAziya baliiri aho. Abo babakayinjire embere zaawe kunsidaaka, akaba bagwerhe echinwa elugulu waani. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Changwa, aba bantu baderhe chibi gichi bambwene ko amango bansidaakaga embere z'akabuga k'aBayaahudi. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Nkabaga echibi chiguma najirire, nayaamaga embere zaabo ntya: ‹Mumpanire ntya zeene kwenge ngwerhe obulangaalire okw'abafu nji bafuuka.›»<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Feliiki waliyinji bwinjabwinja ebiyerekeere eNjira ya Nnaweerhu, abwira abalisidakire Paawulo ntya: «Olu lushinja lwenyu nji nalucha amango Lusiya, omukulu w'engabo y'abasoda nj'ahika hano.» <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Oku buzinda, arhegeka omukulu w'abasoda ahire Paawulo omu munyororo, aliko amulekere ebishanji by'okujira ebyashondere, analeke abeera baage baleme bamurhabaala.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo ashambaala na Feliiki haguma na Durusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Enyuma wa siku zigeeke, Feliiki ahika haguma na mukaage Durusila, waliiri Muyaahudi-kazi. Arhegeka balerhe Paawulo, naye ayunviriza ebinwa aliiri aderha elugulu w'obwemeezi omu Yeesu Kirisitu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Aliko Feliiki abeere ayunva Paawulo ashambaala elugulu wa byooshi bikwaneene embere za Nnamahanga, elugulu w'oguchilanga n'amabi, n'elugulu w'olusiku Nnamahanga nj'achiira abantu olushinja, ayuubaha. Abwira Paawulo ntya: «Bunoola okola wakagenda. Nji nashuba kuguhamagala amango nabona ebishanji.» <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Aliiri alangalire oku Paawulo amuha efuranga. Elugulu w'echo, alema ahamagala Paawulo ngasi mango oku baganiire haguma.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Habeere hagera myaaka ebiri, Porikiyo Fesito ayima ahali ha Feliiki. Aliko Feliiki aleka Paawulo omu munyororo kwenge alishondere gusimiisa aBayaahudi.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Paawulo abuurana embere z'omurhegesi Fesito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Fesito abeere amajira siku esharhu ahikire mw'echo gihugo ch'eYudeeya, arhenga omu gishagala ch'eKayizariya, azamuukira omu gishagala ch'eYerusaleema. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Abeere ali eyoola, abakulu b'abadaahwa n'abandi bakulu b'aBayaahudi baaja emwage gusidaaka Paawulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Bamuyinginga oku abarhabaale, agalule Paawulo eYerusaleema, bulaala bali bamujiriire akaligi k'okumuyirhira omu njira. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Fesito abashubiza ntya: «Paawulo alangirwe omu munyororo eKayizariya, naani nyenyine ndi hoofu kugaluka yo. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Muleke abakulu benyu baguma bagende haguma naani. N'akaba oyuula muntu hali echintu chibi ajiriire, bamusidaakire yo.»<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fesito abeere amala haguma nabo esiku zagahika ku munaane changwa ekumi, agaluka eKayizariya. Olusiku lwakulikiraga, ayikala oku ntebe yaage y'oguchiira eshinja, n'ogurhegeka baleerhe Paawulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Paawulo abeere ahika, aBayaahudi barhengaga eYerusaleema, bamuzunguluka n'okumusidakira mabi malemereere manene. Aliko bagambwa kuyeerekana oku mali m'okuli. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Paawulo aja abuurana n'okuderha ntya: «Nyoono, nta chibi najirire elugulu w'eRhegeko ly'aBayaahudi changwa elugulu w'eNju ya Nnamahanga, changwa n'elugulu wa mwami mukulu Kayizaari.»<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Fesito ashonda gusimiisa aBayaahudi, abaza Paawulo ntya: «K'oshondere oje eYerusaleema, ochiirwe yo olushinja embere zaani kw'ebyoola byooshi?» <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paawulo ashubiza ntya: «Nyimangire omu kabuga ka mwami mukulu Kayizaari na hanoola ha nkwaneene guchiirwa olushinja. Nta chibi n'echiguma najiriire aBayaahudi nk'okuula wooyo wenyine obiyinji bwinja. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Akaba najirire echijiro girhakwaneene, gihemere oku nyirhwe, nyemereere ogufa. Aliko akaba ebinwa aBayaahudi bansidakiire birhali by'okuli, ntaaye ogwerhe obuhashe b'okumpira omu maboko maabo. Nyoono, nahema olushinja lwani luchiibwe na mwami mukulu Kayizaari.» <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Fesito ayuusize kuja mahwe n'abashamuka baage, aja ashubiza Paawulo ntya: «Wahemere oku olushinja lwawe luchiibwe na mwami mukulu Kayizaari, waaja guchiirwa lo naye.»<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">oMurhegesi Fesito abalira mwami Agiripa elugulu wa Paawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Hagereere siku zigeeke, mwami Agiripa haguma na mwali waabo oyirikwa Berenike, baahika eKayizariya kulamusa Fesito. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Babeere bajira yo siku zinene, Fesito abalira mwami Agiripa emyaazi y'olushinja lwa Paawulo. Amubwira ntya: «Hanoola, hali mulume muguma Feliiki alekere omu munyororo. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Amango najaaga eYerusaleema, abakulu b'abadaahwa n'abashamuka b'aBayaahudi bamusidaaka, banampema oku muhaane. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Naani nabashubiza oku omu migenzo y'aBarooma, omuntu arhahanwa embere z'okubuurana n'abantu bamusidaakire, n'okubuurana yenyine elugulu w'ebyasidakiirwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Baaja bayinja hano haguma naani. Olusiku lwakulikiraga, buzira guheza ebishanji, nayikala oku ntebe y'oguchiira ko olushinja n'ogurhegeka baleerhe oyoola mulume. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Babeere bamuleerha, abamusidaakire bayimanga n'ogurhondera kumulega. Aliko nta chijiro chiguma chibi bamulegere ko, nk'oku nalikengeerere. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Aliko baliiri bajira obuhaka haguma naye elugulu w'edini lyaabo lyonyine, n'elugulu w'omuntu muguma wafiire oyirikwa Yeesu. Paawulo yeewe aliiri aderha oku oyoola muntu afuukire. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Oku bwani, ntamenyaga gurhe nagacha olushinja luli nk'olu. Naja nabaza Paawulo akaba ashondere kuja eYerusaleema y'olushinja lwage luchiirwe yo. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Aliko Paawulo ahemere oku olushinja lwage luchiibwe na mwami mukulu Kayizaari. Naja narhegeka oku bamulange omu munyororo guhika amango nji namurhuma emwa Kayizaari.» <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Mwami Agiripa abwira Fesito ntya: «Naani nagashondere nyunviirize oyoola mulume.» Fesito amushubiza ntya: «Wamuyunviiriza omuseezi.»<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga, Agiripa na Berenike bayinja n'obukuuze bunene. Baaja omu nju bachiira mo eshinja haguma n'abakulu b'engabo z'abasoda, n'abandi balume bakengwa b'omu gishagala. Fesito arhegeka oku baleerhe Paawulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fesito aja aderha ntya: «Mwami Agiripa nenyu mweshi mwe muli haguma neerhu hanoola, mubwene oyuula mulume! aBayaahudi booshi bamusidakiire emwani, eYerusaleema na hano Kayizariya. Baliiri baderha n'omulenge munene oku arhagikwaneene kulama. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Si nyoono, nabona oku ntaacho ajirire gikwaneene olufu. Aliko yeewe ahema oku olushinja lwage luje guchiibwa na mwami mukulu Kayizaari eyo Rooma. Naja nahiga kumurhumira ye. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Aliko naani nyenyine, nta chinwa ngwerhe ch'okuli nakayandikira mwami mukulu. Cho girhumire namuleerha embere zenyu na bweneene embere zaawe mwami Agiripa. Leero hano rhuyuusa kumubuuranya, nkaba nabona echinwa nayandika elugulu waage. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Kwenge nyoono mbwene oku gurhali kwinja ogurhuma omushwekwa eRooma buzira kuyeerekana bwinjabwinja ebirhumire asidaakwa.»<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Emburano za Paawulo embere za mwami Agiripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Mwami Agiripa abwira Paawulo ntya: «Oyemeererwe guchibuuranira.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:1">Paawulo alambuula okuboko, n'ogurhondera kubuurana ntya: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />«Mwami Agiripa, nshagalukire bweneene zeene, okubona nyimangire embere zaawe yi nchibuuranire elugulu w'ebinwa byooshi aBayaahudi bansidaakire ko. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Kwenge waliha, wooyo wenyine oyinji bwinja emigenzo yooshi y'aBayaahudi n'obuhaka bwabo booshi. Nkuyingingire waliha, onyunviirize buzira kuluha.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />«aBayaahudi booshi bayinji gurhe nalamire akalamo kaani gurhengera ndi mwana omu gihugo chaani n'omu gishagala ch'eYerusaleema. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Banyinji gurhengera miira, n'akaba bashondere, bakanahamiiriza oku nakulikiraga emigenzo yooshi y'echigusho ch'<char style="w" lemma="Bafarisaayo:">aBafarisaayo</char>. Abo Bafarisaayo bo banagihangaana looshi gukulikira amarhegeko mooshi m'edini ly'ekiyaahudi, kulusha abandi booshi. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Leero zeene ndi nachiirwa olushinja, bulaala nahirire obulangaalire bwani omu chilagaane Nnamahanga alaganyaga bashookuluza beerhu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Chiro n'abantu b'emilala yeerhu ekumi n'ebiri, nabo balangaliire oku Nnamahanga abayeenezeza echiila chilagaane. Cho girhumire bali bamukolera n'obushiru obudufu n'ezuuba. Waliha mwami, oboola bulangaalire bo burhumire aBayaahudi bansidaka zeene! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Girhumire mwabo mwakengeera oku birhagalikeene Nnamahanga afuule abafu?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:1-2">Bijiro 9.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:3-5">22.3-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />«Chiro naani nyenyine, nankengeera oku bimpemere nkoleese enjira zooshi, omu kulwisa eziino lya Yeesu w'eNazareeti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Ebyoola binajiraga eYerusaleema. Nabeere nahabwa obuhashe gurhenga emw'abakulu b'abadaahwa, nahira abemeezi banene omu munyororo. N'amango babayirhaga, naani naliyemeere oku balikwaneene kuyirhwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Nalemaga naaja omu masinagoogi mooshi kubahana n'okubaseeza badukange eziino lya Yeesu. N'elugulu w'ogukaliha bweneene, nagendaga naaja kubalibuza n'omu bindi bishagala bya hale.»<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo abala elugulu w'oguchungulwa kwage</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:3-19">Bijiro 9.3-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-15">22.6-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Paawulo ashuba kuderha ntya: «Lusiku luguma naliiri omu njira, eyi ndi naaja kulibuza abemeezi omu gishagala ch'eDamasiki, gukulikirana n'obuhashe n'amarhegeko m'abakulu b'abadaahwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Waliha mwami, yabeere midi eyi ndi mw'eyoola njira, nabona obumoleke bwarhenga empingu. Bwali bumolekere kulusha obw'ezuuba. Bwanangorha n'abeerhu baliiri haguma naani omu lungenzi. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Rhweshi rhwahenera ahashi. Nayunva omulenge omu lulimi lw'eGiheburaniya gwambwira ntya: ‹Saawulo, Saawulo, girhumire wandibuza? Oli wachiilibuza busha kulaala enka eshuurhanga olubaale oku songi ly'enkoni y'omungere wa yo!› <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Naja nabaza ntya: ‹Nnaweerhu, wooyo oli nde?› Naye ashubiza ntya: ‹Nyoono, ndi Yeesu, oli walibuza. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Aliko yuumuka, oyimange! Nakubonekeere bulaala nashonda nkujire obe mukozi waani, onagende wahamiiriza ebi wabwene ko zeene n'ebindi nashuba gukuyeereka. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Nalema nagukuula omu maboko m'abenyu Bayaahudi, n'omu m'abantu barhali Bayaahudi. Nagurhuma oku bo, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />y'ozibuula ameesho maabo, barhenge omu mwizimya n'okuja omu bumoleke, banarhenge omu buhashe bwa Shetaani, n'oguhindamukira Nnamahanga. Omu kunyemeera, bababalirwa ebyaaha byaabo n'okuba haguma n'abandi booshi achishogere.›»<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo abala elugulu w'akaasi kaage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Paawulo ashuba kuderha ntya: «Cho girhumire, waliha mwami Agiripa, ntalekaga gukenga ebi nabonekerwaga gurhenga empingu. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Aliko, narhanga kubalira abantu b'eDamasiki oku baleke ebyaaha byaabo, banahindamukire Nnamahanga omu kujira ebijiro biyerekeene oku balekere ebyaaha byaabo. Enyuma nashuba kubalira abantu b'egishala ch'eYerusaleema, n'abantu b'ebindi bishagala byooshi by'eYudeeya n'abarhali Bayaahudi ezoola nyigirizo. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ebyoola byo byarhumaga aBayaahudi banfarhira omu Nju ya Nnamahanga, n'ogushonda kunyirha. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Aliko Nnamahanga andangire guhika oku lusiku lwa zeene. Echoola cho girhumire nahamiiriza embere z'abantu bakulu n'abadoorho. Nta yindi myaazi naderhere erhali elaala abaleebi na Muusa baabalaga oku nji yaaba. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Aba booshi, baderhere oku Kirisitu alikwaneene alibuke, anabe murhanzi gufuuka omu bafu. Ntyo, nj'abala enjira y'obuchunguke oku lubaga lw'aBayaahudi n'oku barhali Bayaahudi, bagale kulama omu bumoleke.»<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo ashonda mwami Agiripa ayemeere Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Amango Paawulo abaaga achiri abuurana, Fesito amubwira ntya n'omulenge munene: «Paawulo, wasirehere! Amasomo manene wasomere makujirire musire!» <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Paawulo amushubiza ntya: «Waliha Fesito, ntali musire. Emyaazi ndi naaderha eri y'okuli enali y'akamaro. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Chiro mwami Agiripa ayinji bwinja eyoola myaazi yooshi. Cho girhumire namubwira yo buzira buuba, bulaala menyere bwinja oku nta mwazi n'omuguma arhenji omu yo. Ebyoola byooshi birhajirikaga omu bwibisho. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Mwami Agiripa, k'onayemeera ebinwa by'abaleebi? Nyinji bwinja oku onabiyemeera!» <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agiripa abwira Paawulo ntya: «Okengereere oku wanyemeeza kuba mukirisitu omu bishanji bigeeke!» <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paawulo ashubiza ntya: «Bibe bigeeke, bibe binene, mpemere Nnamahanga, wooyo n'abenyu booshi bali banyunviiriza zeene, mube nka kunoola nyoono ndi, aliko buzira gushwekwa n'amaala malegule!»<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Abeere aderha ntyo, mwami Agiripa, omurhegesi Fesito, Berenike na booshi baliiri ahoola, bayimanga. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Baaja mahwe n'ogurhondera kubwirana ntya: «Oyuula muntu ntaacho ajirire chagarhuma ahanirwa olufu changwa ogushwekwa omu munyororo.» <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Mwami Agiripa abwira omurhegesi Fesito ntya: «Byagahemere oyuula mulume ashwekuulwe nk'arhahemaga oku olushinja lwage luchiibwe na mwami mukulu Kayizaari.»<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Paawulo aja kubuuranira eRooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Babeere barhoola omuhigo g'ogurhuheeka eItaliya omu chombo, bahira Paawulo haguma n'abandi bashwekwa omu bulanzi b'omukulu w'abasoda oyirikwa Yuliyo. Aliiri w'omu chigusho chiyirikwa «Chigusho ch'abasoda ba mwami mukulu Kayizaari.» <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Rhwava rhwaja omu chombo chaliiri charhenga omu gishagala ch'eAdiramiti, rhwasuka. Rhwaliiri rhwabalama haguma n'omuburhwa muguma w'omu gihugo ch'eMakedoniya oyirikwa Arisitariko, w'omu gishagala ch'eTesalonika. Echo chombo, chaliiri chaja omu bishangala by'egihugo ch'eAziya biri eburhambi bw'enyanja. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga, rhwasiika omu gishagala ch'eSidoona. Yuliyo waliiri ajirira Paawulo amenja, amuyemeerera aje kubonana n'abeera baage yi bamuheereza byooshi alagire ko. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Omu gurhenga eSidoona, rhwabarabanya oku chizimba ch'eGipuro, emunda omulaba gurhalikalihire, bulaala gwaliiri gwahulukira embere zerhu. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Rhwayambuka enyanja oku lunda lw'egihugo ch'eKilikiya n'eche Pamfiliya. Rhwanahika omu gishagala ch'eMira ch'omu gihugo ch'eLikiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Eyo munda, oyo mukulu w'abasoda abona echombo chaliiri charhenga omu gishagala ch'eAlegizanduriya, eyi chiri chaaja omu gihugo ch'eItaliya. Arhushoneza mo rhweshi.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Rhwamala siku zinene oku nyanja, kwenge rhwaliiri rhwagenda kubuyaabuya. Enyuma z'amalibuko maneene, rhwahika hoofu n'egishagala ch'eKinido. Omu gurhenga eyo, rhwayeerekeza eSalimone. Rhwagera olunda lw'egarhongo k'echizimba ch'eKerete, bulaala omulaba gwaliiri gwarhuhuluka embere. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Rhwagendeerera kugera eburhambirhambi bw'echo chizimba omu malibuko manene. Rhwahika hantu haguma hayirikwa «Siiko Zinja», hoofu n'egishagala ch'eLaseya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Elugulu w'okumala siku zinene oku nyanja, rhwahika omu gihe chidarhabeere n'olusiku l'oguchibuza kulya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Olusiku l'oguchibuza kulya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">k'okuderha olusiku l'oguhema obubabale (Osome Balaawi 16.29-30). Omu chiganikiro ch'ebihe ch'aBayaahudi, olo lusiku lwaliiri omu mwezi gwa mwenda changwa gw'ekumi. Enyuma z'aho, byaliiri bidaarhi bweneene kubalama oku nyanja gukulikarana n'omulaba munene.</char></note> lwaliiri lwagerere. Paawulo ava arhuhanuula omu kuderha ntya: <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />«Beene beerhu, mbwene oku luno lugenzi lwadarhabaala. Rhwaheza binene, arhali mizigo yonyine sy'aliko n'echombo, chiro n'akalamo keerhu.» <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Aliko oyo mukulu w'abasoda akulikira ebinwa bya kapiteeni n'ebya nyina echombo, sy'arhakulikiraga ebinwa bya Paawulo. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Okubona okw'eyo siiko erhaliiri nyinja amango m'emboho ekalihire, abantu banene omu chombo bayunviikana oku barhenge eyo munda, balole akaba byagalika bahike oku siiko eyirikwa Foyiniki n'okugeza ebishanji by'emboho ekalihire eyo munda. Eyoola siiko y'eFoyiniki erhuula oku chizimba ch'eKerete, eyerekeere olunda lw'ebuzikiro bw'ezuuba.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omulaba omu nyanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Enyuma z'aho agahuusi gahuusahuusa gurhengerera egarhongo. Banyina echombo bakengera oku bamabona enjira y'okugendeerera n'olugenzi lwabo nk'oku balirheganyize. Bakulula enanga, babarabanya oku chizimba ch'eKerete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Enyuma w'ebishanji bigeeke, mw'echo chizimba mwahulukira omuyaga munene g'omulaba gukalihire guyirikwa Ehurakilo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ehurakilo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">guli muyaga guhulukira emalambo kuja ebuzikiro bw'ezuuba.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Ogo muyaga gwaheka echombo, nacho chirhagalaga kugulwiisa. Rhwava rhwachileka chihekwe n'omulaba oku muhengere emunda gushondere. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Rhwagera olunda lw'egarhongo k'echizimba chigeeke chiyiirikirwe Kauda, charhulanga bugeeke kw'ogola muyaga. Oku malibuko manene, rhwashweka bweneene obwarho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Echombo chaligwerhe obwarho b'ogurhabaala omu egihe ch'amazibu oku nyanja.</char></note> oku chombo yi burhahehwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Abakozi b'omu chombo babeere barhalulira obo bwarho omu chombo, baseza echombo omu kugishweka n'emikaba. Na kwenge baliyubahire oku echombo chagarhaliira omu mushenyi gw'eSiriti, barhoza egihirho chiyimanza bugeeke echombo, banaleka echombo gihehwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Olusiku lwakulikiraga, omulaba gwagendeerera gushuurhashuurha bweneene echombo. Echo charhuma abo bakozi barhondera kuroha emizigo omu nyanja. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Olusiku lwa gasharhu, bakabulanga bonyine ebikoleso by'echombo. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Esiku zinene zagera buzira kubona ezuuba changwa enyenyeezi. Omulaba nago gwagendeerera bweneene. Oku buzinda, rhwaheza obulangaalire bw'okulama.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Abantu babaaga bamaamala siku zinene buzira kulya kantu. Paawulo ava ayimanga ahagarhi kaabo n'okubabwira ntya: «Beera baani, nka mwakulikiraga ehano lyaani ly'ogurharhenga eKerete, rhurhakabwene ama malibuko mooshi changwa guheza ebi bintu. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Aliko bunoola, mbahemere museeze emirhima, bulaala ntaaye ahagarhi kenyu waafa, sy'aliko echombo chonyine chashenyagulika. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Nderhere ntya, kwenge malahika wa Nnamahanga, ola nyoono ndi waage n'ola nkolera, alimbonekere omu budufu bwa zeene. <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />Amanambwira ntya: ‹Orhayubahaga Paawulo! Bihemeere obuurane embere za mwami mukulu Kayizaari. Na kandi, byasimiisize Nnamahanga kugukolera amenja. Yeewe achungula akalamo k'abaala bantu booshi bali babalama haguma naawe.› <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Cho girhumire beera baani, museeze omurhima, bulaala ndangaliire oku byajirika nk'oku Nnamahanga ambwiraga. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Aliko, bihemere echombo chije gurhaliira oku chizimba chiguma.»<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Rhwamala siku ekumi n'ene, rhuli rhwaheekwa eyi n'eyi n'omulaba oku nyanja y'eAdiriya. Ahagarhi kw'obudufu, abakozi b'omu chombo bakengera oku rhuli hoofu n'emushengo. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Bachimiza olugero omu menji. Gurhenga enyanya guhika oku nege, baabona metere makumi mane. Rhwabeere rhwashegera ahambere bugeeke, baashuba guchimya olugero omu menji, baabona metere makumi masharhu. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Barhoza enanga ene z'ebwerekeza omu guchifiija obudufu buche, kwenge baliiri bayuubaha oku echombo chagarhaliira oku ntaza. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Abakozi b'omu chombo bashonda kuyongoloka. Kw'arhuma baja bayandagaziza obwarho omu menji. Banachijirisa nka bali bashweka enanga z'emulemo. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Paawulo aja abwira ola mukulu w'abasoda haguma n'abasoda baage ntya: «Aba bantu bagarhenga mu chino chombo, mumenye oku nenyu murhagafuma kuzika!» <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Okoola kw'arhuma abasoda bacha emikaba yalishwekere obo bwarho, banabuleka buhehwe oku nyanja.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Yabeere emiseke, Paawulo ayinginga abantu booshi balye ebiryo. Ababwira ntya: «Zeene, siku ekumi n'ene zamagera eyi mugwerhe obuuba, na buzira kulya kantu. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Leero mbayingingire mulye ebiryo yi murhafa n'enzara. Kwenge ntaaye ahagarhi kenyu waheza chiro n'oluviiri luguma l'oku rhwe lyaage.» <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Enyuma z'okuderha ebyo binwa, Paawulo arhoola omugati, akuuza Nnamahanga embere zaabo booshi. Aguchagulanga n'ogurhondera kulya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Booshi baava bachiseeza omurhima, banarhondera kulya ebiryo. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Mw'echo chombo, rhwaliiri mo bantu magana mabiri na makumi gali mushanvu na ndarhu. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Abantu booshi babeere bayuugurha, baroha emizigo y'engano omu nyanja omu kuyanguhya echombo.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogushenyaguka kw'echombo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Bwabeere bwacha, abakozi b'omu chombo balangira eshi, aliko barharhegeeraga echo gihugo. Babona akagobe kali k'omushenyi. Baava bahiga kuja gurhaliiriza yo echombo, akaba byakagalika. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Baacha emigozi yalishwekere enanga, banazileka zizike omu nyanja. Banashunula emigozi yalishwekere ziiri nka ngasi zizibuuzibu zaliiri zayeerekeza echombo. Oku buzinda, bazamuula omwenda gw'embere y'omuhuusi guheeke echombo, banayeerekera mw'ogo mushengo g'omushenyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Aliko babeere bayegeera ahambere bugeeke, echombo charhaliira omu chilundo ch'omushenyi, girhagachigalire guchishaganya. Omulemo gwazikira mo, n'ebivundu by'omulaba byashenyagula obwerekeza.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Abasoda bahiga kuyirha abashwekwa booshi, yi ntaaye n'omuguma mubo oyongolokage omu kuyooga. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Aliko, omukulu w'abasoda alishondere kufumya Paawulo. Abuza abasoda barhajiraga ntyo. Arhegeka oku abayinji kuyooga, babe barhanzi guchikabula omu nyanja, bayooge banayoomokere emushengo. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />N'abandi babakulikire, eyi bagwarhiriize oku mpaho changwa oku bisharhe by'echombo. Ntyo kw'abantu booshi bahikaga emushengo eyi bali bagumaguma.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Paawulo oku chizimba ch'eMelita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Rhwabeere rhwafuma olufu, rhwaja rhwamenya okw'echo chizimba rhwaliiri ko, chiyirikirwe Melita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Abantu b'eyo, barhujirira amenja manene. Barhuchaanira omuliro banarhuyegeereza rhweshi oku rhukaluuke, bulaala emboho yaliiri n'envula yabaaga eri yarhoga. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paawulo arhoola eshaali. Abeere ali azihira omu ziiko, enjoka yarhenga mu zila shaali elugulu w'egikangiira, yachizingira oku kuboko kwage. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Abantu b'echo chizimba babeere baabona eyoola njoka yananaabire oku kuboko kwage, babwirana ntya: «Okuli oyu muntu ali mwisi w'abantu. Chiro akaba afumire olufu lw'enyanja, emaana yeerhu eyirikwa Okuli erhamuleka alame.» <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Aliko Paawulo akunguurhira eyo njoka omu lila ziiko, na ntaako abeere. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Abo bantu, baloleereza akaba Paawulo arhunda omubiri changwa akumbagala n'ogufa ho n'aho. Balingiriza bishanji binene. Babeere baabona oku ntaako abeere, bahindamula emiganiize yaabo, banarhondera kuderha oku ali muguma w'omu maana.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul secout le serpent dans le feu" file="CN02052B.TIF" size="col" ref="28.6">Paawulo akungurhira enjoka omu muliro</figure><verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo afumya eshe w'omukulu w'echizimba ch'eMelita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Hoofu n'ahoola, haliiri amashwa m'omukulu w'echo chizimba oyirikwa Pubuliyo. Oyo mukulu arhuyankirira bwinja omu mwage, rhwamala mo siku esharhu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Amo mango, eshe wa Pubuliyo alilyaamire oku buliri kwenge alilwere endwala y'eshuushira n'omukunguru. Paawulo aja kumulola, amusaliirira, anamulambuulira kw'amaboko, naye amufumya. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Echo charuma abandi balwala booshi baliiri kw'echo chizimba, baalema bashimba Paawulo, naye alema abafumya. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Abantu b'ahoola barhukenga bweneene. Rhwabeere rhuli hoofu kugendeerera n'olugenzi oku nyanja, barhuha ebintu byooshi rhwalikeneere.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo ahika eRooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Rhwabeere rhwamala myeezi esharhu oku chizimba ch'eMelita, rhwabalama n'echombo chiguma chalisikiire kw'echo chizimba. Chaliiri chalinga esiku z'emboho zirhange zigere. Echo chombo, charhengereraga eAlegizanduriya. Babaaga bachapire ko ebishushanyo by'emaana z'amahasha.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">eMaana z'amahasha </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aBagiriki baliiri baharamya emaana z'amahasha ziyirikwa Kasito na Poluki. Abakozi bw'omu byombo baliiri babona oku ezi maana ziri balanzi baabo.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Rhwahikire omu gishagala ch'eSirakuse, rhwabeera mo siku esharhu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Omu gurhenga mw'echo gishagala, rhwasuka n'okugenda rhwabarabanya guhika omu gishagala ch'eRegiyo. Olusiku lwakulikiraga, omuyaga g'ogurhengerera egarhongo gwaja omu nyanja. Olwindi lusiku lwakulikiraga, rhwahika omu gishagala ch'ePuteyoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Rhwahikire yo, rhwabugana abemeezi, nabo barhuyinginga mpu rhubeere nabo siku mushanvu. Ntyo ku rhwajiire eRooma.<verse eid="ACT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Abemeezi b'eRooma babeere bayunva oku rhuli omu njira y'okuja emwabo, baguma bayinja gurhulingira omu gishagala chiyirikwa Soko ly'eApiyo, n'abandi omu gishagala chiyirikwa Nju eSharhu z'aBahiisi. Paawulo abeere ababona, akuuza Nnamahanga, buzinda anashuba guseezwa omurhima. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Rhwabeere rhwahika eRooma, bayemeerera Paawulo ahande yenyine. Banamuha omusoda w'okumulanga.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paawulo ayaalagaza Yeesu oku bantu b'eRooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Hagerere siku esharhu, Paawulo ahamagaza abakulu b'aBayaahudi balilamire eyo munda. Babeere babugaanana, ababwira ntya: «Bene beerhu, nyoono nalishwekerwe eYerusaleema, nanahirwa omu maboko m'aBarooma noobo nta chibi najiriire olubaga lwerhu changwa okuvuna emicho yabashookuluza beerhu. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Abo Barooma babeere bambuuranya, bashonda kunshwekuula bulaala barhambonaga ko obubi bwalihemerwe nyirhwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Aliko okubona aBayaahudi barhayemeeraga mpu ndikulwe, kw'arhuma nahema kuja eno Rooma, kubuuranira embere za mwami mukulu Kayizaari. Na mw'ebi byooshi, nta chintu naligwerhe ch'ogusidaaka olubaga lwani. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Echoola, cho girhumire mbahamageere, rhubonane rhunaganiire haguma. Mumenye oku nyoono nshwekeerwe hano, bulaala nyemereere obulangaalire bw'aBaisraheeli booshi.»<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Abo bakulu b'aBayaahudi baava bamubwira ntya: «Rhwabo nta maruba rhwayankirire gurhengera eYudeeya, changwa omwemeezi gurhenga eyo, wahikire eno gurhubalira n'okuderha omwazi mubi elugulu waawe. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Aliko, neerhu rhwagasiimire kuyunviiriza emiganiize yaawe, bulaala rhuyinji oku ngasi hooshi, abantu banaderha kubi eli dini lyaawe okulikiire.»<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Abo bakulu baava bayunviikana na Paawulo olusiku baashuba gushimaanana. N'oloola lusiku, bantu banene bweneene bahika aha Paawulo alihandire. Gurhengera eseezi guhika egolo, ayigiriza ebinwa binene n'okubabalira obuhamiriza elugulu w'obwime bwa Nnamahanga. Paawulo alishondere bayemeere Yeesu. Aliiri kubayeereka emyaazi ederhere elugulu wa Yeesu, eyandikirwe omu Rhegeko lya Muusa n'ebitaabu by'abaleebi. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Eyoola myaazi Paawulo aderhaga, baguma bayiyemeera, aliko abandi barhayiyemeeraga. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Babeere barhayunvikene, bashonda bagaluke. Paawulo ashuba kubabwira chino chinwa chiguma: «Muuka-Mutagatiifu aliderhere okuli oku bashokuluuza benyu kugerera omuleebi Isaya. <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Kwenge alimubwirire ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">‹Ogende emw'aba bantu, onababwire ntya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">“Okuyunva mwayunva, aliko murhaamenya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Okulola mwalola, aliko murharhegeera.”<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Bulaala emirhima y'aba bantu yabeere mizibu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Bafukire amarhwi maabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">banazibize ameesho maabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Nk'arhaliiri ntyo, ameesho maabo makabwene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">n'amarhwi maabo, makayunviirhe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">n'emirhima yaabo, yagarhegereere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">bakanahindamukire emwani, naani nakabafumize.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.26-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Osome <ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isaya 6.9-10</ref>.</char></note>»<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Paawulo ashuba kubabwira ntya: «Leero, mumenyage oku emyaazi y'obu buchunguke bwa Nnamahanga, yamayaalagazwa oku barhali Bayaahudi. Boowe, bayiyunviiriza!» [<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Abeere amala kuderha eyi myaazi, abo Bayaahudi bagenda eyi bali bajiriisanya obuhaka bunene.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olu lukere lurhali omu bitaabu biguma bya miira. </char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Paawulo ahanda myaaka ebiri mw'eyoola nju ahaanaga kw'efuranga yenyine. Aliiri ayankirira abahiisi booshi baliiri bayinja kumulola. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Aliiri abala emyaazi y'obwami bwa Nnamahanga, n'okuyigiriza abantu elugulu wa Nnaweerhu Yeesu Kirisitu buzira buuba na buzira kubuzwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>